rTeam Rocket is a group of criminals who steal Pokémon."D\bYou want to know about the two kinds of caterpillar Pokémon?"/\bCaterpie has no poison, but Weedle does."H\bWatch that your Pokémon aren't stabbed by Weedle's Poison Sting."\bOh, okay then."\rzzz."\rWant to learn Snore?"E\rThose Poké Balls at your waist! You have Pokémon, don't you?"H\rIt's great that you can carry and use Pokémon anytime, anywhere."^\bWelcome to Viridian City. Be sure to head to the Pokémon Center to heal your Pokémon."$\bThe Gym Leader has come back."'\bWhat will we do without our Gym?"\bOur Gym has returned!"Yes"No0000Iu;␀�H[[�"1\bOak: Come here and get your Pokédex, \PN."5\bOak: Wait, don't forget your starter Pokémon!"'\bOak: Wait, don't forget Pikachu!"[SYSTEM ACTIVATING.......]"[WARNING! WARNING!]"Teleport?"f\bHey, surprise surprise! \PN! I'm Hitsukid, you must have gotten the secret edition of Fire Ash."n\bThis means you have access to secret content made by yours truly. Wahahaha. Alrighty, back to business."Z\bBasically, we are in a Multiverse. And no, we are not gonna meet Tony Stark, silly."j\bWe are in the Anime-verse, per se. And we have three Quantum Transporters here to other dimensions."�\bI believe the destinations include Manga-verse and Game-verse. Watch out though, I am sensing tenacious vibes through those devices."a\bSeems like great challenges for you to overcome... but you have been warned. ALL THE BEST!"@\bOak: Ah \PN, how is it going? Is your Pikachu doing well?"$\bOak: If you want it, take it."3\bOak: Ah \PN, you got the GS ball didn't you?"+\bGood good. Let me have a look at it.":\bHmm. I can't seem to figure out what to do with it."O\b\PN, can I ask you to hold on to it a little longer and take it to Kurt?"|\bHe lives in Azalea Town in the Johto region. The fastest way there should be on Route 22. It's near the Kanto League."`\bOak: The fastest way to the Johto region is through Route 22. It's near the Kanto League."I\bOak: Ah, hello \PN. I heard you did well in the Silver Conference."�\bGary decided to head off to Hoenn to do some research. It seems like a lovely place for you to go if you want a new challenge."n\bHead to Vermilion City. I'll tell the captain you are coming. There is a ship that will take you there."@\bAlso, speak to my aide downstairs. He has a gift for you."U\bAnd last but not least, your mother has some new clothes for you. Here you go."l\bThey look spendid. If you'd prefer your old ones though you can change with the dresser in your room."v\bOak: Head to Vermilion City. I'll tell the captain you are coming. There is a ship that will take you to Hoenn."N\bOak: Ah, hello \PN. I heard you did well in the Ever Grande Conference."�\bIt's good timing too since the Battle Frontier just opened up right here in Kanto! The first one I would recommend is the Battle Factory near Cerulean City."@\bOak: Head to Cerulean City to battle the Battle Frontier."@\bOak: Ah, hello \PN. So you beat the Battle Frontier then?"u\bYou're thinking about the Sinnoh region? I'll set up a ride for you. Like always, head over to Vermilion City."1\bAnd once again, here are some new clothes.";\bOak: Head to Vermilion City to get a ride to Sinnoh."=\bOak: Ah, hello \PN. So you finished the Sinnoh League."n\bI saw you did quite well. I'm sure you're ready for your next challenge. Why not head to Unova with me?"I\bHead over to Viridian City. A blimp will be there to take us over."O\bAnd as I'm sure you guessed by now your mother has a new outfit for you."N\bOak: Head over to Viridian City. A blimp will be there to take us over."j\bOak: The Unova League sounds like a good challenge for you. I look forward to hearing your results.";This ball contains a Pokémon caught by the Professor.">\bOak: So, you want Pikachu, the Electric mouse Pokémon?"M\bOak: Unfortunately, it is the only one left, so I suggest you take it."\bPikachu":Pikachu started to follow you.\se[itemlevel]\wtnp[20]"DGary: Pallet Town\n Paul: Veilstone City\n Barry: Twinleaf Town"OTrip: Nuvema Town\n Alain: Professor Sycamore's Lab\n Sawyer: Lumiose City".Gladion: Hau'oli City\n Hau: Tapu Village"EMisty: Cerulean City\n Brock: Pewter City\n Tracey: Oak's Corral",May: Goldenrod City\n Dawn: Eterna City"/Iris: Opelucid City\n Cilan: Striaton City"2Clemont: Lumiose City\n Serena: Lilycove City".Lana: Hau'oli City\n Kiawe: Ruins of Life"MMallow: Hau'oli City\n Sophocles: Pokémon School\n Lillie: Hau'oli City"Goh: Cerise Park"\PN received a Pokédex!"!You already have a Pokédex."Rotom!!"{\bHello \PN. I've managed to make a machine that captures the essence of powerful Trainers from a different dimension."L\bThey are called 'Pokédex holders'. Feel free to try the machine out."\bOak: \PN, you're late. All of the starter Pokémon have been taken. ...Well there is one left, but it is a bit reckless."D\bOak: It seems Pikachu doesn't like to stay in its Poké Ball.",\bOak: Charmander, an excellent choice!"*\bOak: Squirtle, an excellent choice!";\bDon't forget to take your Pokédex before you leave." [SYSTEM ACTIVATING........]"[DANGER! DANGER!]"�Teleport?\ch[1,1,Red,Blue,Green,Yellow,Gold,Silver, Crystal,Ruby,Sapphire,Emerald,Diamond,Pearl,Platinum, Black,White,Blake,Whitley,X,Y,Sun,Moon,Henry,Casey,No]",This place...appears to be Pallet Town."1This place...appears to be the Viridian Gym."3This place...appears to be the Indigo Plateau."0This place...appears to be Viridian Forest.".This place...appears to be New Bark Town.".This place...appears to be Viridian City.".This place...appears to be Ecruteak City."/This place...appears to be Slateport City."0This place...appears to be Littleroot Town."1This place...appears to be the Battle Tower.",This place...appears to be Iron Island.".This place...appears to be Pastoria City.",This place...appears to be Mt. Coronet.":This place...appears to be the Unova Pokémon League."-This place...appears to be Nimbasa City."-This place...appears to be Virbank City.".This place...appears to be Aspertia City.".This place...appears to be Geosenge Town."-This place...appears to be Shalour City.")This place...appears to be Iki Town."0This place...appears to be Aether Paradise."-This place...appears to be Tower Summit."1This place...appears to be Slumbering Weald."~\bOak: I'm not sure what else there is for you to do, \PN. I would say you've made huge strides to becoming a Pokémon Master."�\bYou could seek out the friends you've met along the way. They may want to see you again. I have a list of the places where they are somewhere around here."M\bThere is also a battle hall in Driftveil City that might interest you."5\bWhat's that? You want me to see your Pokédex?"\bHmm... I see..."7\bWow! Well done on completeing the Pokédex, \PN!"\bHere's a reward."q\bRemeber \PN, your adventure doesn't end here. There's still so much for you to explore in this vast world!"O\bOak: I hear you've beaten the Unova region as well. Wonderful work, \PN."C\bHave you met Rotom yet? I caught it in the Decolore Islands."|\bWhere's that at? Oh, it's a horrible place. I wouldn't want to make you suffer the trip. I only went to find a Rotom."x\bYou plan on going to the Kalos region next? Excellent idea. I heard of a mysterious power coming from the region."J\bHead over to Viridian City. A blimp will be there to take you over."1\bOh, and let's not forget your new clothes."O\bOak: Head over to Viridian City. A blimp will be there to take you over."J\bOak: I hear you've beaten the Kalos region as well. Wonderful work."S\bIt's also wonderful timing. Your mother just won a trip to the Alola region."g\bI also have this egg that I need to deliver to my cousin Samson. Give it to him when you arrive."'\bWait. Don't forget your clothes."&\bOak: Go speak with your mother."1\bOak: Shouldn't you be in school right now?"c\bOak: Excellent work on becoming the Champion of Alola, \PN. It was quite the exciting match."z\bI'm sorry to cut this meeting short, but a new Professor is opening a lab in Vermilion City and I agreed to attend."l\bI know! Why don't you join me? Well then, it's settled. Your mother and I will meet you in Vermilion."�\bNaturally, your mother left you some clothes here. She was worried you'd be in such a rush to see your Pokémon that you'd forget to stop home."9\bOak: Your mother and I will meet you in Vermilion."?\bOak: Hello \PN. How is it working with Professor Cerise?"b\bOak: Hello \PN. How is it working with Professor Cerise? Is Project Mew going well for Goh?"?\bOak: Hello \PN. The surprise I have for you is out back."u\bOak: Hello \PN. How did your meeting go with Paul? Did he mention he recieved an offer to become a Gym Leader?"7\bOak: Excellent job on becoming the Monarch, \PN."W\bOak: Come back after another journey, have you? It's always a pleasant surprise."�\bYou've accomplished so much since you first met Pikachu. The bonds you've made, the regions you've explored, and the friends and Pokémon too."�\bYou've never stopped growing as a Trainer, and I doubt you have any intention on quitting now. The road to becoming a Pokémon Master is a long one."y\bI'm truly proud of you, \PN. I wish you luck in your next journey. And know that you're always welcomed back home."Yes"No[�"7\bEich: Komm her und hol dir deinen Pokédex, \PN."8\bEich: Warte, vergiss dein Starter-Pokémon nicht!"*\bEich: Warte, vergiss Pikachu nicht!"[SYSTEM AKTIVIERT.......]"[WARNUNG! WARNUNG!]"Teleportieren?"i\bHey, Überraschung! \PN! Ich bin Hitsukid, du musst die Geheimedition von Fire Ash bekommen haben."�\bDas bedeutet, du hast Zugang zu geheimen Inhalten, die von mir höchstpersönlich gemacht wurden. Wahahaha. Also gut, zurück zur Sache."t\bIm Grunde befinden wir uns in einem Multiversum. Und nein, wir werden nicht auf Tony Stark treffen, Dummchen."j\bWir sind quasi im Anime-Versum. Und wir haben hier drei Quanten-Transporter zu anderen Dimensionen."�\bIch glaube, zu den Zielen gehören das Manga-Versum und das Spiele-Versum. Pass aber auf, ich spüre hartnäckige Schwingungen von diesen Geräten."y\bScheint so, als gäbe es große Herausforderungen für dich zu bewältigen... aber du wurdest gewarnt. ALLES GUTE!"?\bEich: Ah \PN, wie läuft es? Geht es deinem Pikachu gut?"+\bEich: Wenn du es möchtest, nimm es.">\bEich: Ah \PN, du hast den GS-Ball bekommen, nicht wahr?"+\bGut, gut. Lass mich ihn mal ansehen."K\bHmm. Ich scheine nicht herausfinden zu können, was man damit macht."d\b\PN, darf ich dich bitten, ihn noch ein wenig länger zu behalten und ihn zu Kurt zu bringen?"�\bEr lebt in Azalea City in der Johto-Region. Der schnellste Weg dorthin sollte über Route 22 führen. Sie liegt in der Nähe der Kanto-Liga."q\bEich: Der schnellste Weg in die Johto-Region führt über Route 22. Sie liegt in der Nähe der Kanto-Liga."a\bEich: Ah, hallo \PN. Ich habe gehört, du hast dich in der Silberkonferenz gut geschlagen."�\bGary hat beschlossen, nach Hoenn aufzubrechen, um ein wenig zu forschen. Es scheint ein wunderbarer Ort für dich zu sein, wenn du eine neue Herausforderung suchst."�\bBegib dich nach Orania City. Ich werde dem Kapitän Bescheid geben, dass du kommst. Es gibt ein Schiff, das dich dorthin bringt."T\bSprich außerdem mit meinem Assistenten unten. Er hat ein Geschenk für dich."e\bUnd zu guter Letzt hat deine Mutter ein paar neue Kleidungsstücke für dich. Hier bitte sehr."}\bSie sehen fantastisch aus. Wenn du jedoch deine alten bevorzugst, kannst du dich am Schrank in deinem Zimmer umziehen."�\bEich: Begib dich nach Orania City. Ich werde dem Kapitän Bescheid geben, dass du kommst. Es gibt ein Schiff, das dich nach Hoenn bringt."g\bEich: Ah, hallo \PN. Ich habe gehört, du hast dich in der Prachtpolis-Konferenz gut geschlagen."�\bDas Timing ist auch gut, da die Kampfzone gerade erst hier in Kanto eröffnet hat! Die erste, die ich dir empfehlen würde, ist die Kampffabrik in der Nähe von Azuria City."K\bEich: Begib dich nach Azuria City, um die Kampfzone herauszufordern."?\bEich: Ah, hallo \PN. Du hast also die Kampfzone besiegt?"}\bDu denkst über die Sinnoh-Region nach? Ich werde eine Fahrt für dich organisieren. Begib dich wie immer nach Orania City."E\bUnd wieder einmal gibt es hier ein paar neue Kleidungsstücke."P\bEich: Begib dich nach Orania City, um eine Fahrt nach Sinnoh zu bekommen."G\bEich: Ah, hallo \PN. Du hast also die Sinnoh-Liga abgeschlossen."�\bIch habe gesehen, dass du dich ziemlich gut geschlagen hast. Ich bin mir sicher, du bist bereit für deine nächste Herausforderung. Warum kommst du nicht mit mir nach Einall?"^\bBegib dich nach Vertania City. Ein Luftschiff wird dort sein, um uns hinüberzubringen."]\bUnd wie du dir sicher schon gedacht hast, hat deine Mutter ein neues Outfit für dich."d\bEich: Begib dich nach Vertania City. Ein Luftschiff wird dort sein, um uns hinüberzubringen."�\bEich: Die Einall-Liga klingt nach einer guten Herausforderung für dich. Ich freue mich darauf, von deinen Ergebnissen zu hören."IDieser Ball enthält ein Pokémon, das vom Professor gefangen wurde."J\bEich: Du möchtest also Pikachu, das Maus-Pokémon vom Typ Elektro?"`\bEich: Leider ist es das einzige, das noch übrig ist, also schlage ich vor, du nimmst es."\bPikachu";Pikachu fing an, dir zu folgen.\se[itemlevel]\wtnp[20]"=Gary: Alabastia\n Paul: Schleiede\n Barry: Zweiblattdorf"LDiaz: Avenitia\n Alain: Professor Platans Labor\n Sandro: Illumina City"/Gladio: Hauholi City\n Tali: Dorf der Kapu"CMisty: Azuria City\n Rocko: Marmoria City\n Tracy: Eichs Labor"*Maike: Dukatia City\n Lucia: Ewigenau".Lilia: Twindrake City\n Benny: Orion City"3Citro: Illumina City\n Serena: Seegrasulb City"3Tracy: Hauholi City\n Kiawe: Ruinen des Lebens"FMaho: Hauholi City\n Chrys: Pokémon-Schule\n Lilly: Hauholi City"Goh: Kirsch-Park"%\PN hat einen Pokédex erhalten!"$Du hast bereits einen Pokédex."Rotom!!"�\bHallo \PN. Ich habe es geschafft, eine Maschine zu bauen, die die Essenz mächtiger Trainer aus einer anderen Dimension einfängt."M\bSie werden 'Pokédex-Träger' genannt. Probier die Maschine gerne aus."�\bEich: \PN, du bist spät dran. Alle Starter-Pokémon sind bereits vergeben. ...Nun, es gibt noch eines, aber es ist ein bisschen ungestüm."O\bEich: Es scheint, als ob Pikachu nicht gerne in seinem Pokéball bleibt.",\bEich: Glumanda, eine exzellente Wahl!"+\bEich: Schiggy, eine exzellente Wahl!"B\bVergiss nicht, deinen Pokédex mitzunehmen, bevor du gehst."[SYSTEM AKTIVIERT........]"[GEFAHR! GEFAHR!]"�Teleportieren?\ch[1,1,Rot,Blau,Grün,Gelb,Gold,Silber, Kristall,Rubin,Saphir,Smaragd,Diamant,Perl,Platin, Schwarz,Weiß,Schwarzy,Weissy,X,Y,Sonne,Mond,Soro,Skield,Nein]"-Dieser Ort... scheint Alabastia zu sein."6Dieser Ort... scheint die Vertania-Arena zu sein."6Dieser Ort... scheint das Indigo-Plateau zu sein."5Dieser Ort... scheint der Vertania-Wald zu sein."-Dieser Ort... scheint Neubarkia zu sein."1Dieser Ort... scheint Vertania City zu sein."-Dieser Ort... scheint Teak City zu sein."4Dieser Ort... scheint Graphitport City zu sein.".Dieser Ort... scheint Wurzelheim zu sein."1Dieser Ort... scheint der Duellturm zu sein."2Dieser Ort... scheint die Eiseninsel zu sein."-Dieser Ort... scheint Weideburg zu sein."2Dieser Ort... scheint der Kraterberg zu sein."<Dieser Ort... scheint die Einall-Pokémon-Liga zu sein."/Dieser Ort... scheint Rayono City zu sein."0Dieser Ort... scheint Vapydro City zu sein."1Dieser Ort... scheint Eventura City zu sein."-Dieser Ort... scheint Cromlexia zu sein."0Dieser Ort... scheint Yantara City zu sein.",Dieser Ort... scheint Lili’i zu sein."7Dieser Ort... scheint das Æther-Paradies zu sein."2Dieser Ort... scheint die Turmspitze zu sein."5Dieser Ort... scheint der Schlummerwald zu sein."�\bEich: Ich bin mir nicht sicher, was es sonst noch für dich zu tun gibt, \PN. Ich würde sagen, du hast riesige Fortschritte gemacht, um ein Pokémon-Meister zu werden."�\bDu könntest die Freunde aufsuchen, die du auf deinem Weg getroffen hast. Vielleicht möchten sie dich wiedersehen. Ich habe hier irgendwo eine Liste der Orte, an denen sie sich befinden."S\bEs gibt auch ein Kampfstadion in Marea City, das dich interessieren könnte."F\bWas ist das? Du möchtest, dass ich mir deinen Pokédex ansehe?"\bHmm... Ich verstehe..."@\bWow! Gut gemacht, den Pokédex zu vervollständigen, \PN!"\bHier ist eine Belohnung."{\bDenk daran, \PN, dein Abenteuer endet nicht hier. Es gibt noch so viel für dich in dieser weiten Welt zu entdecken!"Z\bEich: Ich höre, du hast auch die Einall-Region geschlagen. Wunderbare Arbeit, \PN."S\bHast du Rotom schon getroffen? Ich habe es auf den Decolore-Inseln gefangen."�\bWo das ist? Oh, es ist ein schrecklicher Ort. Ich würde dir die Reise nicht zumuten wollen. Ich bin nur hingegangen, um ein Rotom zu finden."�\bDu hast vor, als Nächstes in die Kalos-Region zu reisen? Ausgezeichnete Idee. Ich habe von einer mysteriösen Kraft gehört, die aus der Region stammt."_\bBegib dich nach Vertania City. Ein Luftschiff wird dort sein, um dich hinüberzubringen."<\bOh, und lass uns deine neuen Kleider nicht vergessen."e\bEich: Begib dich nach Vertania City. Ein Luftschiff wird dort sein, um dich hinüberzubringen."T\bEich: Ich höre, du hast auch die Kalos-Region geschlagen. Wunderbare Arbeit."k\bEs ist auch ein wunderbares Timing. Deine Mutter hat gerade eine Reise in die Alola-Region gewonnen."j\bIch habe auch dieses Ei, das ich meinem Cousin Heinrich liefern muss. Gib es ihm, wenn du ankommst."+\bWarte. Vergiss deine Kleidung nicht.".\bEich: Geh und sprich mit deiner Mutter."9\bEich: Solltest du nicht gerade in der Schule sein?"j\bEich: Exzellente Arbeit, der Champ von Alola zu werden, \PN. Es war ein ziemlich aufregendes Match."�\bEs tut mir leid, dieses Treffen abzukürzen, aber ein neuer Professor eröffnet ein Labor in Orania City und ich habe zugesagt, daran teilzunehmen."u\bIch weiß! Warum kommst du nicht mit? Nun denn, es ist abgemacht. Deine Mutter und ich treffen dich in Orania."�\bNatürlich hat deine Mutter dir etwas Kleidung hiergelassen. Sie hatte Sorge, du wärst in solcher Eile, deine Pokémon zu sehen, dass du vergessen würdest, zu Hause vorbeizuschauen."9\bEich: Deine Mutter und ich treffen dich in Orania."@\bEich: Hallo \PN. Wie ist die Arbeit mit Professor Kirsch?"e\bEich: Hallo \PN. Wie ist die Arbeit mit Professor Kirsch? Läuft das Projekt Mew gut für Goh?"Q\bEich: Hallo \PN. Die Überraschung, die ich für dich habe, ist da hinten."|\bEich: Hallo \PN. Wie lief dein Treffen mit Paul? Hat er erwähnt, dass er ein Angebot bekommen hat, Arenaleiter zu werden?";\bEich: Exzellente Arbeit, der Monarch zu werden, \PN."u\bEich: Du bist von einer weiteren Reise zurückgekommen, was? Es ist immer wieder eine angenehme Überraschung."�\bDu hast so viel erreicht, seit du Pikachu das erste Mal getroffen hast. Die Bande, die du geknüpft hast, die Regionen, die du erkundet hast, und auch die Freunde und Pokémon."�\bDu hast nie aufgehört, als Trainer zu wachsen, und ich bezweifle, dass du vorhast, jetzt aufzuhören. Der Weg, ein Pokémon-Meister zu werden, ist lang."�\bIch bin wirklich stolz auf dich, \PN. Ich wünsche dir viel Glück auf deiner nächsten Reise. Und wisse, dass du zu Hause immer willkommen bist."Ja"	Nein;[�"1\bOak: Come here and get your Pokédex, \PN."5\bOak: Wait, don't forget your starter Pokémon!"'\bOak: Wait, don't forget Pikachu!"[SYSTEM ACTIVATING.......]"[WARNING! WARNING!]"Teleport?"f\bHey, surprise surprise! \PN! I'm Hitsukid, you must have gotten the secret edition of Fire Ash."n\bThis means you have access to secret content made by yours truly. Wahahaha. Alrighty, back to business."Z\bBasically, we are in a Multiverse. And no, we are not gonna meet Tony Stark, silly."j\bWe are in the Anime-verse, per se. And we have three Quantum Transporters here to other dimensions."�\bI believe the destinations include Manga-verse and Game-verse. Watch out though, I am sensing tenacious vibes through those devices."a\bSeems like great challenges for you to overcome... but you have been warned. ALL THE BEST!"@\bOak: Ah \PN, how is it going? Is your Pikachu doing well?"$\bOak: If you want it, take it."3\bOak: Ah \PN, you got the GS ball didn't you?"+\bGood good. Let me have a look at it.":\bHmm. I can't seem to figure out what to do with it."O\b\PN, can I ask you to hold on to it a little longer and take it to Kurt?"|\bHe lives in Azalea Town in the Johto region. The fastest way there should be on Route 22. It's near the Kanto League."`\bOak: The fastest way to the Johto region is through Route 22. It's near the Kanto League."I\bOak: Ah, hello \PN. I heard you did well in the Silver Conference."�\bGary decided to head off to Hoenn to do some research. It seems like a lovely place for you to go if you want a new challenge."n\bHead to Vermilion City. I'll tell the captain you are coming. There is a ship that will take you there."@\bAlso, speak to my aide downstairs. He has a gift for you."U\bAnd last but not least, your mother has some new clothes for you. Here you go."l\bThey look spendid. If you'd prefer your old ones though you can change with the dresser in your room."v\bOak: Head to Vermilion City. I'll tell the captain you are coming. There is a ship that will take you to Hoenn."N\bOak: Ah, hello \PN. I heard you did well in the Ever Grande Conference."�\bIt's good timing too since the Battle Frontier just opened up right here in Kanto! The first one I would recommend is the Battle Factory near Cerulean City."@\bOak: Head to Cerulean City to battle the Battle Frontier."@\bOak: Ah, hello \PN. So you beat the Battle Frontier then?"u\bYou're thinking about the Sinnoh region? I'll set up a ride for you. Like always, head over to Vermilion City."1\bAnd once again, here are some new clothes.";\bOak: Head to Vermilion City to get a ride to Sinnoh."=\bOak: Ah, hello \PN. So you finished the Sinnoh League."n\bI saw you did quite well. I'm sure you're ready for your next challenge. Why not head to Unova with me?"I\bHead over to Viridian City. A blimp will be there to take us over."O\bAnd as I'm sure you guessed by now your mother has a new outfit for you."N\bOak: Head over to Viridian City. A blimp will be there to take us over."j\bOak: The Unova League sounds like a good challenge for you. I look forward to hearing your results.";This ball contains a Pokémon caught by the Professor.">\bOak: So, you want Pikachu, the Electric mouse Pokémon?"M\bOak: Unfortunately, it is the only one left, so I suggest you take it."\bPikachu":Pikachu started to follow you.\se[itemlevel]\wtnp[20]"DGary: Pallet Town\n Paul: Veilstone City\n Barry: Twinleaf Town"OTrip: Nuvema Town\n Alain: Professor Sycamore's Lab\n Sawyer: Lumiose City".Gladion: Hau'oli City\n Hau: Tapu Village"EMisty: Cerulean City\n Brock: Pewter City\n Tracey: Oak's Corral",May: Goldenrod City\n Dawn: Eterna City"/Iris: Opelucid City\n Cilan: Striaton City"2Clemont: Lumiose City\n Serena: Lilycove City".Lana: Hau'oli City\n Kiawe: Ruins of Life"MMallow: Hau'oli City\n Sophocles: Pokémon School\n Lillie: Hau'oli City"Goh: Cerise Park"\PN received a Pokédex!"!You already have a Pokédex."Rotom!!"{\bHello \PN. I've managed to make a machine that captures the essence of powerful Trainers from a different dimension."L\bThey are called 'Pokédex holders'. Feel free to try the machine out."\bOak: \PN, you're late. All of the starter Pokémon have been taken. ...Well there is one left, but it is a bit reckless."D\bOak: It seems Pikachu doesn't like to stay in its Poké Ball.",\bOak: Charmander, an excellent choice!"*\bOak: Squirtle, an excellent choice!";\bDon't forget to take your Pokédex before you leave." [SYSTEM ACTIVATING........]"[DANGER! DANGER!]"�Teleport?\ch[1,1,Red,Blue,Green,Yellow,Gold,Silver, Crystal,Ruby,Sapphire,Emerald,Diamond,Pearl,Platinum, Black,White,Blake,Whitley,X,Y,Sun,Moon,Henry,Casey,No]",This place...appears to be Pallet Town."1This place...appears to be the Viridian Gym."3This place...appears to be the Indigo Plateau."0This place...appears to be Viridian Forest.".This place...appears to be New Bark Town.".This place...appears to be Viridian City.".This place...appears to be Ecruteak City."/This place...appears to be Slateport City."0This place...appears to be Littleroot Town."1This place...appears to be the Battle Tower.",This place...appears to be Iron Island.".This place...appears to be Pastoria City.",This place...appears to be Mt. Coronet.":This place...appears to be the Unova Pokémon League."-This place...appears to be Nimbasa City."-This place...appears to be Virbank City.".This place...appears to be Aspertia City.".This place...appears to be Geosenge Town."-This place...appears to be Shalour City.")This place...appears to be Iki Town."0This place...appears to be Aether Paradise."-This place...appears to be Tower Summit."1This place...appears to be Slumbering Weald."~\bOak: I'm not sure what else there is for you to do, \PN. I would say you've made huge strides to becoming a Pokémon Master."�\bYou could seek out the friends you've met along the way. They may want to see you again. I have a list of the places where they are somewhere around here."M\bThere is also a battle hall in Driftveil City that might interest you."5\bWhat's that? You want me to see your Pokédex?"\bHmm... I see..."7\bWow! Well done on completeing the Pokédex, \PN!"\bHere's a reward."q\bRemeber \PN, your adventure doesn't end here. There's still so much for you to explore in this vast world!"O\bOak: I hear you've beaten the Unova region as well. Wonderful work, \PN."C\bHave you met Rotom yet? I caught it in the Decolore Islands."|\bWhere's that at? Oh, it's a horrible place. I wouldn't want to make you suffer the trip. I only went to find a Rotom."x\bYou plan on going to the Kalos region next? Excellent idea. I heard of a mysterious power coming from the region."J\bHead over to Viridian City. A blimp will be there to take you over."1\bOh, and let's not forget your new clothes."O\bOak: Head over to Viridian City. A blimp will be there to take you over."J\bOak: I hear you've beaten the Kalos region as well. Wonderful work."S\bIt's also wonderful timing. Your mother just won a trip to the Alola region."g\bI also have this egg that I need to deliver to my cousin Samson. Give it to him when you arrive."'\bWait. Don't forget your clothes."&\bOak: Go speak with your mother."1\bOak: Shouldn't you be in school right now?"c\bOak: Excellent work on becoming the Champion of Alola, \PN. It was quite the exciting match."z\bI'm sorry to cut this meeting short, but a new Professor is opening a lab in Vermilion City and I agreed to attend."l\bI know! Why don't you join me? Well then, it's settled. Your mother and I will meet you in Vermilion."�\bNaturally, your mother left you some clothes here. She was worried you'd be in such a rush to see your Pokémon that you'd forget to stop home."9\bOak: Your mother and I will meet you in Vermilion."?\bOak: Hello \PN. How is it working with Professor Cerise?"b\bOak: Hello \PN. How is it working with Professor Cerise? Is Project Mew going well for Goh?"?\bOak: Hello \PN. The surprise I have for you is out back."u\bOak: Hello \PN. How did your meeting go with Paul? Did he mention he recieved an offer to become a Gym Leader?"7\bOak: Excellent job on becoming the Monarch, \PN."W\bOak: Come back after another journey, have you? It's always a pleasant surprise."�\bYou've accomplished so much since you first met Pikachu. The bonds you've made, the regions you've explored, and the friends and Pokémon too."�\bYou've never stopped growing as a Trainer, and I doubt you have any intention on quitting now. The road to becoming a Pokémon Master is a long one."y\bI'm truly proud of you, \PN. I wish you luck in your next journey. And know that you're always welcomed back home."Yes"No000000000000000000000000000Iu;␀�[[";\bBe careful of the grass. Wild Pokémon can jump out."<\bHi! This is a complimentary item from the Poké Mart."I\bPlease visit the Poké Mart if you ever need to stock up on items.["K\bSei vorsichtig im hohen Gras. Wilde Pokémon können herausspringen."A\bHallo! Dies ist ein Werbegeschenk vom Pokémon-Supermarkt."U\bBitte besuche den Pokémon-Supermarkt, falls du jemals Items aufstocken musst.;[";\bBe careful of the grass. Wild Pokémon can jump out."<\bHi! This is a complimentary item from the Poké Mart."I\bPlease visit the Poké Mart if you ever need to stock up on items.Iu;␀v[[/"]\bOak: Good, you're here. Whenever you're ready to leave speak to the guy to your right."1\rMom: This trip is going to be so exciting!"#\bKukui: To Pallet Town we go."\rMy daddy loves Pokémon!"C\bComing up with nicknames is fun, but it's not so easy to do."\bMr. Mime"1\rWhew! I'm trying to memorize all my notes."\bSpearow":\rBe sure to read what's on the blackboard carefully!"Z\rMy son left on a journey a long time ago. The house has been very empty since then."Choose a status option."-A Pokémon can't attack if it is asleep."2Pokémon will stay asleep even after battles."+Use Awkening to awaken one from sleep."AA burn reduces attack power. It also causes ongoing HP loss.">A burn remains after battle. Use Bun Heal to cure a burn."9When poisoned, a Pokémon's health steadily drops. "BPoison lingers after battles. Use an Antidote to cure poison!"2\rWelcome to the Viridian City Blimp Service."1\rWe are currently not taking any customers."�\rWe are currently not in service due to a Fearow attacking our blimps whenever we take off. If you can stop it we will let you travel for free.";\rLast I saw it it was somewhere near Viridian Forest."X\rGood job on stopping that Fearow. As promised, you can ride for free from now on."f\rWelcome to the Viridian City Blimp Service.\ch[1,-1, Valencia Island,Nuvema,Lumiose,Alola,Exit]"FParalysis reduces speed and may prevent the Pokémon from moving."DParalysis remains after battles. Use Parlyz Heal for treatment."0It stays frozen even after the battle ends."3A frozen Pokémon becomes helplessly immobile."5Use Ice Heal to thaw out the suffering Pokémon."3When confused, a Pokémon may attack itself. "0Confusion does not last if recalled though."
