elieve he lives on Route 25."\rChansey"1\rHello, and welcome to the Pokémon Center."5\rWe restore your tired Pokémon to full health.",\rWould you like to rest your Pokémon?"5\rOK, I'll take your Pokémon for a few seconds."0\rYour Pokémon may be infected by PokeRus."m\rLittle is known about the PokeRus except that they are microscopic life-forms that attach to Pokémon."D\rWhile infected, Pokémon are said to grow exceptionally well."\rThank you for waiting."3\rWe've restored your Pokémon to full health." \rWe hope to see you again!">\rFirst, you should restore your Pokémon to full health."8\rYour Pokémon have been healed to perfect health."\rWe hope you excel!"F\rMy Clefairy can Teleport you.\ch[1,-1,Viridian, Pewter, Cancel]"P\rMy Clefairy can Teleport you.\ch[1,-1,Viridian, Pewter,Vermilion, Cancel]"`\rMy Clefairy can Teleport you.\ch[1,-1,Viridian, Pewter,Vermilion,Saffron,Lavender,Cancel]"i\rMy Clefairy can Teleport you.\ch[1,-1,Viridian, Pewter,Vermilion,Saffron,Lavender,Celadon, Cancel]"q\rMy Clefairy can Teleport you.\ch[1,-1,Viridian, Pewter,Vermilion,Saffron,Lavender,Celadon, Fuchsia,Cancel]"z\rMy Clefairy can Teleport you.\ch[1,-1,Viridian, Pewter,Vermilion,Saffron,Lavender,Celadon, Fuchsia,Cinnabar,Cancel]"\rClefairy!"Yes"NoIu;␀�i[[�"\bMr. Mime"$\rChloe: Yes? What do you want?",\rChloe: What should I do with my life?"7\bOak: I'm looking forward to seeing your results."-\rDo you think he's taking applications?"\rEevee"�\bCerise: How did the Project Mew mission go? While you were gone, a call from Opal came in. She'd like you to visit her gym in Ballonlea."=\bGoh: Hopefully it's not for more quizzes. Ready to go?"�\bCerise: \PN, it's terrible. Pokémon all over the world are turning back into Eggs. Nobody knows what is happening or what is going on."�\bCerise: The issue began in Sinnoh, so we'll have to start our search there. Professor Rowan may have some idea as to where to go."4\bGoh: Let's not waste any time. Are you ready?"_\bCerise: Thank you both for your quick response. Thanks to you all the Pokémon are safe."�\bBack to less pressing matters, Allister, a Stow-on- Side Gym Leader, would like to meet you. He says he has something to help you with your battles."=\bGoh: I could use something more relaxing. Ready to go?"C\bCerise: Wasn't your friend waiting for you in Canalave City?"P\bCerise: I heard you're going to be visiting your friend at Mossdeep City.",\bCerise: Good luck in your next match.":\bCerise: I heard Goh was in Lilycove City right now."t\bCerise: An unknown Pokémon has been spotted in the Crown Tundra. I'd like the both of you to investigate it."6\bThe train station in Wyndon can take you there."D\bCerise: You need to visit Professor Oak. Give him my regards."2\bCerise: Goh is looking for you in the park."B\bCerise: The Masters Tournament has begun. I believe in you."B\bCerise: I watched all of your battles. You did a great job."e\bGoh is somewhere in the city waiting for you. He had something he wanted to talk to you about."c\bCerise: So the two of you are leaving? As much as I'll miss you, I know this is what's best."d\bGoh: Thank you, Professor. I'll be sure to visit. My Pokémon will be in good hands with you."A\bCerise: Before you go, I have a gift for you. Use it well."�\bI have one last piece of advice for you. Be sure to check your phone often and refresh yourself on your notes. It helps to stay organized."�\bCerise: I have one last piece of advice for you. Be sure to check your phone often and refresh yourself on your notes. It helps to stay organized."\bTake care."\rDragonite"\bYamper!"-\bCerise: Thank you for visiting my lab."e\bCerise: There's a bed upstairs the two of you can use. We'll get started on our work tomorrow."V\bCerise: A mass outbreak of Ivysaur has appeared in the city. Go investigate it."d\bCerise: So the mass outbreak was caused by Team Rocket? I'm glad you were there to handle it."�\bNow that that's been handled, let me give you the project I intended on. Goh found an article about the phenomenon that causes Pokémon to grow giant."h\bThis only happens in the Galar region, so I'll need you to go there to discover what's happening."4\bYou can take a train there from Saffron City."?\bCerise: You can take a train to Galar from Saffron City."b\bCerise: So you found a giant Snorlax? Good work. I'll have to research this more on my own."�\bI don't want to overload you with one project after the next. Why don't you take a break and visit the Battle Frontier in Hoenn?"5\bYou can get there from the ship at the harbor."@\bCerise: I heard from Goh you won the Flute Cup. Good job!"a\bYou just missed Goh, however. He heard about Dragonite sightings and left to go catch one."|\bHe should be at Dragonite Island now. You can meet up with him by taking the boat to the west of the one you were just on."}\bCerise: There you are. I have some exciting news for you both. I acquired two tickets for the World Coronation Series."1\bGoh: World Coronation Series? What's that?"�\bCerise: It's similar to a league, but instead of taking place in one region and having a Champion, it takes place across the world and crowns the Monarch."V\bThe finals is taking place soon. You should hurry to Wyndon before you miss it."9\bCerise: How was the battle? I hope you enjoyed it."�\bThis time I need the two of you to head to the Colossus Ruins in the Desert Resort. The Pokémon inside might have a connection to the ones in Galar."D\bYou can find your way there by traveling to Route 4 in Unova."p\bGoh: This sounds like an opportunity to catch some Pokémon. I'm ready if you are. Do you want to go now?"d\bCerise: Are you ready, \PN? The World Coronation Series's next season has officially started."7\bLet's get you registed through your Rotom Phone."�Rotom Phone: ...Registed: Trainer \PN. Normal Class. Nearby opponent Visquez, located in the Vermilion City Gym, is ready for battle."9\bGoh: Woah, you've already matched up with someone?"�\bCerise: There are already over 10,000 participants. It makes sense that everyone is eager for battle. \PN, go ahead and meet up with them."H\bCerise: \PN, go ahead and meet up with them at the Vermilion Gym."W\bCerise: Good, you've both here. I need you to head to the Resort Area in Sinnoh."n\bThere's been rumors of a mysterious Pokémon said to be hiding in a local lake. See if you can find it."^\bCerise: I'm happy the two of you were able to find the Magikarp before Team Rocket. It-"�Rotom Phone: Announcment. The World Coronation Series is hosting a Battle Festival Challenge in Shalour City in the Kalos region."`\bGoh: It's in Kalos. That's a great chance to catch some Kalos Pokémon. Should we go now?"C\bCerise: So you've entered the Great Class? That's fantastic!"s\bCerise: Speaking of, I think the Galar Champion is having a match soon. You should head to Wyndon and watch."5\bGoh: I'm ready to go. Are you good to go, \PN?"�\bCerise: How are your battles going? If you're looking to take a break, Goh is at the Pokémon Center right now taking place in a trade event."D\bCerise: I think Goh was looking for you in the park out back."J\bCerise: You have a match in Saffron City? Don't let me hold you up."�\bCerise: Thank you for joining us, \PN. A sandstorm has appeared in Mauville City. The people there have been pushed out as a result."v\bNot only that, but a hauntingly beautiful song from inside the sandstorm is seemingly hypnotizing the citizens."�\bGoh: This sounds like something we can handle. \PN, I know you've been struggling with your last few matches. Ready to give this a shot?"j\bCerise: Thank you both for dealing with that Flygon. I wonder what caused it do that to the city? "�\bRegardless, I recieved a call while you were both gone from Professor Kukui. He'd like for \PN to come to Alola to visit. Goh, you're welcomed as well."M\bGoh: Thank you for inviting me. \PN, I guess I'm ready to go. Are you?"*\bCerise: How are your battles going?"L\bCerise: Goh is waiting for you at Route 10. It's to the east of here."�\bCerise: I heard from Goh that Zapdos was a difficult challenge. At the very least, you did manage to stop it from causing another power outage."G\bCerise: You should... \PN, what's that red glow coming from you?"K\bGoh: It's the Dynamax Band. But that can't be used outside of Galar."�\bCerise: That is concerning. You should head to Wedgehurst in Galar to meet with Professor Magnolia. She's the leading expert on Dynamax."8\bYou can get there by taking the train in Saffron."H\bCerise: You can get to Wedgehurst by taking the train in Saffron."n\bCerise: I'm glad the both of you were able to stop a crisis. Take a break and get back to your battles."�\bCerise: You're back. Goh got impatient and couldn't wait. He went to Cero Island. You can find it through the boat at the far end of the port."[\bCerise: I guess Mew wasn't there. It's a shame, but I found something else exciting."Z\bApparently, there are rare fossils in the Wild Area. You two should go investigate."Y\bGoh: I'm going to catch them and fill up the Pokédex even more. \PN, ready to go?"|\bCerise: There you two are. My daughter reminded me about Glimwood Tangle and the Ponyta and Rapidash that live there."X\bI was wondering if the two of you could head there and see if you could find one."R\bYou'll have to go west from Hammerlocke, then north east from Stow-on-Side.";\bGoh: Of course, Professor. \PN, are you ready to go?"l\bCerise: The Castle of Chivalry can be found by taking the blimp in Lumiose City. Enjoy your training."=\bCerise: Goh is waiting for you at Professor Oak's lab."{\bGoh: Professor. I've recieved my qualifier mission from Project Mew. I need to find an Alolan Ninetales at Mount Coronet."[\bCerise: Wonderful. \PN, why don't you go with him? Moral support is always welcomed."0\bGoh: I'd welcome it. Are you ready to go?"|\bCerise: I'm glad you two are back. People in Sinnoh have been struggling with nightmares. I suspect a Darkrai is involved."Q\bThe nightmares are happening around Floaroma Town. Please go check it out."8\bGoh: Nightmares... That sounds serious. Let's go.";\bCerise: Goh is waiting for you at the Desert Resort."Dracovish"\\rMom: \PN, what do you think of this place? I think it's going to turn out just great."(\bGoh: I wonder why Lugia was here?"F\rI heard Professor Cerise has a daughter. I wonder where she is."\bGengar">\bGoh: I need your help with my next Project Mew mission."\bThe objective is to find an Articuno. My best guess is at the Seafoam Islands. I heard we can get there from Cinnabar Island."\bAre you ready to go?"F\bGoh: You have a new battle, don't you? I'll be rooting for you."=\bGoh: The Crown Tundra. I wonder what we'll find there."U\bGoh: Starting out on my own is terrifying. But I know I need to experience it."\bSirfetch'd")\bHi. I'm Ren, and this is Francois."+\bI heard this lab used to be haunted."B\bCerise: Good morning. I have your first assignment for you."X\bA mass outbreak of Ivysaur has appeared in the city. Head out and investigate it."L\bBut before you go, I have something that should help the both of you."7\bGoh: Thank you, Professor. \PN, let's get going.")\bIt's about time this place opened."\bRiolu"\bLucario"�Rotom Phone: Announcment. New scheduled match for the World Coronation Series. The match will take place at the Kalos League against Drasna."IGengar seems like it trusts you. Would you like to take it with you?"?\rHello. I'm Chrysa, one of Professor Cerise's assistants."4\rI'm excited to have you working here with us."$\rI was great working with you."1\rJessie: We'll be taking your Pokémon now."(\bMeowth: You don't stand a chance."+\bJames: Don't even try and resist us."\bWobbuffet: Wobbuffet!"\bFarfetch'd"^\bCerise: So you and Goh found the rare Pokémon, Lugia. That's quite the achomplishment."T\bI have an idea. Why don't the two of you stay here as my research assistants?"(\bGoh: Really? That would be great!"G\rMom: \PN, how exciting. I'll leave Mimey here to watch over you."6\rI never thought this place would actually open."3\bGoh: I've never seen a mass outbreak before.",\bGoh: I've never been to Galar before."N\bGoh: The World Coronation Series. That sounds right up your alley, \PN."5\bGoh: I'm going to catch a ton of new Pokémon."1\bGoh: You'll do great in your first battle."0\bGoh: Let's find that mysterious Pokémon."4\bGoh: I'm happy we were able to find Magikarp."*\bGoh: You did great in your matches."1\bGoh: I wonder what's going on in Mauville."$\bGoh: That Flygon was intense."<\bGoh: Alola was fun. Maybe we could go again sometime.">\bGoh: I wonder what's causing your Dynamax Band to glow?"V\bGoh: What a journey that was. I'm glad to be getting back to searching for Mew."0\bGoh: Mewtwo gave me a lot to think about."1\bGoh: I've been catching a lot of Pokémon."k\bGoh: The Castle of Chivalry sounds like a good way to train some of my Pokémon. I might go as well."A\bGoh: I'm worried about Project Mew. Will I be good enough?"6\bGoh: Darkrai sounds dangerous. We should hurry."%\bGoh: I wonder what Opal wants."f\bGoh: Pokémon around the world are turning into Eggs. We need to fix this before it's too late."8\bGoh: Thankfully we were able to stop Team Rocket."1\bGoh: You're heading to Mossdeep? Have fun."Magnemite"V\bCerise: Thank you, everyone, for visiting the opening of the Cerise Laboratory."z\bCerise: With your support, I'm certain I'll learn all there is about the world and Pokémon that inhabit it. It...."C\bOh. It seems a rare Pokémon has been spotted in the harbor."U\b\PN, that sounds right up your alley. Why don't you go ahead and check it out?"G\bI used to walk by this place at night. It always creeped me out."�Rotom Phone: Announcment. New opponent found for the World Coronation Series. Maike, located in Saffron City, is ready for battle."Yes"No[�"\bPantimos"#\rChloe: Ja? Was möchtest du?"5\rChloe: Was soll ich mit meinem Leben anfangen?">\bEich: Ich freue mich darauf, deine Ergebnisse zu sehen."+\rGlaubst du, er nimmt Bewerbungen an?"\rEvoli"�\bKirsch: Wie lief die Projekt Mew-Mission? Während du weg warst, kam ein Anruf von Papella rein. Sie möchte, dass du ihre Arena in Fairballey besuchst."E\bGoh: Hoffentlich nicht für noch mehr Quizze. Bereit zu gehen?"�\bKirsch: \PN, es ist schrecklich. Pokémon auf der ganzen Welt verwandeln sich wieder in Eier. Niemand weiß, was passiert oder was vor sich geht."�\bKirsch: Das Problem begann in Sinnoh, also müssen wir unsere Suche dort beginnen. Professor Eibe hat vielleicht eine Idee, wohin wir gehen müssen."=\bGoh: Lass uns keine Zeit verschwenden. Bist du bereit?"m\bKirsch: Ich danke euch beiden für eure schnelle Reaktion. Dank euch sind alle Pokémon in Sicherheit."�\bZurück zu weniger drängenden Angelegenheiten: Nio, ein Arenaleiter von Passjo, möchte dich treffen. Er sagt, er hat etwas, um dir bei deinen Kämpfen zu helfen."A\bGoh: Ich könnte etwas Entspannenderes gebrauchen. Bereit?"D\bKirsch: Hat dein Freund nicht in Fleetburg auf dich gewartet?"L\bKirsch: Ich habe gehört, du besuchst deinen Freund in Moosbach City."6\bKirsch: Viel Glück bei deinem nächsten Kampf."C\bKirsch: Ich habe gehört, Goh ist gerade in Seegrasulb City."\bKirsch: Ein unbekanntes Pokémon wurde in den Kronen-Schneelanden gesichtet. Ich möchte, dass ihr beide das untersucht.";\bDer Bahnhof in Score City kann euch dorthin bringen."N\bKirsch: Du musst Professor Eich besuchen. Richte ihm meine Grüße aus."&\bKirsch: Goh sucht dich im Park."D\bKirsch: Das Meister-Turnier hat begonnen. Ich glaube an dich."Y\bKirsch: Ich habe mir alle deine Kämpfe angesehen. Du hast das großartig gemacht."Y\bGoh wartet irgendwo in der Stadt auf dich. Er wollte über etwas mit dir sprechen."l\bKirsch: Ihr beide geht also? So sehr ich euch auch vermissen werde, ich weiß, dass es das Beste ist."v\bGoh: Danke, Professor. Ich komme bestimmt mal zu Besuch. Meine Pokémon werden bei Ihnen in guten Händen sein."Q\bKirsch: Bevor du gehst, habe ich ein Geschenk für dich. Setze es gut ein."�\bIch habe noch einen letzten Ratschlag für dich. Überprüfe dein Smart-Rotom regelmäßig und frische dein Wissen mit deinen Notizen auf. Das hilft, organisiert zu bleiben."�\bKirsch: Ich habe noch einen letzten Ratschlag für dich. Überprüfe regelmäßig dein Smart-Rotom und sieh dir deine Notizen an. Das hilft, organisiert zu bleiben."\bMach's gut."\rDragoran"\bVoldi!"8\bKirsch: Danke für deinen Besuch in meinem Labor."m\bKirsch: Oben gibt es ein Bett, das ihr beide benutzen könnt. Wir fangen morgen mit unserer Arbeit an."n\bKirsch: Ein massenhafter Ausbruch von Bisaknosp hat sich in der Stadt ereignet. Geh und untersuche das."�\bKirsch: Der massenhafte Ausbruch wurde also von Team Rocket verursacht? Ich bin froh, dass du da warst, um dich darum zu kümmern."�\bJetzt, da das erledigt ist, lass mich dir das Projekt geben, das ich eigentlich vorhatte. Goh hat einen Artikel über das Phänomen gefunden, das Pokémon riesig werden lässt."o\bDas passiert nur in der Galar-Region, also müsst ihr dorthin reisen, um herauszufinden, was da los ist."B\bIhr könnt von Saffronia City aus einen Zug dorthin nehmen."M\bKirsch: Ihr könnt von Saffronia City aus einen Zug nach Galar nehmen."x\bKirsch: Du hast also ein riesiges Relaxo gefunden? Gute Arbeit. Das werde ich selbst genauer untersuchen müssen."�\bIch möchte dich nicht mit einem Projekt nach dem anderen überhäufen. Warum machst du nicht eine Pause und besuchst die Kampfzone in Hoenn?"1\bDu kommst dorthin mit dem Schiff am Hafen."\\bKirsch: Ich habe von Goh gehört, dass du den Flöten-Cup gewonnen hast. Gut gemacht!"|\bDu hast Goh allerdings knapp verpasst. Er hat von Dragoran-Sichtungen gehört und ist losgezogen, um eines zu fangen."�\bEr sollte jetzt auf der Dragoran-Insel sein. Du kannst dich mit ihm treffen, indem du das Boot westlich von dem nimmst, auf dem du gerade warst."�\bKirsch: Da seid ihr ja. Ich habe aufregende Neuigkeiten für euch beide. Ich habe zwei Tickets für die Krönungs-Weltmeisterschaften erworben."7\bGoh: Krönungs-Weltmeisterschaften? Was ist das?"�\bKirsch: Es ist ähnlich wie eine Liga, aber anstatt in einer Region stattzufinden und einen Champ zu haben, findet sie auf der ganzen Welt statt und krönt den Monarchen."d\bDas Finale findet bald statt. Du solltest dich nach Score City beeilen, bevor du es verpasst."A\bKirsch: Wie war der Kampf? Ich hoffe, er hat dir gefallen."�\bDieses Mal müsst ihr beide zu den Koloss-Ruinen im Wüstenresort aufbrechen. Die Pokémon dort könnten eine Verbindung zu denen in Galar haben."I\bDen Weg dorthin findet ihr, indem ihr zur Route 4 in Einall reist."\bGoh: Das klingt nach einer Gelegenheit, einige Pokémon zu fangen. Ich bin bereit, wenn du es bist. Willst du jetzt los?"q\bKirsch: Bist du bereit, \PN? Die nächste Saison der Krönungs-Weltmeisterschaften hat offiziell begonnen."9\bLass uns dich über dein Rotom-Phone registrieren."�Rotom-Phone: ...Registriert: Trainer \PN. Normal-Klasse. Die nahegelegene Gegnerin Visquez, die sich in der Arena von Orania City befindet, ist kampfbereit."<\bGoh: Woah, du hast schon jemanden zugeteilt bekommen?"�\bKirsch: Es gibt bereits über 10.000 Teilnehmer. Da ist es logisch, dass alle auf einen Kampf brennen. \PN, mach dich auf und triff dich mit ihr."M\bKirsch: \PN, mach dich auf und triff dich mit ihr in der Orania-Arena."k\bKirsch: Gut, dass ihr beide hier seid. Ich möchte, dass ihr in das Erholungsgebiet in Sinnoh reist."�\bEs gibt Gerüchte über ein mysteriöses Pokémon, das sich in einem örtlichen See verstecken soll. Seht nach, ob ihr es finden könnt."[\bKirsch: Ich bin froh, dass ihr zwei das Karpador vor Team Rocket finden konntet. Es-"�Rotom-Phone: Ankündigung. Die Krönungs-Weltmeisterschaften veranstalten ein Kampffestival in Yantara City in der Kalos-Region."q\bGoh: Das ist in Kalos. Das ist eine tolle Chance, einige Kalos-Pokémon zu fangen. Sollen wir jetzt gehen?"R\bKirsch: Du bist also in die Super-Klasse aufgestiegen? Das ist fantastisch!"}\bKirsch: Apropos, ich glaube, der Champ von Galar hat bald einen Kampf. Du solltest nach Score City reisen und zusehen.";\bGoh: Ich bin abmarschbereit. Bist du startklar, \PN?"�\bKirsch: Wie laufen deine Kämpfe? Wenn du eine Pause machen möchtest, Goh ist gerade im Pokémon-Center und nimmt an einer Tauschveranstaltung teil."L\bKirsch: Ich glaube, Goh hat im Park hinter dem Haus nach dir gesucht."X\bKirsch: Du hast einen Kampf in Saffronia City? Lass dich nicht von mir aufhalten."�\bKirsch: Danke, dass du hier bist, \PN. In Malvenfroh City ist ein Sandsturm aufgetreten. Die Leute dort wurden deshalb vertrieben."|\bNicht nur das, sondern ein unheimlich schöner Gesang aus dem Inneren des Sandsturms scheint die Bürger zu hypnotisieren."�\bGoh: Das klingt nach etwas, womit wir fertigwerden. \PN, ich weiß, dass du bei deinen letzten Kämpfen Schwierigkeiten hattest. Bereit, es zu versuchen?"�\bKirsch: Danke an euch beide, dass ihr euch um dieses Libelldra gekümmert habt. Ich frage mich, was es dazu gebracht hat, das der Stadt anzutun? "�\bWie dem auch sei, ich habe während eurer Abwesenheit einen Anruf von Professor Kukui erhalten. Er möchte, dass \PN nach Alola zu Besuch kommt. Goh, du bist ebenfalls willkommen."M\bGoh: Danke für die Einladung. \PN, ich denke, ich bin bereit. Und du?"(\bKirsch: Wie laufen deine Kämpfe?"K\bKirsch: Goh wartet auf Route 10 auf dich. Das ist östlich von hier."�\bKirsch: Ich habe von Goh gehört, dass Zapdos eine schwierige Herausforderung war. Zumindest hast du es geschafft, es davon abzuhalten, einen weiteren Stromausfall zu verursachen."\\bKirsch: Du solltest... \PN, was ist das für ein rotes Leuchten, das von dir ausgeht?"`\bGoh: Das ist das Dynamax-Band. Aber das kann außerhalb von Galar nicht verwendet werden."�\bKirsch: Das ist besorgniserregend. Du solltest nach Furlongham in Galar reisen, um dich mit Professor Magnolica zu treffen. Sie ist die führende Expertin für die Dynamaximierung."?\bDu kommst dorthin, indem du den Zug in Saffronia nimmst."O\bKirsch: Du kommst nach Furlongham, indem du den Zug in Saffronia nimmst."{\bKirsch: Ich bin froh, dass ihr beide eine Krise abwenden konntet. Macht eine Pause und widmet euch wieder euren Kämpfen."�\bKirsch: Ihr seid zurück. Goh wurde ungeduldig und konnte nicht warten. Er ist zur Cero-Insel aufgebrochen. Du findest sie über das Boot am äußersten Ende des Hafens."o\bKirsch: Ich nehme an, Mew war nicht da. Es ist schade, aber ich habe etwas anderes Aufregendes gefunden."`\bAnscheinend gibt es seltene Fossilien in der Naturzone. Ihr zwei solltet das untersuchen."[\bGoh: Ich werde sie fangen und den Pokédex noch weiter füllen. \PN, bist du bereit?"\bKirsch: Da seid ihr zwei ja. Meine Tochter hat mich an den Wirrwald und die Ponita und Gallopa erinnert, die dort leben."e\bIch habe mich gefragt, ob ihr beide dorthin gehen und nachsehen könntet, ob ihr eines findet."^\bIhr müsst von Claw City aus nach Westen und dann von Passio aus nach Nordosten reisen.":\bGoh: Natürlich, Professor. \PN, bist du startklar?"~\bKirsch: Das Schloss der Ritterlichkeit erreicht man mit dem Luftschiff in Illumina City. Viel Spaß bei eurem Training."<\bKirsch: Goh wartet in Professor Eichs Labor auf dich."�\bGoh: Professor. Ich habe meine Qualifikationsmission für das Projekt Mew erhalten. Ich muss ein Alola-Vulnona auf dem Kraterberg finden."l\bKirsch: Wunderbar. \PN, warum gehst du nicht mit ihm? Moralische Unterstützung ist immer willkommen."?\bGoh: Ich würde mich darüber freuen. Bist du startklar?"�\bKirsch: Ich bin froh, dass ihr beide zurück seid. Die Menschen in Sinnoh haben mit Albträumen zu kämpfen. Ich vermute, dass ein Darkrai darin verwickelt ist."S\bDie Albträume treten in der Umgebung von Flori auf. Bitte seht euch das an.";\bGoh: Albträume... Das klingt ernst. Lass uns gehen."4\bKirsch: Goh wartet im Wüstenresort auf dich."Lectragon"X\rMama: \PN, was hältst du von diesem Ort? Ich glaube, er wird einfach großartig."1\bGoh: Ich frage mich, warum Lugia hier war?"W\rIch habe gehört, Professor Kirsch hat eine Tochter. Ich frage mich, wo sie ist."\bGengar"M\bGoh: Ich brauche deine Hilfe bei meiner nächsten Projekt Mew-Mission."�\bDas Ziel ist es, ein Arktos zu finden. Ich vermute stark, es ist auf den Seeschauminseln. Ich habe gehört, wir kommen von der Zinnoberinsel dorthin."\bBist du bereit?"N\bGoh: Du hast einen neuen Kampf, nicht wahr? Ich drücke dir die Daumen."O\bGoh: Die Kronen-Schneelande. Ich frage mich, was wir dort finden werden."f\bGoh: Allein anzufangen ist beängstigend. Aber ich weiß, dass ich diese Erfahrung machen muss."\bLauchzelot"2\bHallo. Ich bin René, und das ist Francois."G\bIch habe gehört, in diesem Labor soll es früher gespukt haben."C\bKirsch: Guten Morgen. Ich habe eure erste Aufgabe für euch."`\bEin massiver Auflauf von Bisaknosp ist in der Stadt aufgetreten. Geht und untersucht das."J\bAber bevor ihr geht, habe ich etwas, das euch beiden helfen sollte."2\bGoh: Danke, Professor. \PN, lass uns gehen."0\bWurde auch Zeit, dass dieser Ort öffnet."\bRiolu"\bLucario"�Rotom-Phone: Ankündigung. Neuer geplanter Kampf für die Krönungs-Weltmeisterschaften. Der Kampf findet in der Kalos-Liga gegen Drasna statt."@Gengar scheint dir zu vertrauen. Möchtest du es mitnehmen?"H\rHallo. Ich bin Chrysa, eine von Professor Kirschs Assistentinnen."6\rIch freue mich, dass du hier mit uns arbeitest.".\rEs war großartig, mit dir zu arbeiten."3\rJessie: Wir nehmen jetzt deine Pokémon mit."4\bMauzi: Ihr habt nicht den Hauch einer Chance."?\bJames: Versucht gar nicht erst, euch uns zu widersetzen."\bWoingenau: Woingenau!"\bPorenta"i\bKirsch: Du und Goh habt also das seltene Pokémon Lugia gefunden. Das ist eine ziemliche Leistung."]\bIch habe eine Idee. Warum bleibt ihr beide nicht als meine Forschungsassistenten hier?"+\bGoh: Wirklich? Das wäre großartig!"T\rMama: \PN, wie aufregend. Ich lasse Pantimi hier, damit es auf dich aufpasst."D\rIch hätte nie gedacht, dass dieser Ort tatsächlich öffnet."C\bGoh: Ich habe noch nie zuvor einen massiven Auflauf gesehen.",\bGoh: Ich war noch nie zuvor in Galar."Z\bGoh: Die Krönungs-Weltmeisterschaften. Das klingt ganz nach deinem Geschmack, \PN."7\bGoh: Ich werde eine Menge neuer Pokémon fangen."E\bGoh: Du wirst dich in deinem ersten Kampf großartig schlagen."8\bGoh: Lass uns dieses mysteriöse Pokémon finden.";\bGoh: Ich bin froh, dass wir Karpador finden konnten."<\bGoh: Du hast dich in deinen Kämpfen toll geschlagen.";\bGoh: Ich frage mich, was in Malvenfroh City los ist."(\bGoh: Dieses Libelldra war heftig."W\bGoh: Alola hat Spaß gemacht. Vielleicht können wir irgendwann nochmal dorthin."F\bGoh: Ich frage mich, was dein Dynamax-Band zum Leuchten bringt?"k\bGoh: Was für eine Reise das war. Ich bin froh, dass ich mich wieder der Suche nach Mew widmen kann."6\bGoh: Mewtu hat mir viel zum Nachdenken gegeben."2\bGoh: Ich habe eine Menge Pokémon gefangen."�\bGoh: Das Schloss der Ritterlichkeit klingt nach einer guten Möglichkeit, einige meiner Pokémon zu trainieren. Vielleicht gehe ich auch."R\bGoh: Ich mache mir Sorgen wegen des Projekts Mew. Werde ich gut genug sein?"@\bGoh: Darkrai klingt gefährlich. Wir sollten uns beeilen."-\bGoh: Ich frage mich, was Papella will."|\bGoh: Auf der ganzen Welt verwandeln sich Pokémon in Eier. Wir müssen das in Ordnung bringen, bevor es zu spät ist."9\bGoh: Zum Glück konnten wir Team Rocket aufhalten."?\bGoh: Du bist auf dem Weg nach Moosbach City? Viel Spaß."Magnetilo"W\bKirsch: Danke an alle, dass ihr die Eröffnung des Kirsch-Laboratoriums besucht."�\bKirsch: Mit eurer Unterstützung bin ich sicher, dass ich alles über die Welt und die Pokémon, die sie bewohnen, lernen werde. Es...."Q\bOh. Es scheint, als wäre ein seltenes Pokémon am Hafen gesichtet worden."a\b\PN, das klingt ganz nach deinem Geschmack. Warum gehst du nicht hin und siehst es dir an?"g\bIch bin früher nachts an diesem Ort vorbeigegangen. Er hat mir immer eine Gänsehaut eingejagt."�Rotom-Phone: Ankündigung. Neue Gegnerin für die Krönungs-Weltmeisterschaften gefunden. Maike, die sich in Saffronia City befindet, ist kampfbereit."Ja"	Nein;[�"\bMr. Mime"$\rChloe: Yes? What do you want?",\rChloe: What should I do with my life?"7\bOak: I'm looking forward to seeing your results."-\rDo you think he's taking applications?"\rEevee"�\bCerise: How did the Project Mew mission go? While you were gone, a call from Opal came in. She'd like you to visit her gym in Ballonlea."=\bGoh: Hopefully it's not for more quizzes. Ready to go?"�\bCerise: \PN, it's terrible. Pokémon all over the world are turning back into Eggs. Nobody knows what is happening or what is going on."�\bCerise: The issue began in Sinnoh, so we'll have to start our search there. Professor Rowan may have some idea as to where to go."4\bGoh: Let's not waste any time. Are you ready?"_\bCerise: Thank you both for your quick response. Thanks to you all the Pokémon are safe."�\bBack to less pressing matters, Allister, a Stow-on- Side Gym Leader, would like to meet you. He says he has something to help you with your battles."=\bGoh: I could use something more relaxing. Ready to go?"C\bCerise: Wasn't your friend waiting for you in Canalave City?"P\bCerise: I heard you're going to be visiting your friend at Mossdeep City.",\bCerise: Good luck in your next match.":\bCerise: I heard Goh was in Lilycove City right now."t\bCerise: An unknown Pokémon has been spotted in the Crown Tundra. I'd like the both of you to investigate it."6\bThe train station in Wyndon can take you there."D\bCerise: You need to visit Professor Oak. Give him my regards."2\bCerise: Goh is looking for you in the park."B\bCerise: The Masters Tournament has begun. I believe in you."B\bCerise: I watched all of your battles. You did a great job."e\bGoh is somewhere in the city waiting for you. He had something he wanted to talk to you about."c\bCerise: So the two of you are leaving? As much as I'll miss you, I know this is what's best."d\bGoh: Thank you, Professor. I'll be sure to visit. My Pokémon will be in good hands with you."A\bCerise: Before you go, I have a gift for you. Use it well."�\bI have one last piece of advice for you. Be sure to check your phone often and refresh yourself on your notes. It helps to stay organized."�\bCerise: I have one last piece of advice for you. Be sure to check your phone often and refresh yourself on your notes. It helps to stay organized."\bTake care."\rDragonite"\bYamper!"-\bCerise: Thank you for visiting my lab."e\bCerise: There's a bed upstairs the two of you can use. We'll get started on our work tomorrow."V\bCerise: A mass outbreak of Ivysaur has appeared in the city. Go investigate it."d\bCerise: So the mass outbreak was caused by Team Rocket? I'm glad you were there to handle it."�\bNow that that's been handled, let me give you the project I intended on. Goh found an article about the phenomenon that causes Pokémon to grow giant."h\bThis only happens in the Galar region, so I'll need you to go there to discover what's happening."4\bYou can take a train there from Saffron City."?\bCerise: You can take a train to Galar from Saffron City."b\bCerise: So you found a giant Snorlax? Good work. I'll have to research this more on my own."�\bI don't want to overload you with one project after the next. Why don't you take a break and visit the Battle Frontier in Hoenn?"5\bYou can get there from the ship at the harbor."@\bCerise: I heard from Goh you won the Flute Cup. Good job!"a\bYou just missed Goh, however. He heard about Dragonite sightings and left to go catch one."|\bHe should be at Dragonite Island now. You can meet up with him by taking the boat to the west of the one you were just on."}\bCerise: There you are. I have some exciting news for you both. I acquired two tickets for the World Coronation Series."1\bGoh: World Coronation Series? What's that?"�\bCerise: It's similar to a league, but instead of taking place in one region and having a Champion, it takes place across the world and crowns the Monarch."V\bThe finals is taking place soon. You should hurry to Wyndon before you miss it."9\bCerise: How was the battle? I hope you enjoyed it."�\bThis time I need the two of you to head to the Colossus Ruins in the Desert Resort. The Pokémon inside might have a connection to the ones in Galar."D\bYou can find your way there by traveling to Route 4 in Unova."p\bGoh: This sounds like an opportunity to catch some Pokémon. I'm ready if you are. Do you want to go now?"d\bCerise: Are you ready, \PN? The World Coronation Series's next season has officially started."7\bLet's get you registed through your Rotom Phone."�Rotom Phone: ...Registed: Trainer \PN. Normal Class. Nearby opponent Visquez, located in the Vermilion City Gym, is ready for battle."9\bGoh: Woah, you've already matched up with someone?"�\bCerise: There are already over 10,000 participants. It makes sense that everyone is eager for battle. \PN, go ahead and meet up with them."H\bCerise: \PN, go ahead and meet up with them at the Vermilion Gym."W\bCerise: Good, you've both here. I need you to head to the Resort Area in Sinnoh."n\bThere's been rumors of a mysterious Pokémon said to be hiding in a local lake. See if you can find it."^\bCerise: I'm happy the two of you were able to find the Magikarp before Team Rocket. It-"�Rotom Phone: Announcment. The World Coronation Series is hosting a Battle Festival Challenge in Shalour City in the Kalos region."`\bGoh: It's in Kalos. That's a great chance to catch some Kalos Pokémon. Should we go now?"C\bCerise: So you've entered the Great Class? That's fantastic!"s\bCerise: Speaking of, I think the Galar Champion is having a match soon. You should head to Wyndon and watch."5\bGoh: I'm ready to go. Are you good to go, \PN?"�\bCerise: How are your battles going? If you're looking to take a break, Goh is at the Pokémon Center right now taking place in a trade event."D\bCerise: I think Goh was looking for you in the park out back."J\bCerise: You have a match in Saffron City? Don't let me hold you up."�\bCerise: Thank you for joining us, \PN. A sandstorm has appeared in Mauville City. The people there have been pushed out as a result."v\bNot only that, but a hauntingly beautiful song from inside the sandstorm is seemingly hypnotizing the citizens."�\bGoh: This sounds like something we can handle. \PN, I know you've been struggling with your last few matches. Ready to give this a shot?"j\bCerise: Thank you both for dealing with that Flygon. I wonder what caused it do that to the city? "�\bRegardless, I recieved a call while you were both gone from Professor Kukui. He'd like for \PN to come to Alola to visit. Goh, you're welcomed as well."M\bGoh: Thank you for inviting me. \PN, I guess I'm ready to go. Are you?"*\bCerise: How are your battles going?"L\bCerise: Goh is waiting for you at Route 10. It's to the east of here."�\bCerise: I heard from Goh that Zapdos was a difficult challenge. At the very least, you did manage to stop it from causing another power outage."G\bCerise: You should... \PN, what's that red glow coming from you?"K\bGoh: It's the Dynamax Band. But that can't be used outside of Galar."�\bCerise: That is concerning. You should head to Wedgehurst in Galar to meet with Professor Magnolia. She's the leading expert on Dynamax."8\bYou can get there by taking the train in Saffron."H\bCerise: You can get to Wedgehurst by taking the train in Saffron."n\bCerise: I'm glad the both of you were able to stop a crisis. Take a break and get back to your battles."�\bCerise: You're back. Goh got impatient and couldn't wait. He went to Cero Island. You can find it through the boat at the far end of the port."[\bCerise: I guess Mew wasn't there. It's a shame, but I found something else exciting."Z\bApparently, there are rare fossils in the Wild Area. You two should go investigate."Y\bGoh: I'm going to catch them and fill up the Pokédex even more. \PN, ready to go?"|\bCerise: There you two are. My daughter reminded me about Glimwood Tangle and the Ponyta and Rapidash that live there."X\bI was wondering if the two of you could head there and see if you could find one."R\bYou'll have to go west from Hammerlocke, then north east from Stow-on-Side.";\bGoh: Of course, Professor. \PN, are you ready to go?"l\bCerise: The Castle of Chivalry can be found by taking the blimp in Lumiose City. Enjoy your training."=\bCerise: Goh is waiting for you at Professor Oak's lab."{\bGoh: Professor. I've recieved my qualifier mission from Project Mew. I need to find an Alolan Ninetales at Mount Coronet."[\bCerise: Wonderful. \PN, why don't you go with him? Moral support is always welcomed."0\bGoh: I'd welcome it. Are you ready to go?"|\bCerise: I'm glad you two are back. People in Sinnoh have been struggling with nightmares. I suspect a Darkrai is involved."Q\bThe nightmares are happening around Floaroma Town. Please go check it out."8\bGoh: Nightmares... That sounds serious. Let's go.";\bCerise: Goh is waiting for you at the Desert Resort."Dracovish"\\rMom: \PN, what do you think of this place? I think it's going to turn out just great."(\bGoh: I wonder why Lugia was here?"F\rI heard Professor Cerise has a daughter. I wonder where she is."\bGengar">\bGoh: I need your help with my next Project Mew mission."\bThe objective is to find an Articuno. My best guess is at the Seafoam Islands. I heard we can get there from Cinnabar Island."\bAre you ready to go?"F\bGoh: You have a new battle, don't you? I'll be rooting for you."=\bGoh: The Crown Tundra. I wonder what we'll find there."U\bGoh: Starting out on my own is terrifying. But I know I need to experience it."\bSirfetch'd")\bHi. I'm Ren, and this is Francois."+\bI heard this lab used to be haunted."B\bCerise: Good morning. I have your first assignment for you."X\bA mass outbreak of Ivysaur has appeared in the city. Head out and investigate it."L\bBut before you go, I have something that should help the both of you."7\bGoh: Thank you, Professor. \PN, let's get going.")\bIt's about time this place opened."\bRiolu"\bLucario"�Rotom Phone: Announcment. New scheduled match for the World Coronation Series. The match will take place at the Kalos League against Drasna."IGengar seems like it trusts you. Would you like to take it with you?"?\rHello. I'm Chrysa, one of Professor Cerise's assistants."4\rI'm excited to have you working here with us."$\rI was great working with you."1\rJessie: We'll be taking your Pokémon now."(\bMeowth: You don't stand a chance."+\bJames: Don't even try and resist us."\bWobbuffet: Wobbuffet!"\bFarfetch'd"^\bCerise: So you and Goh found the rare Pokémon, Lugia. That's quite the achomplishment."T\bI have an idea. Why don't the two of you stay here as my research assistants?"(\bGoh: Really? That would be great!"G\rMom: \PN, how exciting. I'll leave Mimey here to watch over you."6\rI never thought this place would actually open."3\bGoh: I've never seen a mass outbreak before.",\bGoh: I've never been to Galar before."N\bGoh: The World Coronation Series. That sounds right up your alley, \PN."5\bGoh: I'm going to catch a ton of new Pokémon."1\bGoh: You'll do great in your first battle."0\bGoh: Let's find that mysterious Pokémon."4\bGoh: I'm happy we were able to find Magikarp."*\bGoh: You did great in your matches."1\bGoh: I wonder what's going on in Mauville."$\bGoh: That Flygon was intense."<\bGoh: Alola was fun. Maybe we could go again sometime.">\bGoh: I wonder what's causing your Dynamax Band to glow?"V\bGoh: What a journey that was. I'm glad to be getting back to searching for Mew."0\bGoh: Mewtwo gave me a lot to think about."1\bGoh: I've been catching a lot of Pokémon."k\bGoh: The Castle of Chivalry sounds like a good way to train some of my Pokémon. I might go as well."A\bGoh: I'm worried about Project Mew. Will I be good enough?"6\bGoh: Darkrai sounds dangerous. We should hurry."%\bGoh: I wonder what Opal wants."f\bGoh: Pokémon around the world are turning into Eggs. We need to fix this before it's too late."8\bGoh: Thankfully we were able to stop Team Rocket."1\bGoh: You're heading to Mossdeep? Have fun."Magnemite"V\bCerise: Thank you, everyone, for visiting the opening of the Cerise Laboratory."z\bCerise: With your support, I'm certain I'll learn all there is about the world and Pokémon that inhabit it. It...."C\bOh. It seems a rare Pokémon has been spotted in the harbor."U\b\PN, that sounds right up your alley. Why don't you go ahead and check it out?"G\bI used to walk by this place at night. It always creeped me out."�Rotom Phone: Announcment. New opponent found for the World Coronation Series. Maike, located in Saffron City, is ready for battle."Yes"NoIu;␀�[[%")\rAre you good enough to face Misty?"F\rYou have to face other Trainers to see how good you really are."\bClauncher!"\rPolitoed"Lily: We run the Gym here."\bPsyduck"\rGoldeen"!Violet: We run the Gym here."\bAzurill"\bCorsola"V\bMisty uses Water type Pokémon. They are weak against Grass and Electric types."s\bThey are strong against Fire, Ground, and Rock. Fire, Ice, Steel, and Water moves also don't do much damage."\bHorsea"\bGyarados!"\bLet's battle!"\\bMisty is a Trainer who's going to keep improving. She won't lose to someone like you!"Starmie"g\rMisty: Hi, you're a new face! Only those Trainers who have a policy about Pokémon can turn pro."C\rMy policy is an all out offensive with Water- type Pokémon!".\rMisty: You've earned the Cascade Badge."\rHere, have this TM too."Q\rTM55 contains Scald. It does damage and has a chance to burn the opponent."H\rMisty: I have three older sisters who also help out with the Gym." Daisy: We run the Gym here."+\rMisty: \Pn! What are you doing here?"E\rOh, interesting. I'm taking over as Gym Leader for my sisters."/\rWant to test out my stregth as a Leader?"U\rMisty: I've taken over as Gym Leader. I'm going to be around here from now on."O\rMisty: So you finally came to visit me. Let me show you my new strength."K\rMisty: It's good to see you every now and then. Be sure to visit me."\bLuvdisc"Staryu[%"4\rBist du gut genug, um gegen Misty anzutreten?"U\rDu musst gegen andere Trainer antreten, um zu sehen, wie gut du wirklich bist."\bScampisto!"\rQuaxo"(Liliane: Wir leiten hier die Arena."\bEnton"\rGoldini")Violetta: Wir leiten hier die Arena."\bAzurill"\bCorasonn"[\bMisty setzt Wasser-Pokémon ein. Sie sind schwach gegen Pflanzen- und Elektro-Typen."�\bSie sind stark gegen Feuer, Boden und Gestein. Feuer-, Eis-, Stahl- und Wasser-Attacken richten ebenfalls nicht viel Schaden an."\bSeeper"\bGarados!"\bLass uns kämpfen!"y\bMisty ist eine Trainerin, die sich immer weiter verbessern wird. Sie wird nicht gegen jemanden wie dich verlieren!"Starmie"~\rMisty: Hallo, du bist ein neues Gesicht! Nur Trainer, die eine Philosophie bezüglich Pokémon haben, können Profis werden."G\rMeine Philosophie ist eine totale Offensive mit Wasser-Pokémon!"2\rMisty: Du hast dir den Quellorden verdient." \rHier, nimm auch diese TM."}\rTM55 enthält Siedewasser. Es richtet Schaden an und kann den Gegner mit einer gewissen Wahrscheinlichkeit verbrennen."P\rMisty: Ich habe drei ältere Schwestern, die auch in der Arena mithelfen."&Daisy: Wir leiten hier die Arena."+\rMisty: \Pn! Was machst du denn hier?"Z\rOh, interessant. Ich übernehme den Posten der Arenaleiterin für meine Schwestern."3\rWillst du meine Stärke als Leiterin testen?"U\rMisty: Ich habe als Arenaleiterin übernommen. Ich werde von nun an hier sein."\\rMisty: Du kommst mich also endlich besuchen. Lass mich dir meine neue Stärke zeigen."Y\rMisty: Es ist schön, dich ab und zu zu sehen. Besuche mich auf jeden Fall wieder."\bLiebiskus"Sterndu;[%")\rAre you good enough to face Misty?"F\rYou have to face other Trainers to see how good you really are."\bClauncher!"\rPolitoed"Lily: We run the Gym here."\bPsyduck"\rGoldeen"!Violet: We run the Gym here."\bAzurill"\bCorsola"V\bMisty uses Water type Pokémon. They are weak against Grass and Electric