Unten"Rechts"Ja"	Nein;["Choose your path."t\rJuniper: Having Pokémon battle one another deepens the bonds between people and Pokémon. So, are you ready?"S\bN: Well, let me hear your Pokémon's voice! I wanna understand you. Show me!"{\bGhetsis: Pokémon are different from humans, which contain unknown potential That's right! We must liberate the Pokémon!"h\rViola: That determined expression... That glint in your eye that says you're up to the challenge."|\rIt's fantastic! Whether it's the tears of frustration that follow a loss or the blossoming of joy that ocmes with victory."Y\rBoth are great subjects for my camera! Now come at me! I, Viola, will take you on!"y\bGrant: I've been waiting in eager anticipation! For a worthy challenger, quite an achievement to participate here."f\bVery impressive, actually. I have a feeling that our battle will turn out to be worth the wait!"N\bI hope you'll show me that your skill as a trainer surpasses even mine."_\rKorrina: Haha! Time for Lady Korrina's grand appearance! Just teasing! Nice to meet you!"w\rI was doing some special training with my Lucario when all of a sudden, it dashed off and drawn in by your aura."Q\rI think Lucario wants to battle with you. Would you accept this challenge?"�\bRamos: Ho ho! I may not look it, but I'm the best green fingers you could meet. If yeh want to know about plants, I'm yer man."k\bSo what'd yeh think, whippersnapper? Did yeh enjoy the greenery along your path to being a Champion?"V\bTheir survival is a sign of their strength. Yeh sure yer up to facing all that?"U\bClemont: Hi! I like my Pokemon battles how i like my inventions. HIGH-VOLTAGE!"\bAnd Pokemon sure are mysterious... Even with as far as science has come, there's still so much we don't know about them."H\bNonetheless, let's both do our best in battle. The future is now!"e\rValerie: Oh, if it isn't a young trainer. So you've fluttering down to me on a fortunate wind."l\rThen i suppose you have earned yourself the right to battle me. I hope it proves entertaining to you."_\rThe elusive Fairies may appear frail as a breeze and delicate as a bloom, but watch out."H\rOlympia: The time has arrived for us standing here. Olympia I am."G\rNow our pathlines have intertwined and crossed. Pokemon as well."B\rA ritual to decide your fate and future. The battle begins!"x\bWulfric: Y'know what? Ice is both extremely hard and terribly fragile at the same time. You know what that means?"|\bDepending on which Pokémon you choose, I could be your most challenging opponent yet or I could be a total pushover."u\bBut that's all right. That's how it should be! Anyway, enough of my rambling! Let's get this show on the road!"c\rMalva: You're the illustrious one, are you? People know me as the Fire Pokémon user, Malva."h\rDo your best, because if you can't impress me with your real strength, you'll never get far here."g\rBut it should be a walk in the park for you, right? I'm burning up with my hatred for you, runt!"�\bSiebold: You there! Young lad! I have a question I must pose to you. Do you think Pokémon battling can ever be worthy of being called an art?"u\bYou see, cooking is the type of art that disappears as soon as it is completed. Pokémon battles are the same."i\bTo devote yourself entirely to such a life, made up of fleeting experiences, that is truly artful."e\bWikstrom: Well met, young challenger! Verily am I the famed blade of hardened Steel, Wikstrom!"_\bWith my magnificent Pokémon at my side, I will reveal the scope of Trainer achievement!"_\bLet us both give our word that our contest shall be fair and honorable. Ready? En garde!"~\rDrasna: Oh goodness, hello to you! Welcome, welcome, come in. You must be a strong Trainer. That's just wonderful news!"c\rWhen I was growing up, my grandparents raised me on tales of the Pokémon of time and space."�\rIt's really thanks to those stories that I decided to become a Dragon type Trainer. Facing you will make my Pokémon grow like weeds!"y\rDiantha: Welcome trainer. Since I’m an actress, sometimes people will talk to me because they’re fans of mine!"�\rOften, they’ll say that watching me act gave them courage or cheered them up! But I also get a lot of energy from my fans when I meet them!"�\rYou know, I'd really love to learn more about how a strong Trainer like you raises your Pokémon, brimming with hope for the future."@\rShauna: Hey hey! Nice to meet you! Did you have fun here?"y\rHey, do you know what's about to happen? That's right! We're going to battle! We ARE Pokémon Trainers, after all!"h\rI'm sure we're gonna be great friends. Hey! Can we see the Pokémon now? I want to meet them too!"\bTierno: All right! Nice to meetcha! You know, it'd feel like we were a closer crew if we called each other by nicknames."9\bCan i call you Jammy? Hahaha! Alright, lighten up!"{\bAnyway, can we have a Pokémon battle? Oh, uh...sorry to just throw that at you. But that's our purpose here, right?"c\bTrevor: Um, hi. I am Trevor. My dream is to see all kinds of Pokemon the world has to offer!"\\bTherefore i am on the journey with my Pokedex to travel high mountains and wide seas."2\bThat doesn't mean i can't battle. Let's go!"d\rSerena: Hi there! My name's Serena. I turn my friendship with my Pokémon into pure strength!"Y\rYou are special. I feel like the friendship we have with our Pokémon connects us."V\rWoohoo! Can't wait to see what we can do! Eeheehee, we're going to get started!"\\bCalem: Hi, I'm Calem. I'm gonna keep pushing forward till I'm the strongest I can be!"~\bI think it would be fun to compete to see who's stronger. But we can't call it a competition until I beat you at least once!"3\bAll right, let's do this. Come on, everyone!"w\bSycamore: I am Augustine Sycamore. Hello! This world of ours is widely inhabited by creatures known as Pokémon!"f\bSome run across the plains, others fly through the skies, and others yet swim in deep oceans..."�\bNow, let's all have a Pokémon battle! Your opponent shall be me with our Pokémon, lending strength to one another to victory!"�\bLysandre: You have a Pokedex, one of the chosen ones. I am Lysandre. I've tried to learn as much about Pokémon as I can to help build a brighter future."m\bAnd to conclude, unproductive fools are consuming our future. Team Flare need to wipe the slate clean."�\bKnowledge is power, after all. Put it to good use. It is vital that this world become a better place. My desire... For a more beautiful world!"�\bIlima: Greetings! I couldn't help but observe your battles. You looked so very delightful in battle that I had no choice but to summon you here."v\bI must admit, I've been wondering about you. I look forward to seeing the brilliance of your moves in my trial."Q\bVery well then! Behold the magnificent Pokémon of the one and only Ilima!"|\rLana: Hello. I'm Lana. I used to go fishing a lot with my twin sisters, so you could also say it's one of my talents!"b\rYou look like an able-bodied Trainer. Then, we could go fishing for wild Pokémon together!"Q\rBut more important than that…I will show you what a serious Lana can do!"�\bKiawe: The name's Kiawe. My Marowak and I are students of the ancient dances that have been passed down in Alola for generations."h\bI'll fully display the vaunted dancing of my Pokémon! Win or lose, there's never enough dancing!"E\bI hope you bring that fire with you and burn up my challenge!!"}\rMallow: Hey! Thanks for coming! Have you had breakfast yet? I've got a Super Mallow Special for you, if you're hungry!"m\rYou ain't? OK. But remember to take a break here and there. A Pokemon master don't always go hustling."z\rI use my chef's intuition to pick out the cream of the crop! And let's get us cooking into the heat of battle then!"d\bSophocles: Hi, I'm not really the greatest around other people. When people stare at me, I..."�\bYou may not have noticed, but I just fainted, like, three times... I'm trying really hard to get used to other people looking at me."[\bUm! If you have some time, could you teach me some tips on confidence while dueling?"x\rMina: Oh! Please pose over there. Yes! Fantastic! Now that's a great composition! I could paint a picture of you!"x\rGuess I didn't introduce myself though. I'm Mina. I mean, I sort of am, actually just wander around doing my art."I\rMaybe your battling skills will be a masterpiece! Let's get going!"h\rAcerola: Hiya, I'm Acerola! I know I don't look it, but my family used to be pretty much royalty."{\rI love reading! Books can take us on journeys to fantastical worlds and tell the stories of people far away from us."J\rMaybe our battle will be one to be told in books for centuries too!"M\rHapu: Alola! This is how we greet people in my hometown every morning."�\rIt is good to wake up early! You should make the most of the time you have! Having to tend to the fields every morning has made me an early riser."V\rLooks like you are going to make a fine tale for yourself. Time to get serious."j\bNanu: You there, if do you wanna take this spot? I'm going home. I just wanna take it easy, y'know."u\bHere's to challenge me? What a hassle, crud. This is bad news. Well, we can't just ignore something like this."^\bDon't take it too serious now. You’ll tire yourself out if you’re always in a rush."�\rOlivia: Why hello there. Nice to meet you all, I'm Olivia. My partners are adorable, rugged little Rock- type. We'll grind you to dust."c\rOur skills are so polished, they're sparkling. I'm starting to feel like a polished diamond."P\rYou can count on me, kid. Get ready for your hardest Pokémon battle yet!"`\rKahili: Hi, i am a professional golfer and a trainer. I aim to perfect my skills as both."�\rI aim to make my matches entertaining for the spectators. Besides, I enjoy playing the games that the audience enjoys watching."[\rLet's see how far we can fly. The winds of victory will blow for me and my Pokémon!"a\bMolayne: Hi, I was observing the stars until you came up...yawn... I'm still super sleepy."w\bIt’s been a while since I’ve walked around in a new place and met so many new people. It’s a nice feeling."P\bNow I’ve got to do what I can to keep up with the others. Let's battle!"c\bHala: Dooot doo doo, just a kahuna on a stroll. Oh, this one's a rare visitor! Hi, I'm Hala."^\bYou’ll meet people and Pokémon...and may encounter some things that can’t be seen."g\bThe more you think about these things, the stronger your mind and body will become! Let's clash!"w\bHau: Hey, I'm Hau. Nice to meet you! I don't know anything about this place, so everything is so cool and fresh!"d\bBattles aren't about whether you win or lose. They're about whether you have the will to win!"2\bI wanna do all the fun stuff! Let's battle!"�\rLillie: Nice to meet you! My name's Lillie. Starting the day off with a warm smile and a greeting always puts me in a great mood!"h\rThere are trainers here who come to challenge you to battles, so you can’t let your guard down!"G\rI'll do my best so that no Pokémon have to end up getting hurt!"J\bGladion: What does a Pokémon Trainer really need to be successful?"i\bI trained for a long time trying to figure that out. I guess everyone might have their own answer."D\bBut at least for me... I want the strongest rival for myself."Y\rSelene: Alola! I’m Selene, the excitement has been nonstop ever since I arrived!"[\rLet’s be so energized today that we shine even brighter than the sun and the moon!",\rI'm fired up to the max! Bring it on!"j\bElio: Alola! My name’s Elio. Isn't it amazing that someone were able to make something this huge?"\\bThis club is pretty tough, but we make lots of lifelong memories by going through it."7\bI’d be happy to show you what i am capable of."V\bKukui: Hey there, nice to meet you! The name's Kukui. I hope we can be friends!"�\bI love to understand Pokemon's potential and capabilities, I let myself get hit with all kinds of moves so I can test their power!"l\bNow, you wanna go through my trial to make yourself stronger? That's right, put yourself to the test!"|\rLusamine: I am the president of the Aether Foundation. But please, just call me Lusamine. I'm so glad that we got to meet."�\rThere are people like you, who travel the islands to learn more about Pokémon. There are also unfortunate people who harm Pokémon for reasons."�\rI will be like a mother to all of those poor Pokémon and shower them with love. They will all be preserved for eternity in my collection."�\rOh, don't you worry. You just leave everything up to me. Trust me, children would all be much happier if they'd only listen to the adults around them."�\bGuzma: Greetings, cowering brat! The hated boss who beats you down, and beats you down, and never lets up... Yeah. Big bad Guzma is here!"�\bWe've got all these moldy old traditions of gyms and trials, It's about time we cut out all that silly garbage and make something new for ourselves."�\bAfter all, everyone already knows who the strongest Trainer is here. Wanna see what destruction looks like? it's your boy Guzma!"a\bEusine: My name is Eusine. I'm on the trail of a Pokémon named Suicune. Glad to meet you."q\bThere seems to be more than meets the eye with you... My gut tells me you seem to have met Suicune before."}\bMy desire to search for Suicune is far beyond yours... I won't stop following you until I've found out what I'm after!"G\rCheryl: Hello, my name's Cheryl. I'm sincerely glad to meet you."Q\rYou're my opponent of the day? My Pokémon have been itching for a battle."9\rI hope you'll be able to tire them out one by one!"P\rMira: I'm Mira... I want to get tougher so I won't be such a scaredy-cat."<\rSo get ready, Mira will show you all of what she got!"_\bRiley: I'm Riley. I'm a Trainer, and yes, it is a bit odd that I would be training here."{\bPeople training here would be those with too much time on their hands. So let's hope we can give each other a tough time!"K\bNow, we will be pulling out all the stops to put your Pokémon down."�\bBuck: Hehehe! Sorry! If you wanna be the greatest Trainer ever, that's going to be really tough. Because you're talking about me!"Z\bYou look puzzled. You really don't know anything, do you? Anyways, howdy, I'm Buck."e\bI can feel my Pokémon shivering inside their Poké balls! It's out of anticipation, not fear!"�\rMarley: I...am Marley. I... I don't like to talk... I choose my words carefully, but they may still hurt someone accidentally..."@\rWhen I think of that, I clam up... So sorry about that..."@\r...So? ...Are we going to battle? ...OK. I'll do my best."Y\bEmmet: I am Emmet. I am a Subway Boss. And I like winning more than anything else."^\bI am really serious. Really serious. Because if a battle is not serious, it is not fun.":\bSo everything's ready! Aim for victory! All aboard!"k\bIngo: I am the Subway Boss Ingo. Do you understand Pokémon well? Can you hold on to your principle?"v\bWhat can I see after winning, winning, and winning? You cannot know what happens after winning without winning."T\bTherefore, I will exert every possible effort to battle with you. All aboard!"|\bNoland: Hey, I had a look at your Battle Swap data. You seem to have the right idea, but you're still square in your head!"o\bListen up, okay? Knowledge isn't only about reading books or doing desk work. It may as well be useless!"�\bYou have to experience things with your heart and your body, understand? Shake out every last bit of your knowledge and bring it on!"�\rGreta: Hey! Howdy! ...Wait, are you the challenger? I don't know how to say it, but... To put it bluntly, you look pretty weak."c\rAre you sure you're up for me? Hmm... Well, all right! We'll take things easy to start with!"8\rOkay! Let's see you ignite my passion for battle!"\\bTucker: Ahahah! Do you hear this crowd! They're all itching to see our match! Ahahah!"o\bI bet you're twitching all over from the tension of getting to battle me! But don't worry about a thing!"j\bTucker, the star of the show, will bathe you in a brilliant glow! Right here and now! Let's see it!"I\rLucy: I am Lucy... I am the law here... For I am the Pike Queen..."A\rYou already know it, but to advance, you must defeat me..."k\rI'm not one for idle chatter. Hurry. Come on... Your luck... I hope you didn't use it all up here..."r\bSpenser: Young one of a Trainer! Do you believe in your Pokémon? Can you believe them through and through?"]\bMy physical being is with Pokémon always! My heart beats as one with Pokémon always!"^\bIf your bonds of trust are frail, you will never beat my brethren! Prove it to me here!"W\rAnabel: Greetings... My name is Anabel. I have heard several rumors about you..."�\rIn all honesty, what I have heard does not seem attractive in any way... The reason I've come to see you... Well, there is but one reason..."0\rLet me see your talent in its entirety..."�\bBrandon: Wouldn't you agree that explorations are the grandest of adventures? Your own wits! Your own strength! Your own Pokémon!"N\bAnd, above all, only your courage to lead you through unknown worlds..."w\bAah yes, young adventurer, indeed this life is grand! Grand, it is! Now, then! Bring your courage to our battle!"c\bPalmer: So, you've come this far! As a trainer of age, I'll have to give you my best effort."v\bThat's how the best Trainers show respect to each other. By battling all out as dedicated students of Pokémon!"y\bShow me the bond you've built with your Pokémon. Show me what you've learned through battles with other Trainers!"\rDahlia: No need to worry. Let chance do what it does. Like surprises from the game board, life goes through twists and turns."�\rThings will go as they will. But, enough of that. I know one thing for certain. You have arrived here not merely because you were lucky."D\rLet us not waste any time. I wish to test your skills myself!"�\bThorton: Bzweep! Sorry, don't mind me. What I'm using is an invention of mine. It's my data-analyzing machine telling me what you brought."i\bI see... I have to say, that's a good setup. Like say, 47%? Oh, don't let that number concern you!"#\bAll righty, let's get going!"f\bDarach: Welcome. As you know, Lady Caitlin, my employer, is not one to accept defeat willingly."T\bHowever, for a reason I'm not at liberty to disclose, she cannot battle here."�\bConsequently, I, Darach, will do battle in her ladyship's place. Let me assure you that you won't be shortchanged by facing me."V\rArgenta: Here allows Trainers to mount challenges with their favorite Pokémon."�\rI imagine there were tense moments getting here with your chosen one. But understand that one shines the brightest when a challenge is overcome."[\rI am Argenta, and I will be your most daunting challenge. I dare you to overcome me."c\bRocko: Hi, I believe having rock hard defense and determination will overcome all obstacles!"_\bYou'd better have true-grit determination, or you will have a hard time hurting my pals!"\bShow me your best!"O\bBrock: The world is huge. There are still many strong trainers like you."0\bI have faith that you will overcome them!"F\rMisty: You are looking at the world-famous beauty, Misty, here!"J\rYou'd better not get blown away by my looks and my all-out offense!"\rAre you ready, sweetie?"-\rMisty: Aiyeee! This makes me so angry!"U\rI need to clear my head of these defeats... I definitely won't lose next time!":\bLt. Surge: Hey, puny kid! I have to hand it to you."L\bIt takes guts to take me on. And you'd better keep your nerves tight."T\bBecause Pokémon battles are war! I'll show you and shock you into surrender!"2\bLt. Surge: Okay! You're the real deal, kid!"6\bBack to brushin' up. Keep goin' like lightning!"\\rErika: ...Zzz... zzz... Hm? Oh, good day to you. It makes me sleepy to be here alone."V\rDid you perhaps wish to challenge me? Very well... I, Erika, graciously accept."4\rLet my ladies demonstrate the art of Ikebana."*\rErika: Oh! I admire your technique."I\rI would be really happy to see your demonstration again next time."S\rSabrina: I had a vision of your arrival, and I know you are not a simpleton."R\rI saw a challenge from you, but intentionally didn't see further than that."H\rGetting ready, aren't you? Let's find out who the victor will be.";\rSabrina: Your power... far exceeds what I foresaw..."A\rYou'll become even stronger than you are now, I know it..."1\rJanine: Hi! I'm Janine! Remember the name!"i\rKnow that even though I'm the daughter of a reowned Elite Four, it doesn't mean that I'm inferior!"Z\rOtherwise you're going to pay the consequences of the horror I'm about to give you!"O\rJanine: Fufufufu... I'm sorry to disappoint you... You're the real deal."l\rI'm going to reapply myself and improve my skills, to become much better than both my father and you!"J\bBlaine: Good day! Do you know all about Pokémon? Especially yours?"`\bHow about the best type of Pokémon to train and cultivate? Bet that got you puzzled huh."G\bWanna know the burning answer? Let me give you a lesson on that!"P\bBlaine: Impressive! You have shown the wits and knowledge to overcome me."T\bIt makes me all fired up for more! Be passionate! Feel the burning curiosity!"y\bBill: Hiya! Call me Bill! I'm a true-blue Poké Maniac! I'm the one who developed the system to transfer Pokémon!"g\bHey! What's with that skeptical look? I'm not joshing you, pal. Speaking of that, why am I here?"B\bDid you come to see my Pokémon collection? Check this out!"G\bBill: That's a bummer. I've got to thank you for the great time."Q\bNow, I've gotta find out why am I here with the other Kanto gym leaders..."Z\rLorelei: Are you well versed in handling icy creatures? No one can best me on that."T\rWith my well-planned strategy, all Pokémon will be frozen solid at my mercy!"4\rHope you brought your winter coat along, heh."G\rLorelei: You're better than I thought. I'm feeling the heat now!"G\rI will be sure to think of a counter-strategy after this battle!"?\bRyuki: The name's Ryuki. I'm what you might call a star."]\bI'm gonna be a Kantonian Gym Leader one day! The whole world will know me soon enough!"V\bYou're gonna be my fan, right? Let our fiery spirits clash in a blaze of glory!"5\bRyuki: What a gig. You're a hidden talent too!"J\bIf we played it loud and well enough, our fame will be unstoppable!"<\rAgatha: Why are you here noseying about, pesky child?"`\rYou have a Pokédex on you! You're the child that Oak's taken under his wing, aren't you?"f\rPokémon are meant for battling! Not to be collected! I'll show you how a real Trainer battles!"1\rAgatha: You win. I've nothing else to say."B\rWell, what are you waiting for? Run along now, child! Shoo!"`\bTrace: Hi. You must have taken a long path to get here. Was it to get a worthy challenge?"_\bAs for me, I wanna catch tons of different Pokémon and train them up to be strong! Heh!"T\bMaybe I should check if your Pokémon really are doing well... with a battle!"P\bTrace: Man, you truly are something! But that doesn't mean I'm giving up!"<\bI'll keep taking on your challenges if we meet again!"e\bBlue: Who are you? My name's Blue. I was once the Kanto Champion, although it was short-lived."c\bBut I ain't any ordinary chump then! If I see a strong opponent, it makes me want to battle."V\bWanna give it a try? I'll know if you're good or not by battling you right now."p\bBlue: You're tough, I'll give you that. But there's always someone better. You have to be more dedicated!"4\bI gotta get back to training. Smell ya later!"`\rLeaf: Oh, whoops! You're not a Pokémon! Sorry, I thought you were some kind of Pokémon."r\rWell, uh… nice to meet you. I'm Green! Are you here because you're also looking for… something special?"G\rI noticed you got some good Pokémon there too, can I have them?"V\rGreen: Wow, you're strong! Oh, I know! Why don't you become one of my Pokémon!" \rThink about it, ok? Hehe."\bRed: ... ...""\b... ... ... ... ... ... ..."\b... ... ... ... ... ..."\bRed: ... ... ..."\bWords are unnecessary!"l\rRoxanne: Hi, Roxanne here. I like to strategize before a battle, applying what I've studied till now."[\rI'm sure we've both experienced many battles, gaining immense knowledge on battling."r\rWould you kindly demonstrate how you battle so I could learn? I would also see how much better I've become.">\rRoxanne: You were flawless. I still have much to learn."P\rI want to learn even more from you. Will you be my opponent then as well?"9\bBrawly: Huge wave incoming! Look out! Right on it!"b\bChurned by the rough waves of the seas, toughened by the cave of the outskirts. I'm Brawly!";\bYou want a challenge? Let's see what you're made of."C\bBrawly: Whoa. Wow! You made a bigger splash than I expected."m\bYour talent brings forth a wave of astonishment, overwhelming me. I look forward to it again. Ride on!"<\bWattson: Ah-ha! Fine young soul. Brimming with vigor."H\bI know what you want. You want to battle my Pokémon! Wahahahaha!"B\bI'll make sparks fly from you! Don't say I didn't warn you!"f\bWattson: Wahaha. You ended up giving me a thrill! I'm so impressed that I can't help but laugh!"H\bI swell with optimism, seeing a promising young Trainer like you!"a\rFlannery: Welcome... No, puny trainer! I see you've made it here to look for capable foes!"q\rUh...dare not underestimate me, I shall, uh... demonstrate the hot moves I have honed with my grandfather!")\rBrace yourself! Haiyaaaaaaaaaaaaa!"v\rFlannery: Your strength sure reminds me of my grandfather. I guess I was trying too hard to be someone I'm not."\\rWhen I don't act like myself, no wonder Pokémon that battle at my side get confused."u\bNorman: Well, the world of Pokémon is deep. I honestly think that no amount of training would ever be enough."E\bBut there's no challenge for me to battle a greenhorn Trainer!"W\bSo you'd better give it your best shot. I will do everything in my power to win!"O\bNorman: You did a great job. You went all out and earned that victory..."D\bI want my kid to learn from you. Hope you will meet him soon."B\rWinona: I'm one with the birds and have soared the skies..."C\rHowever grueling, we have triumphed with elegance and grace."Q\rWitness the elegant choreography by us. Don't blink or you will regret it!"U\rWinona: I see you are one with your Pokémon as well. I recognize your talent."T\rI know you'll keep aiming higher and higher! That's what brought you victory."Z\bTate: Heh heh heh... Were you surprised? \rLiza: Tee hee hee... Were you surprised?"D\bWe don't need to talk..... \r....because we can each tell...."?\b....what the other is thinking... \r...all in our minds!"4\bThis combinations of ours! \rCan you beat it?"f\bTate: The bond between you and your Pokémon... \rLiza: ...far stronger than ours. We can tell."D\bWe will meet again someday.... \r...we are very sure of that."j\bJuan: It seems you have a compelling reason to battle me. Did you know that I am a retired trainer?"_\bI had given up my position as Gym Leader once. I had entrusted everything to my student."�\bBut enough chatter. I guess a Coordinator could show you a trick or two today. Witness the grand illusion of water sculpted by us!"k\bJuan: Like the finest music, the battles we made together strikes chords of inspiration in my heart."U\bI close my eyes, and I see visions of you soaring. A certain sign of nobility!"c\bSidney: They said I was a punk, but I showed them what the dark side's beauties are made of!"e\bYou can also talk all you want, but offense over defense! All that matters is how strong I am!"h\bNow I like that look you're giving me. I guess you'll give me a good match. Let's get down to it!"c\bSidney: Listen to what this loser has to say. It's a long way, but you've got what it takes."Y\bAnd when you gain new strength, come back here! No holds barred. No hard feelings!"}\rPhoebe: Uh-huh.. Uh-huh... Hahaha! You're right. Oh? Gimme a minute.... Hi! My friend's saying you are looking for me."s\rYou can't see her? Ahahaha. Of course. She is a ghost, and I am one of the few able to communicate with her."c\rDon't be afraid. Anyway, if you are looking for a challenge, see if you can hurt my friends!"k\rPhoebe: There's definitely a stronger bond between you and your team. It's only natural that I lost."Z\rI'd like to see how far your bond can carry you. Don't bring shame to us by losing!"k\rGlacia: I've traveled afar, so that I can hone my icy skills. But all I have seen are weak trainers."R\rWhat about you? It would please me to no end if you could go all out on me."8\rI wonder what are you going to show me. Bring it."l\rGlacia: What a relief, how fiery that was! Spirits burning high that my icy moves pale in comparison."X\Don't be complacent. If you feel the need to cool your emotions, come to me again."v\bDrake: In their natural state, Pokémon are wild living things. They can help us, hinder us, and they are free."i\bFor us to battle with Pokémon as partners, do you know what it takes? Do you know what is needed?"4\bIf you don't, you will never prevail over me!"f\bDrake: You deserve every bit of credit for coming this far. You do seem to know what is needed."|\bYes, a true virtuous heart. It is through that that Pokémon learn right from wrong. The influence helps them grow strong!"{\bSteven: You... What did you see on your journey with your Pokémon? What did you feel, meeting so many Trainers like you?"H\bWhat has awakened in you? I want you to hit me with it all of it!"\bBring me your best shot!"p\bSteven: Congratulations! The feelings you have... and the Pokémon that responded with all their might..."n\bThey came together as one, and created an even greater power. And thus, you were able to grasp victory!"�\bWallace: At times your Pokémon should dance like a spring breeze, at others they should strike like lightning. I want to feel bedazzled by your performance!"�\bWho can most elegantly dance with their Pokémon? Who can exhibit the most graceful art in battle, you or me and my grand illusion of water?""\bShow me right here and now!"\\bWallace: Bravo! I realize now your authencity and magnificence as a Pokémon Trainer."C\bI find much joy in having met you and your Pokémon. Encore!"x\bWally: N-nice to meet you! I'm Wally. My Pokémon and I are always moving together, little by little, day by day!"O\bI'm sure that you and your Pokémon must have had to overcome a lot too."k\bMy Pokémon have given me courage and strength to fight. I have to win for their sake! So get ready!"�\bWally: Arghhhh!!! Hah... you. Thank you for not holding back. I feel like I've been able to take another step forward thanks to you."b\bLook out! One day... I swear I'll catch up to you! That's a promise I intend to live up to!"A\rMay: Heeeeeeey! How's it going? I'm May! Glad to meet you!"~\rMy dream is to become friends with Pokémon all over the world! I want to understand everything about you and your Pokémon!"O\rWould you show me all your Pokémon in a battle with me? I'm so excited!"V\rMay: Ohoho, wow, you did it! I am defeated, but I have learnt so much from you!"T\rYou make me feel passionate about getting stronger, maybe next time I'll win!":\bBrendan: Huh, hi. Name's Brendan. Nice to meet you!"t\bMy dream is to become a better Pokémon Trainer! I want to learn even more and become stronger than I am now!"r\bWith you being here, you may have faced and defeated my dad. But facing me is a different story! Here goes!"M\bBrendan: Hmmm... I didn't seem to have it together this time. Oh well!"@\bI'll have to try harder next time! You can count on that!"c\rViola: That determined expression... That glint in your eye says you're up to the challenge."|\rIt's fantastic! Whether it's the tears of frustration that follow a loss or the blossoming of joy that comes with victory."{\rViola: The world you see through a lens, and the world you see with a Pokémon by your side, can look entirely different."V\rYou and your Pokémon have shown me a whole new depth of field! Just fantastic!"}\bGrant: I've been waiting in eager anticipation for a worthy challenger! It's quite an achievement to participate here."V\bGrant: There are some things that seem out of reach no matter how hard you try."Z\bHowever, it's important that you never give up, no matter the opponent or the odds!"_\rKorrina: Haha! Time for Lady Korrina's grand appearance! Just kidding! Nice to meet you!"{\rI was doing some special training with my Lucario when all of a sudden, it was drawn in by your aura and dashed off here."P\rI think Lucario wants to battle with you. Would you accept our challenge?"\\rKorrina: Oh! I have been defeated! Alack, alay! Lady Korrina gave a terrible display."A\rWhat an explosive display of strength, far exceeding mine!"�\bRamos: Ho ho! I may not look it, but I'm the best green fingers yer could meet. If yeh want to know about plants, I'm yer man."k\bSo what'd yer think, whippersnapper? Did yeh enjoy the greenery along your path to being a Champion?"V\bTheir survival is a sign of their strength. Yer sure yer up to facing all that?"g\bRamos: Yer believe in yer Pokémon... And they believe in yer, too... Strength like mighty oaks."R\bIt was a fine battle, young sprout. Yeh sure can't force a true friendship."V\bClemont: Hi! I like my Pokémon battles how I like my inventions. HIGH-VOLTAGE!"{\bAnd Pokémon sure are mysterious... Even as far as science has come, there's still so much we don't know about them."[\bNonetheless, let's both do our best in battle. The future is now, thanks to science!"o\bClemont: There's no shame in losing. I'm glad I get to learn something new thanks to strong challengers."�\bBut what I'm trying to do is just to enjoy everyday to the fullest with my Pokémon, while exploring the science that I love with my inventing."g\rValerie: Oh, if it isn't a young trainer. You've come fluttering down to me on a fortunate wind."l\rThen I suppose you have earned yourself the right to battle me. I hope it proves entertaining to you."F\rValerie: Yes. A fine battle. Victory is captivating, is it not?"a\r... ... ... Ah... Forgive me. I was so captivated, I forgot for a moment that it is yours."N\rOlympia: The time has arrived for us to be standing here. I am Olympia."H\rNow our paths have intertwined and crossed. Our Pokémon as well."J\rThis is a ritual to decide your fate and future. The battle begins!"j\rOlympia: A testament of your skill. Proof of your power. A symbol of trust. Your Pokémon obey you."<\rCountless stars light your way forth. Have no limits."w\bWulfric: Impressive! Your Pokémon fought with great courage. I can tell that you've trained your Pokémon well."s\bYour Pokémon really threw everything they had into that battle just now. You truly are something, you know?"�\rMalva: Oooh, you wicked little Trainer! You're just too much, you know? You're so amusing that I just want to burn you up where you stand!"G\rBut I'll let you live... I will definitely remember this battle!"~\bSiebold: Devote yourself entirely, so even that which will fade and disappear is ingrained forever upon your heart and mind!"�\bIt is the duty of both Trainers and Chefs to find the good in any raw materials they have to work with. There lies the answer to reaching ever higher."e\bWikstrom: Well met, young challenger! Verily am I the famed blade of hardened steel, Wikstrom!"�\bWikstrom: What sweet, glorious pain and joy now rock my mighty heart? My will, which even shakes spears, trembles at so fine a battle as this!"j\bWhat now? I am undone! Good knight, you are indeed my equal, and worthy to proceed this lofty hall!"u\rDrasna: Oh goodness, hello to you! Welcome, welcome. You must be a strong Trainer. That's just wonderful news!"S\rDrasna: Oh, you! You're too much! You and your Pokémon are simply charming!"F\rWith your Pokémon, I'm sure you can beat every last one of us."{\rDiantha: I-I'm so choked up that it's hard to know what I should say, but I... I... I'm just so glad at this moment."`\rAfter all, it gave me the chance to meet and battle with you and your wonderful Pokémon!"J\rShauna: I'm so glad I went on a journey. I made some great friends."{\rI was able to visit many places, meet a lot of nice people, and make many wonderful memories! I bet you are the same too!"v\bTierno: All right! Nice to meetcha! Y'know, it'd feel like we were closer if we called each other by nicknames."9\bCan I call you Jammy? Hahaha! Alright, lighten up!"z\bAnyway, can we have a Pokémon battle? Oh, uh... sorry to just throw that at you. But that's why we're here, right?"A\bTierno: That's awesome, it makes me wanna dance right now!"M\bThat display of strength makes me wanna groove and spin in excitement!"b\bTrevor: Um, hi. I'm Trevor. My dream is to see all kinds of Pokemon the world has to offer!"[\bTherefore I'm on the journey with my Pokedex to travel high mountains and wide seas."9\bThat doesn't mean I can't battle though. Let's go!"U\bTrevor: There is still so much I don't know. Do I just not have what it takes?"I\bOh, so you can't learn everything just from the Pokédex... I see!"^\rSerena: Everyone has their own good points. That’s true of people and Pokémon alike!"t\rI’ve definitely noticed what your good points are! I’ll bet you anything your Pokémon have noticed, too."\bI think it would be fun to compete to see who's stronger. But we can't call it a competition unless I beat you at least once!"|\bCalem: You're one of my best opponents! You might come up with new strategies that'll help battles go a lot smoother."U\bBefore you ask, no, I'm not going to tell you what strategies I use next time!"Z\bIlima: You, or should I say you and your Pokémon, make quite the interesting team!"P\bI'll be feeling the aftershocks from that battle for a long time to come."a\rYou look like an able-bodied Trainer. We could go fishing for wild Pokémon together then!"R\rBut more important than that… I will show you what a serious Lana can do!"V\rLana: Phew... that was fantastic! You and your Pokémon were perfectly in sync!"Z\rIt seems I was too early to think that my full power would be enough to defeat you."r\bKiawe: Astounding! Being thrilled by an opponent's excitement... Nothing else makes me want to battle more!"V\bYes... That's exactly the sort of intense training that made me who I am today."q\rYou aren't? OK. But remember to take a break here and there. A Pokémon master doesn't always go hustling."s\rI use my chef's intuition to pick out the cream of the crop! Let's get cooking into the heat of battle then!"s\rMallow: Awwww, I lost. Guess now I'll have to get my Grass-type Pokémon to make me feel all better again..."P\rAnd if you're hungry next time, don't be shy! Step on up and have a bite!"_\bUm! If you have some time, could you teach me some tips on confidence while battling me?"`\bSophocles: I'm shy... and I've certainly felt lonely before, but I'm great with robotics."]\bWhat? You're interested in how machines are constructed? Why didn't you say so sooner?"~\rGuess I didn't introduce myself though. I'm Mina, a painter. I mean, I sort of am, actually just wander around doing my art."V\rMina: Hrmmm! Well, this is frustrating. I failed to really use my full power..."�\rI'd like to draw a picture of the way you look when you're battling! Let's have another full-power Pokémon battle again sometime, yeah?"Z\rLillie: Ugh, you got us. I wish we'd had a little more time to prepare. That's all."W\rWell, moping around won't fix anything, will it? Come on, let's try to cheer up!"o\bNanu: You there, if do you wanna take this spot? I'd like to go home. I just wanna take it easy, y'know."y\bYou're here to challenge me? What a hassle, crud. This is bad news. Well, I can't just ignore something like this."�\bNanu: I'm an old man. I try not to have dreams anymore. As long as young kids like you enjoy yourselves, that's all I can ask for."Q\bTrying to get even stronger is fine, too... But that's a really long path."b\rHapu: Yes. It's unfortunate that we lost, but I guess we'll just have to cheer for you now."J\rYou are undoubtedly a prodigious Trainer. You did an admirable job."�\rOlivia: Why hello there. Nice to meet you all, I'm Olivia. My partners are adorable, rugged little Rock-types. We'll grind you to dust."T\rOlivia: Diamonds only sparkle after the coal is pushed to its absolute limit."T\rI think your journey will hold many surprises. I hope it holds many joys too."`\rKahili: Hi, I am a professional golfer and a trainer. I aim to perfect my skills as both."O\rKahili: Whew! Battling with you was like a refreshing breeze! Thank you."\\rOh, are you interested in golf too? You could be talented. I'd be happy to teach you."b\bMolayne: Hi, I was observing the stars until you came up... yawn... I'm still super sleepy."r\bMolayne: In every situation, you pick the best moves and items. So I too have to rack my brain in battle..."?\bBut you outsmarted me in the end. You're second to none!"h\rAcerola: Hiya, I'm Acerola! I know I don't look it, but my family used to pretty much be royalty."M\rAcerola: Phew! Well, there goes my hope of beating you to smithereens."u\rI hope we can keep doing fun things together! There's a whole world of exciting things for us to do out there!"X\bHala: Dooot doo doo, just a kahuna on a stroll. Oh, a rare visitor! Hi, I'm Hala."i\bYou’ll meet people and Pokémon... and may sometimes encounter some things that can’t be seen."r\bHala: ...Hmmph! This result comes as no surprise to me. What a fine Trainer... and what fine Pokémon, too!"x\bA heart-pounding battle like that always sends a shiver through my whole body! I'm sure my Pokémon felt it, too!"{\bHau: We managed to pull off something pretty amazing, when my partners and I were all in sync and wanting the same thing."Z\bBut looks like we're still one step away from being the strongest Trainer and team!"?\bGladion: I didn't beat you, but it was still worth it..."�\bAt the very least, I can appreciate your strength a lot more now than I could've before. Thanks. You've helped make us stronger."^\rSelene: Alola! I’m Selene, there's been nonstop excitement ever since I arrived here!"[\rSelene: Aww, that's a shame. But I'm lucky to be able to experience this excitement!"C\rJust thinking about it makes me want to challenge you again!"i\bElio: Alola! My name’s Elio. Isn't it amazing that someone was able to make something this huge?"6\bI’d be happy to show you what I'm capable of."7\bElio: Whoa! You're strong. Looking great, buddy!"u\bThe strength of friendship, being kind, having fun... Maybe I should say... we all got stronger together, huh?"-\rMisty: Aiyeee! That makes me so angry!":\bBack to brushin' up. You keep goin' like lightning!"Q\bBlaine: Impressive! You have shown your wits and knowledge to overcome me."Q\bMakes me all fired up for more! Be passionate! Feel the burning curiosity!"<\bFalkner: A defeat is a defeat. You are strong indeed."T\bAs long as I have lofty ambitions, I can fly as far as I want. Just like you!"f\bFalkner: People say wings can be clipped with a jolt... I won't allow such insults to my birds!"W\bThey have not faced my magnificent wings that have taken me to greatest heights!"Y\bI'll show you the real power of the glorious flying Pokémon! Winds, stay with me!"N\bBugsy: Bug-type Pokémon are deep. There are many mysteries to explore."g\bBut I should start my studies of other Pokémon too. I'm grateful that you made me realize that."H\bBugsy: You seems like a trainer with great knowledge in Pokémon."x\bBut I never lose when it comes to Bug-type Pokémon. My research is going to make me an expert authority of them!"<\bLet me demonstrate what I've learned from my studies."b\bBut I should start studying other Pokémon too. I'm grateful that you made me realize that.",\rWhitney: Waaaaaaahhhhhhh! You meanie!"M\rSniff... Don't think that this is over. I will get stronger next time!"M\rWhitney: Hi! I'm Whitney. Pokémon are super-cute! Don't you think so?"C\rAnd since I am super-cute too, I am definitely good at this!"T\rYou want a battle with me, the talented super-cute me? That's a warning hint!"f\bMorty: I don't think our potentials are so different. But you seem to have something I don't..."i\bIf I battle with you next time, I will be able to see something new again... I look forward to it."E\bMorty: Good of you to have come; I can see what others cannot."[\bAnd just a bit more... I would be a truly powerful trainer, worthy of meeting Ho-oh."O\bShow me the power you possess. You're going to help me reach that level!"B\bChuck: Losing to a kid. The next generation is doing great."O\bBut a loss is a loss! From now on, I'm going to train 24 hours everyday!"d\bChuck: WAHAHAH! So you've come to train under my wing? No? Then you just spoiled my training!"\\bLet me tell you, I'm tough enough to crush stones and shatter bones! Urggh! Oooarrgh!"Z\bWhat? It has nothing to do with Pokémon? That's true! Come on, we shall do battle!"F\rJasmine: Y-you are well-polished, in both skill and kindness..."Q\rUm... I don't know how to say this, but thank you for loving your Pokemon."Z\rJasmine: Oh... uh, hello. Do you love your Pokemon? Regardless of their appearance?"u\rS-steel type Pokemon are hard, cold, sharp and really strong... but they yearn for gentle love and care too..."6\rUh... I'm not lying. Um, may I prove to you...?"M\bPryce: Impressive prowess. It's rare to find a Trainer as good as you."U\bWhen snow melts, spring arrives. Cherish your time together with your Pokemon."�\bPryce: I have been training since before you were even born. Pokemon, alike humans, have seen many experiences and suffering in our lives."C\bSince I am your elder, let me teach you what I mean by that."8\bThe demonstration of power. I do not lose easily."V\rClair: What?! Here to brag about your victory? Fine. Congratuations! Happy now?"]\rGeez. You are a mysterious trainer, but you made me realise what is it that I lack of."n\rClair: The audacity to look me in the eye. You are looking at the world's best Dragon-type Master here."e\rI can hold my own even against Elite Four members. To think you have the guts to challenge me.";\rI will use my full power against you. Let's do this!"a\bWill: I have observed your techniques, you're the best without a doubt. I have no regrets.";\bThis battle will go down in history. I'm sure of it."Y\bWill: Welcome, you and Fate has chose me. Allow me to introduce myself. I am Will."`\bI have trained all around the world, to reach to where people have acknowledged my might."@\bLet me put on this show, to convince you as well. Behold!"n\bKoga: I have subjected you to everything iI could muster. But my efforts failed. I must hone my skills."L\bI am looking forward to see you put your abilities to test and shine."a\bKoga: Fwahahaha! So you found me, the one who lives in shadow. Makes me shiver with mirth."j\bMy intricate style will confound and destroy you. The true terror are not merely about brute force."I\bPrepare to be the victim of my techniques... You shall see soon..."D\bBruno: You are still standing firm. My challenge's satisfied."Q\bI have no other words. Do not trouble yourself on my behalf. Move forward!"H\bBruno: Extreme training results in unleashing untapped potential."^\bI see no fear in you. Determined. So are you one of the strongest trainers around here?"T\bNevermind, I am challenging you! Bow down to our overwhelming power. Hoo hah!"n\rKaren: There are no such thing as weak Pokemon. Truly skilled trainers would win with their loved ones."[\rI like your style. You knew what's important. Hit me up whenever you are free again."<\rKaren: What now? You wanna challenge me? How amusing."e\rIf you have not heard of them, I'm known for my overpowering tactics. Think you can handle me?"&\rTry me. Entertain me. Let's go."i\rRoxanne: Hi, Roxanne here. I like to strategize before a battle, applying what i studied till now."^\rI'm sure we've both experienced many battles, learning countless knowledge on battling."r\rWould you kindly demonstrate how you battle so i could learn? I would also see how much better i've become."C\bBrawly: Whoa. Wow! You made a bigger splash than i expected."`\bChurned by the rough waves of the seas, toughen by the cave of the outskirts. I'm Brawly!":\bYou wanna challenge? Let's see what you're made of."C\bI'll make sparks fly from you! Don't say I didn't warn you!""q\rUh...dare not underestimate me, I shall, uh... demonstrate the hot moves i have honed with my grandfather!"@\bI want my kid to learn from you. Hope you will meet soon."S\rWinona: I'm one with the birds, who soared the skies, in the winds and high."N\rWitness the elegant choreography by us. Don't blink or you will regret!"e\bTate: The bond between you and your Pokemon... \rLiza: ...far stronger than ours. We can tell."U\bI close my eyes, and i see visions of you soaring. A certain sign of nobility!"e\bJuan: It seems you have a compelling reason to battle me. Did you know i am a retired trainer?"e\bSidney: They said i was a punk, but i showed them what i am made of. The dark side's beauties!"e\bYou can also talk all you want, but offense over defense! All that matters is how strong i am!"h\bNow i like that look you're giving me. I guess you'll give me a good match. Let's get down to it!"e\rPhoebe: There's definitely a stronger bond between you and your team. Ony natural that i lost."o\rYou can't see her? Ahahaha. Of course. She is a ghost, and i am one of the few able to commune with her."m\rGlacia: What a relief, how fiery that was! Spirits' burning high that my icy moves pale in comparison."f\rGlacia: I've traveled afar, so i can hone my icy skills. But all i have seen are weak trainers."_\bDrake: You deserve every credit for coming this far. You do seem to know what is needed."{\bYes, a true virtuous heart. It is through that Pokemon learn right from wrong. The influence helps them grow strong!"u\bDrake: In their natural state, Pokemon are wild living things. They can help us, hinder us, and they are free."h\bFor us to battle with Pokemon as partners, do you know what it takes? Do you know what is needed?"X\bRoark: We lost control there. With skill like yours, it's natural for you to win."]\bNext time, I'd like to challenge you to Fossil-digging race underground in the region!"�\bRoark: I'm but one Trainer who decided to walk proudly with Rock-type. Everyday, we toughened ourselves by digging up Fossils."n\bCould I show you how tough we are? I need to see the toughness of the Pokemon that battle with you too!"\bThis'll be rocking!"N\rGardenia: How do you feel? I want to win and brag about my Pokemon too."L\rI try to be as tough as i can, but you are the victor today. Amazing!"y\rGardenia: I can't deny that Grass-type have many weak points, but that's not the only factor in deciding who wins!"p\rMy Pokemon are growing good and strong. You can't go wrong with me! Come on, let's cut to the good stuff!"6\rLet's get down to battle! A real quick one, OK?"V\rMaylene: Learn from your foe by wininng, and learn from your foe by losing too."J\rEverything is an experience. Yes. I've still got some room to grow!"{\rMaylene: Nice to see you. I don't really know what it means to be strong. But i will do the best I can as a Trainer."L\rThanks to my training, I'm slowly gaining more confidence as it goes."B\rI also take battling very seriously. Whenever you're ready!"U\bCrasher Wake: Hunwah! It's gone and ended! How will I say this... I want more!"o\bI had fun at the end, whether i win or lose! I hope your victory will put more smiles on people's faces!"k\bCrasher Wake: The ring is my rolling sea~ The towering waves shaped me~ Crash! Crash! Crasher Wake~!"|\bMy Pokemon were toughed up by stormy white waters! They'll take everything you throw at them and then pull you under!"8\bVictory will be ours! Come on, let's get it done!"V\rFantina: Excusè moi! Dumbfounded! Très très strong! Your power so admirable!"g\rMerci beacoup, for having this dance with moi! Ever you have time, see moi again, ok? Au revoir!"r\rFantina: Ah, oui, challenge you are here for? I hope very much you enjoy them, you seem to be très strong."V\rBut win i shall, non? Because moi, how you say, is of course très fantastique!"P\rEnfin, so it shall be. I wish to show you battling à la danse classique."d\bByron: Gwahahaha! You were strong enough to take down my prized team. I recognize your power."O\bI saw something great in you. Do show your power to other Trainers, too!"b\bBryon: Trainer! You're young, just like my son, Roark, on the quest to challenge the world."�\bWith more Trainers like you taking charge, the future of Pokemon is bright! But as a wall myself to the youngsters, I'm not stepping aside just yet!"S\bI'll take your challenge. I have the confidence to batter down your defense!"p\rCandice: Wow! You're great! You've earned my respect! I think your focus and will bowled us over totally!"9\rBut next time I'll focus even more and won't lose!"\\rCandice: You're going to be my opponent? Sure thing! I was waiting for someone tough!"E\rBut i should tell you, I'm tough, because i know how to focus."9\rI'll show you just what I mean. Get ready to lose!"a\bVolkner: ...Hehehe. Hahahah! ...That was the most fun I've had since... I don't know when!"Z\bIt made me excited to know you and your team will keep battling to greater heights!"d\bVolkner: Sigh... Alright. It's not often that i get challengers. But they've all been boring."^\bI didn't break a sweat beating them all. But anyway, I guess we'd better get this done."M\bI hope you're the one who'll make me remember how fun it is to battle."Y\bAaron: Being perfect sure is a deep and complex affair. I will now concede defeat."=\bBut i think you came to see how great Bug-type can be!"U\bAaron: Hello! It's good to meet you! I should explain, I'm a huge fan of bugs."k\bThey might be nasty and mean, and yet they're beautiful too. Would you like to take on my challenge?"N\bI want to become perfect, just like my bug Pokemon. Let me take you on!"s\rBertha: You're quite something, youngster. I like how you and your Pokemon earned the win by working as one."W\rThat's what makes you so strong. Ahahaha! I think you can go as far as you want."d\rBertha: Well, well. You're quite the adorable one, but you've got a spine. Ahaha! I'm Bertha."R\rI have a preference for Ground-type Pokemon. Vast, wide and ever-embracing."B\rWell, would you show this old lady how much you've learned?"z\bFlint: Why i oughta...! I don't believe it! I lost! I didn't take you for granted... But i didnt expect you to win!"B\bI'm blown away by this! You and your Pokemon are hot stuff!"�\bFlint: Yo! The name's Flint! Battles are clashes of the burning spirit of Pokemon, ain't about appearances or what's weak or strong."�\bIt's about whether combatants can burn hot or not! I could feel your fiery spirits! Let me tell ya, my heart's always on fire!"1\bAll right, hotshot! Let's spice things up!"Q\bLucian: The highs and lows. You are as remarkable as the book i just read."a\bPlease step through the exit at your right, while I'll be reading books to calm my nerves."[\bLucian: Ah, you timed your arrival well. I've just finished reading a book, you see."\bAllow me to introduce myself, I am Lucian, a user of the Psychic-type. You've proven yourself to be outstanding getting here."W\bSo i'm afraid i will have to go all out against you to live up to my reputation."~\bCilan: What a surprise... You are very strong, aren't you? I guess my brothers wouldn't have been able to defeat you either."\\bAt least I'm glad I was able to bring out the delectable charm of Grass-type Pokemon."d\bCilan: Um. My name is Cilan. I like Grass-type Pokemon, they are always so deep and profound."n\bHow about it. Would you like to take part in this match against me? There's still much to learn for me."Q\bNothing personal... No hard feelings... We're gonna battle, come what may."B\bChili: Whoa ho! You're on fire! You scorched everyone, huh?"H\bBut you have to hand it to me for putting up a good fight, right?"i\bChili: Listen up! My name is Chili! I light things up with Fire-type Pokemon, like habanero tacos!"V\bThat's that, then! I'm going to show you what me and my blazing Pokemon can do!"A\bGets you fired up, doesn't it? Get ready for the scorcher!"s\bCress: How amazing! Even if there were a lot of reasons, you managed to take on someone as impressive as me!"c\bI plan on retraining myself with the aim of defeating you after you've become even stronger!"w\bCress: Please to make your acquaintance, I'm Cress, a specialist in Water-type Pokemon. Refreshing as i like it."j\bIt shall be I and my esteemed Pokemon that you must face in battle. Would you be so kind to oblige?"S\bJust as water flowling from high places to low is natural, so is my victory."X\rLenora: Your fighting style is so enchanting. It is charming. I'm glad I met you!"]\rBattling is second nature to you, isn't it? Your victory is the result of that, right?"h\rLenora: Welcome! You came all the way out here now! Don't be shy! You're too young to be bashful!"y\rWhen i was little, my dad would always bring home bones he dug up. I was very captivated by what they were before!"{\rNow I'm also going to research how you battle with the Pokemon you've so lovingly raised. Curiosity is the spice of life!"h\bBurgh: Aww... I lost. Whatever! Losing to you doesn't bug me, because you are a-MAZ-ingly strong."B\bWin or lose, Bug-type Pokemon are still cool and beautiful."p\bBurgh: Ah hah! Lights' on! My Bug-type Pokemon are scurrying with excitement about getting to battle you!"t\bIf the battle brings out the beauty in my mates, it will be a scene that makes my heart flutter, win or lose."�\bM'hm... I feel like i can paint a picture unlike any before. OK! I can hear my battle muse loud and clear. Let's get straight to it!"_\rElesa: My, oh my... You have a sweet fighting style. You shocked me through and through."v\rI want my Pokemon to be bathe in glamourous spotlight. In that sense, your Pokemon were gleaming very brightly!"�\rElesa: Yes sweetie. I'm Elesa, the world famous model. Welcome to my main stage! My beloved Pokemon and your Pokemon shall compete."Y\rC'est fini! When I'm certain of that, I feel an electric jolt run through my body!"`\rI want to feel the sensation, so now my beloved Pokemon are going to make your head spin!"{\bClay: Fer such a young 'un, ya have an imposin' battle style. I wonder what kind a journey ya had that made ya so strong."@\bBut, i still don't like losin'! Come here again, alrite'?"h\bClay: Harrumph! Kept me waitin', didn't ya, kid? So yer the Trainer they been talkin' about, huh."r\bHow much stronger ya get comes from how much ya want to win! If ya want ta win, don't make excuses! Got it?"v\bIf yer gonna bellyache, just forget 'bout fightin'! Well, I might be fussin' 'bout nothing when it comes to ya.":\rSkyla: You're a pretty amazing trainer, aren't you?"j\rMy Pokemon and I are happy, because for the first time in a while, we fight with our full strength."\rSkyla: Hee-hee! I've been waiting for you. You're a tough trainer who can face the wind and not get blown off your feet!"k\rSo this is going to be a showdown, that decides who's at the top, right? I love being on the summit!"b\rCause you can see forever and ever from high places! So, how about you and I have some fun?"A\bBrycen: You are strong! No, both you and your Pokemon are."S\bThe stars of this show, this story, were you and your Pokemon. You did well."b\bBrycen: Pleased to meet you. I'm Brycen. In the past, i was hurt and in a depressing state."d\bThen someone shared this with me... There is strength in being with other people and Pokemon."i\bReceiving their support makes you stronger. I'll show you this power i learned etched in my heart."a\rRoxie: You didn't win! I lost! I was weak and make my Pokemon feel how much losing stinks!"W\rWatch out~! Next time we meet, I'm going to give you a toxic shock as promised~!"j\rRoxie: You don't do anything! What do you know~?! You don't do anything! How're you gonna change~?!"Y\rI've got you covered~! I'm gonna give you a toxic shock and open up your mind~!!!!"T\rI'm Roxie~! Listen up~! I'm gonna rock the audience right outta their seats~!"�\bCheren: I'll keep battling many trainers and Pokemon like this, and if i can learn what kind of person I am, it will open up my path."�\bI'm sure this path will lead me to become the person I'm meant to be. Pokemon will always be with you and me as our path goes."u\bCheren: Do you want to show how strong you are by winning, or do you want to learn what battling really means?"�\bEven if hurt, my Pokemon will fight for me with just one command. I think I'll value and trust your Pokemon more if you keep that fact close to your heart."h\bThat's right! I battle with everything to find the ideal realtionship between Pokemon and people!"K\bDrayden: Wonderful. I'm grateful we had a chance to meet and battle."K\bMake a bright future, not just for yourself, but for others as well."~\bDrayden: As a trainer, I've simply been pursing greater strength. But now I am aging, thinking about the time i have left..."U\bWhat I'm searching for now is a young trainer who can show me a bright future."s\bLet's battle with everything we have: your skill, my experience, and the love we've raised our Pokemon with."J\bMarlon: You don't just look strong, you're a deep threat fo' reals!"h\bLike a ragin' sea that washes everythin' away! Uihaa~ I was swept away by your might and passion!"U\bMarlon: Uihaa~ Sup! So I'm facing you! That's a good catch right off the wall."g\bI'm strong like the ocean's wide. You're gonna get swept away, fo' sho'. Eh, that's enough talk."G\bHow 'bout you and I make some waves and sweep the audience away?"|\bGrimsley: Whether you get to fight at full strength, or luck smiling on you. Where there's a winner, there's also a loser."Q\bA loss is a loss. Right now, you and your Pokemon are shining brilliantly."o\bGrimsley: Man oh man... Challengers coming one by one. Well, no matter, life is a serious battle anyway."x\bIt's more important to master the cards you're holding than to complain about the ones your opponents were dealt."w\bWhat will be determined here is which of us can absorb the light and shine of this match. Let's our fates begin."V\rShauntal: Do you ever feel at a loss of words when something greatly moves you?"t\rI'm a writer, but right now I'm having trouble putting my feelings into words. You were just that impressive!"�\rShauntal: The trainer's thoughts with the Pokemon's mind... That's part of a novel i wrote. I absolutely love writing about Pokemon!"u\rBeginnings are important, whether in a good novel or a good battle. Oh, excuse me. You're a challenger, right?"H\rWould you like to be the subject of my new novel? How about that?"u\bMarshal: There is no single strongest Pokemon or best combination. That's why it is difficult to keep winning."t\bHowever, i think a heart that desires strength is a precious ideal. I respect you, because you have it. Whew!"H\bMarshal: My name is Marshal, the No. 1 pupil of my mentor, Alder."x\bIn order to master the art of fighting, I've kept training. You're also walking a similar path with your Pokemon."Y\bIt is my intention to test you. To take you to your limits of your strength. Kiai!"f\rCaitlin: Winning is important, but what's more important is whether I've done better this time."t\rI want to improve and win more elegantly, so i invite you to be my opponent again in the future, if you wish."M\rCaitlin: Who are you? How impudent you are to disturb my sleep. Hmf..."y\rYou appear to possess a combination of strength and kindness. What I look for in my opponent is superb strength..."Z\rVery well. Make your best effort not to bore me with a yawn-inducing battle. Clear?"o\bBenga: So exciting! You and your Pokemon's combination! Amazing teamwork! You can go anywhere with that!"|\bHey! Hey!! You better keep aiming higher and promise to come back and challenge me! Else I will get to the top in no time!"V\bBenga: You! Yeah! I knew it, you smells tough! But do you know how strong i am?"_\bHey, hey! Look at me! I want to battle with you! My Pokemon haven't been through enough!"?\bWe'll see who's stronger! Let's try hard to be the best!"\rViola: The world you see through a lens, and the world you see with a Pokemon by your side, can look entirely different."U\rYou and your Pokemon have shown me a whole new depth of field! Just fantastic!"f\bRamos: Yeh believe in yer Pokemon... And they believe in yeh, too... Strength like mighty oaks."g\bClemont: No shame in losing. I'm glad I get to learn something new thanks to strong challengers."�\bBut what I'm trying to do is just to enjoy everyday to the fullest with my Pokemon, while doing the science that i love with my inventing."`\rOlympia: A testament of your skill. Proof of your power. A symbol of trust. Pokemon obey."F\rWith your Pokémon, I'm sure you can beat the every last of us."L\bTierno: That's awesome, it makes me feel like dancing at this moment!"N\bThat display of strength, makes me wanna groove and spin in excitement!"U\rLana: Phew...that was fantastic! You and your Pokémon were perfectly in sync!"]\rIt seems I was premature in thinking that my full power would be enough to defeat you."m\bKiawe: Astounding! Being thrilled by an opponent's excitement... Nothing makes me want to battle more!"s\rMallow: Awwww, i lost. Guess now I'll have to get my Grass-type Pokémon to make me feel all better again..."Q\rAnd next time if you are hungry, don't be shy! Step on up and have a bite!"_\bSophocles: I'm shy...and I've certainly felt lonely before, but I'm great with robotics."f\rThere are trainers here who come to challenge you to battles, so you can't let your guard down!"v\bMolayne: In every situation, you pick the best moves and items. So I too have to rack my brain in the battle..."<\bBut you outsmarted in the end. You're second to none!"P\rOlivia: Diamonds only sparkle after coal is pushed to its absolute limit."T\rI think your journey will hold many surprises. And I hope it holds many joys."p\rBianca: Thank you for being my opponent! Yep! I learned a lot on how to bring out the best from everyone!"<\rOh, I almost forgot! Congratulations on your victory!"H\rBianca: Ahhh, did I reach here a little late again? So-oooo-orry!"|\rKnow what? When i traveled to various regions, so many things happened to me, but I'm so glad I went on that journey!"h\rIt's hard to put into words, but i want to express this feeling through my Pokemon. Let's battle!"E\bSo you can't learn everything just from the Pokédex... I see!"BUnlucky! You still get some Grandeur Club Credits for trying."You got \v[61] credits."Ding dong!"�\bLuc-ker: I made a severe and continuous lapse in my judgement, and I don’t expect to be forgiven. I’m simply here to apologize."�I recognise how difficult the Raid Challenge is, so I'm going to help you out a little. Pay attention to what's to my left next time in the Raid Challenge."u\bFalkner: People say wings can be clipped with a jolt of electricity... I won't allow such insults to my birds!"E\bMorty: Good of you to have come, I can see what others cannot."\\bWhat? That has nothing to do with Pokémon? That's true! Come on, we shall do battle!"P\bBut a loss is a loss! From now on, I'm going to train 24 hours every day!"[\rJasmine: Oh... uh, hello. Do you love your Pokémon? Regardless of their appearance?"v\rS-steel type Pokémon are hard, cold, sharp and really strong... but they yearn for gentle love and care too..."5\rUm... I'm not lying. May I prove it to you...?"R\rUm... I don't know how to say this, but thank you for loving your Pokémon."�\bPryce: I have been training since before you were even born. Pokémon, alike humans, have had many experiences and suffering in our lives."Z\bWhen the snow melts, spring arrives. Cherish your time together with your Pokémon."Z\rGeez. You are a mysterious trainer, but you made me realise what is is that I lack."[\bWill: Welcome, you and fate have chosen me. Allow me to introduce myself. I am Will."]\bI have trained all around the world, to reach where people have acknowledged my might."?\bLet me put on this show to convince you as well. Behold!"b\bWill: I have observed your techniques - you're the best without a doubt. I have no regrets."d\bKoga: Fwahahaha! So you found me, the one who lives in shadow. It makes me shiver with mirth."k\bMy intricate style will confound and destroy you. The true terrors are not merely about brute force."u\bKoga: I have subjected you to everything I could muster. But my efforts failed. I must hone my skills further."L\bI am looking forward to see you put your abilities to the test again."e\bI see no fear in you. You're determined. So, you're one of the strongest trainers around here?"C\bBruno: You're still standing firm. My challenge's satisfied."�\rKaren: Strong Pokémon. Weak Pokémon. That is only the selfish perception of people. Truly skilled trainers would win with their loved ones."[\rI like your style. You know what's important. Hit me up whenever you are free again."W\bLance: I am the leader of Elite Four. You can call me Lance, the Dragon Trainer."n\bDragons are mythical, sacred creatures. They're hard to catch and raise, but their powers are superior!"M\bLance: No more words. It's time I tested you in battle. Are you ready?"N\bLance: I can't believe it. I am witnessing the rise of a great Trainer."x\bYour Pokémon have responded to your strong and upstanding nature. You will continue to grow stronger, won't you?"T\bSilver: Pesky one. You do not seem to be strong. Stop bothering me and scram."=\bI said stop noseying around. What's your purpose here?"C\bThat's it. I will use my full power against you. Then scram!"[\bSilver: I still can't win after all that training. I need to believe in my Pokémon."W\bAnyway, I am not giving up. I'll beat you next time when you come back. Move on."I\rLyra: Wooo, you have keen eyes. You look sharp compared to others."@\rYou are here looking for a challenge, am I right? Me too!",\rAnd that's good. Let's have a battle!"?\rLyra: Awww. Guess I took the loss this time. Tough luck."G\rAnd you are really strong. You must have travelled long and far."G\bEthan: Oh, hey? I'm Ethan. What'cha doing here? On an adventure?"c\bI'm also on a fun adventure. I can handle any obstacles, as long I have my Pokémon with me."H\bI'm feeling good today, how 'bout a match? Right here, right now!">\bEthan: Aite. You got me. That was an impressive battle!"N\bHope we get to meet up again after we finish our individual adventures!"w\rI use my chef's intuition to pick out the cream of the crop! And let's get cooking into the heat of battle then!"�\bRoark: I'm but one Trainer who decided to walk proudly with Rock-type Pokémon. Everyday, we toughened ourselves by digging up Fossils."o\bCould I show you how tough we are? I need to see the toughness of the Pokémon that battle with you too!"f\bNext time, I'd like to challenge you to a Fossil-digging race underground in the Sinnoh region!"z\rGardenia: I can't deny that Grass-types have many weak points, but that's not the only factor in deciding who wins!"q\rMy Pokémon are growing good and strong. You can't go wrong with me! Come on, let's cut to the good stuff!"Q\rGardenia: How are you feeling? I wanted to win and brag about my Pokémon."L\rI try to be as tough as I can, but you are the victor today. Amazing!"{\rMaylene: Nice to see you. I don't really know what it means to be strong, but I will do the best I can as a Trainer."A\rThanks to my training, I'm slowly gaining more confidence."J\rYes, everything is an experience. I've still got some room to grow!"\bMy Pokémon were toughened up by stormy white waters! They'll take everything you throw at them and then pull you under!"P\bCrasher Wake: Hwah! It's come and gone! How do I say this... I want more!"v\bI have fun battling, regardless if I win or lose! I hope your victories will put more smiles on people's faces!"t\rFantina: Ah, oui, are you here for a challenge? I hope very much you enjoy them, you seem to be très strong."H\rBut win I shall, non? Because moi is of course très fantastique!"j\rMerci beacoup, for having this dance with moi! If ever you have time, see moi again, ok? Au revoir!"a\bBryon: Trainer! You're young, just like my son Roark, on the quest to challenge the world."�\bWith more Trainers like you taking charge, the future of the Pokémon world is bright! But as a wall to you youngsters, I'm not stepping aside just yet!"U\bI'll take your challenge. I have the confidence to withstand all your attacks!"N\bI saw something great in you. Do show your power to other Trainers too!"D\rBut I should tell you, I'm tough because I know how to focus."d\bVolkner: Sigh... Alright. It's not often that I get challengers. But they've all been boring."[\bIt makes me excited to know you and your team will keep battling at greater heights!"Y\bAaron: Hello! It's good to meet you! I should explain that I'm a huge fan of bugs."k\bThey might be nasty and mean, but yet they're beautiful too. Would you like to take on my challenge?"O\bI want to become perfect, just like my Bug Pokémon. Let me take you on!"�\bAaron: Being perfect sure is a deep and complex affair. I will concede defeat, but I think you came to see how great Bug-type Pokémon can be!"S\rI have a preference for Ground-type Pokémon. Vast, wide and ever-embracing."t\rBertha: You're quite something, youngster. I like how you and your Pokémon earned the win by working as one."�\bFlint: Yo! The name's Flint! Battles are clashes of the burning spirits of Pokémon, they ain't about appearances or what's weak or strong."z\bFlint: Why I oughta...! I don't believe it! I lost! I didn't take you for granted... But I didnt expect you to win!"C\bI'm blown away by this! You and your Pokémon are hot stuff!"\bAllow me to introduce myself. I am Lucian, a user of the Psychic-type. You've proven yourself to be outstanding getting here."W\bSo I'm afraid I will have to go all out against you to live up to my reputation."Q\bLucian: The highs and lows. You are as remarkable as the book I just read."_\bPlease go through the exit to your right, while I'll be reading books to calm my nerves."~\rCynthia: When you are facing a Trainer in battle, you can learn everything about them. One look at you tells me many things."c\rWhat Pokemon they have, what moves they've taught. What items they make their Pokémon hold."I\rThere's no need for words then. I, Cynthia, accept your challenge!"\rCynthia: That was excellent. Truly, an outstanding battle. You gave the support your Pokémon needed to maximize their power."f\rI sincerely applaud your victory in this challenge. But the road before you is still very long."n\bBarry: Hey, you there! Yeah, you'd better watch me! Because I'm going to be the strongest Trainer ever!"C\bAnd you will be challenging me! You will be impressed by me!"V\bSend out your Pokémon now! Or you're gonna have a 10 million Pokédollar fine!"W\bBarry: ...! It's alright, though. Keep getting stronger. That's what I'm saying."F\bThe more you do, the tougher my Pokémon and I get too, y'know."�\rDawn: Hey there. You and your Pokemon look close-bonded. I've always thought that people and Pokemon aren't meant to go alone."K\rThat's why I make it a point to help others when they're in trouble!"D\rLet me give you a hand to see if you can beat me and move on!"f\rDawn: Looks my Pokémon got injured a little. But no need to worry, we'll get better very soon!"O\rIf you ever need a helping hand for training, I'm your gal! Look for me!"V\bLucas: Heyo! How's your time here? At first it was a bit discouraging for me..."O\bBut having so many strong Trainers to face, it's also exciting isn't it?"?\bNow with that said... Ready or not, let's have a go too!"H\bLucas: Turns out that you're the stronger one! That's surprising!"]\bHaving this battle pushed my senses to their limits. I need to take a nap from this..."e\bCilan: Um. My name is Cilan. I like Grass-type Pokémon, they are always so deep and profound."]\bWould you like to take part in a match against me? There's still much to learn for me."{\bCilan: What a surprise... You're very strong, aren't you? I guess my brothers wouldn't be able to defeat you either."]\bI'm glad I was at least able to bring out the delectable charm of Grass-type Pokémon."j\bChili: Listen up! My name is Chili! I light things up with Fire-type Pokémon, like habanero tacos!"W\bThat's that, then! I'm going to show you what me and my blazing Pokémon can do!">\bYou're fired up too, right? Get ready for the scorcher!"|\bCress: Pleased to make your acquaintance, I'm Cress, a specialist in Water-type Pokémon. They're refreshing as I like it."k\bIt shall be my esteemed Pokémon and I that you must face in battle. Would you be so kind to oblige?"Y\bJust as water flowing from high places to low places is natural, so is my victory."y\rWhen I was little, my dad would always bring home bones he dug up. I was very captivated by what they were before!"|\rNow I'm also going to research how you battle with the Pokémon you've so lovingly raised. Curiosity is the spice of life!"W\rLenora: Your fighting style is so enchanting. It's charming. I'm glad I met you!"o\bBurgh: Ah ha! Lights on! My Bug-type Pokémon are scurrying with excitement about getting to battle you!"�\bMhm... I feel like I can paint a picture unlike any before. OK! I can hear my battle muse loud and clear. Let's get straight to it!"C\bWin or lose, Bug-type Pokémon are still cool and beautiful."�\rElesa: Yes sweetie. I'm Elesa, the world famous model. Welcome to my stage! My beloved Pokémon and your Pokémon shall compete."a\rI want to feel the sensation, so now my beloved Pokémon are going to make your head spin!"}\rI want my Pokémon to bathe in the glamourous spotlight too. In that sense, your Pokémon were gleaming very brightly!"k\bClay: Harrumph! Kept me waitin', didn't ya, kid? So yer the Trainer they've been talkin' about, huh."v\bIf yer gotta bellyache, just forget 'bout fightin'! Well, I might be fussin' 'bout nothing when it comes to ya."@\bBut, I still don't like losin'! Come here again, alrite'?"j\rSo this is going to be a showdown that decides who's at the top, right? I love being at the summit!"^\rYou can see for miles and miles from high places! So how about you and I have some fun?"l\rMy Pokémon and I are happy, because for the first time in a while, we fought with our full strength."V\bBrycen: Pleased to meet you. I'm Brycen. In the past, I was hurt and depressed."e\bThen someone shared this with me... There is strength in being with other people and Pokémon."}\bReceiving their support makes you stronger. I'll show you this power I learned about, which is now etched in my heart."B\bBrycen: You are strong! No, both you and your Pokémon are."T\bThe stars of this show, this story, were you and your Pokémon. You did well."g\rRoxie: You didn't win! I just lost! I was weak and make my Pokémon feel how much losing stinks!"�\bEven if hurt, my Pokémon will fight for me with just one command. I think you'll value and trust your Pokémon more if you keep that fact close to your heart."i\bThat's right! I battle with everything to find the ideal realtionship between Pokémon and people!"�\bCheren: I'll keep battling many trainers and Pokémon like this, and if I can learn what kind of person I am, it'll open up my path."�\bI'm sure this path will lead me to become the person I'm meant to be. Pokémon will always be with you and me as our path goes."~\bDrayden: As a trainer, I've simply been pursing greater strength. But now I am aging, thinking about the time I have left..."t\bLet's battle with everything we have: your skill, my experience, and the love we've raised our Pokémon with."m\bJust like a ragin' sea that washes everythin' away! Uihaa~ I was swept away by your might and passion!"u\bWhat will be determined here is which of us can absorb the light and shine of this match. Let our fates begin."�\bGrimsley: Whether you get to fight at full strength, or whether Lady Luck is smiling on you. Where there's a winner, there's also a loser."R\bA loss is a loss. Right now, you and your Pokémon are shining brilliantly."�\rShauntal: The trainer's thoughts with the Pokémon's mind... That's part of a novel I wrote. I absolutely love writing about Pokémon!"8\rWould you like to be the subject of my new novel?"^\rShauntal: Do you ever feel like you're lost for words when something greatly moves you?"y\bIn order to master the art of fighting, I've kept training. You're also walking a similar path with your Pokémon."X\bIt is my intention to test you to take you to your limits of your strength. Kiai!"v\bMarshal: There is no single strongest Pokémon or best combination. That's why it is difficult to keep winning."t\bHowever, I think a heart that desires strength is a precious ideal. I respect you, because you have it. Whew!"L\rCaitlin: Who are you? How uncouth you are to disturb my sleep. Hmf..."]\rVery well. Make your best effort not to bore me with a yawn-inducing battle. We clear?"t\rI want to improve and win more elegantly, so I invite you to be my opponent again in the future, if you wish."U\bBenga: You! Yeah! I knew it, you smell tough! But do you know how strong I am?"`\bHey, hey! Look at me! I want to battle with you! My Pokémon haven't been through enough!"u\bBenga: So exciting! You and your Pokémon's combination! What amazing teamwork! You can go anywhere with that!"V\bAlder: Hello, my name's Alder. I'm a trainer with a keen interest in the world."t\bOne of my goals is to tell people about how wonderful it is to walk toward the future together with Pokémon."\bI feel fired up when I see another trainer, and I wonder which one of us is stronger. The excitement builds to a fever pitch!"d\bAlder: Well done! The ones who change the world are always the ones who pursued their dreams."�\bWhen things don't go as you thought, silently continue to train! Someday, you will be able to battle in the way you envisioned!"S\rIris: Hi! I'm Iris! People call me the girl who knows the hearts of dragons!"�\rYou know what? I really look forward to having serious battles with strong trainers! They desire victory with every fiber of their being!"3\rOK! Brace yourself! I'm going to defeat you!"T\rIris: I'm upset I couldn't win! But you know what? More than that, I'm happy!"z\rI mean, come on. After this serious battle, you and I got to know one another better than before! Yep! We sure did!"|\rKnow what? When I traveled to various regions, so many things happened to me, but I'm so glad I went on that journey!"i\rIt's hard to put into words, but I want to express this feeling through my Pokémon. Let's battle!"o\bHugh: Hugh's here, to gauge your capabilities as a Pokémon trainer. I ain't no simpleton for your info."S\bBring up your A-game now, otherwise it is back to the drawing board for you.".\bNow come at me with everything you got!"a\bHugh: Thanks to you, I accomplished what i set out to do. I wish I could've show you more."b\bYou're amazing. Get the proof that you're a trainer your Pokémon can be proud of! See you!"Q\rHilda: Hilda's me! When it comes to Pokémon battles, you can count on me!"[\rTrust me, I'm really good at this. If you don't believe me, let's get it going then!":\rThis battle is mine to win! I won't go down easily!":\rHilda: Awwww, I gave it my all, and I still lost..."O\rBut that was really fun! Is it that late already? Time sure does fly by!"g\bHilbert: Hey. I'm Hilbert. Guess I'm one step closer to being one of the strongest trainers now."Q\bI'm sure we've come a such a long way to get to who we are today. Mmm-hmm."V\bI'm looking forward to battle against you, but let's be friends after this, ok?"C\bHilbert: Looks like you've got victory in your grasp, buddy!"I\bBut next time, I will give you a match worth making your jaw drop!"u\rRosa: I'm Rosa! My goal is to train hard, get stronger, and battle my heart out against all kinds of trainers!"Q\rYou've gotta do your best, so that I won't be wiping you out in one sweep!"=\rNow, would you please battle with me already? Yay hay!"^\rRosa: Hehe. That was very satisfying. You went all out and gave me a run for my effort."r\rBut it's important to stay positive, you see? Taking that first little step will really propel you forward!"P\bNate: Hey there! I'm Nate. It's great to be here, facing against you now."h\bMy opponents are getting more and more challenging. There's tons of amazing people to look up to.".\bIf it's okay with you, let's begin now!"X\bNate: This means no breaks for me! I will be training every day to better myself!"V\bIt's been a blast battling against you. You'd better be on your toes next time!"q\bOak: Hello there! My name is Oak! People call me the Pokémon Professor! I study Pokémon as a profession."�\bFor some people, Pokémon are pets. Other use them for fights. You need your own Pokémon for your protection, especially here."f\bBut rather than talking about it, you'll learn more from experience. Here, come battle with me!"�\bOak: So, you've won! You understand that your victory was not just your own doing. The bond you share with your Pokémon is marvelous."|\bI hope you do not neglect your Pokédex too! When it's completed, your views about Pokémon will likely have changed!"[\bGiovanni: Why... impressive of you to be here... with a dangerous figure such as me."h\bI have to warn you that this is not a place for kids like you. But since you have seen me here..."9\bFor your insolence, you will feel a world of pain!"H\bGiovanni: You have a certain look... It reminds me of... someone."U\bI will tell you this now... No matter how strong you are, you'll lose someday."�\bElm: I've been waiting for you! Do you know anything about my research? As you know, Pokémon are carried in Poké Balls these days."�\bBut before the Poké Ball was invented, people used to walk with Pokémon. It could have something to do with how Pokémon grow or evolve..."R\bTell me, how do you raise your Pokemon? I will be expecting a great battle!"x\bElm: I knew you were a little different - you never cease to amaze me! Thanks to you, my research is going great!"~\bYou're looking for tougher opponents? Then keep going straight. And don't forget to thank all those who battled against you!"{\bBirch: My name is Birch. We humans live alongside Pokémon. Friendly playmates at times, cooperative workmates at others."�\bAnd sometimes, we band together and battle others like us. But despite our closeness, we don't know everything about Pokémon."w\bIn fact, there are still many, many mysteries surrounding Pokémon. What's your secret in raising Pokemon, then?"c\bBirch: Yup! That's the spirit! …Arghhh! I'm getting the itch to get out and see the world!"�\bI'd love it if your world seemed wider than ever! Though I'd love it even more if you came back from time to time to show me what progress you've made."s\bMaxie: Now here I was wondering, though you are but a child, your eyes tell me of your fierce determination."}\bI am called Maxie. I stand as the head of Team Magma, and you are one of the younglings who may shape our society's future."|\bThe land exists so we humans might continue onward and upward, explore, develop, exploit, stepping into the future..."�\bThat is why we, Team Magma, must increase the landmass of the world! Believe that this will lead to a future of eternal happiness for humanity!"}\bMaxie: Hah... Hah... Hahhh... You've really done it, child. You've shown a power that exceeds that of the great Maxie!"�\bSplendid. Just splendid, my young Trainer. Rejecting my ideals without a second thought... And yet. I will not yield! I will not bend! My ideals will not be shaken!"g\bArchie: What do we have here? That's quite a fierce expression for such a wee little scamp. Heh!"u\bThat face tells me you're not just another mindless brat. The name's Archie, leading the Team Aqua at its top!"�\bDo you know that all life in this world depend on the sea for life? But day by day, we're all destroying our most precious resource!"�\bPokémon suffer as a result of our action. That's why I came to a decision. We, Team Aqua, will return everything to its unspoiled beginnings!"�\bArchie: Bwahahahahahaha! Bwaha! Well, if it isn't my little adversary! I can't even find the words to praise you as you deserve."�\bSometimes it's best to keep things simple. All I'll say is you met my expectations, scamp! But it changes nothing! I can't give up now! I can't!"�\bRowan: It's so very nice to meet you! Allow me to properly introduce myself first. My name, as you know, is Rowan. I study Pokémon."�\bAt times we play together, and at other times we work together. Some people use their Pokémon to battle and develop closer bonds with them."n\bEven now, I get a thrill when I'm with Pokémon, so let's begin our test on the bonds with our Pokemon."o\bRowan: Your last battle was splendid! It's only natural that I come and witness the your crowning glory."{\bBut the world is immense. There are many more Pokémon. That means there are many more thrills for you to seek and enjoy!"�\bCyrus: ...I see. You must be the Trainer I've been hearing about. Although I'd hardly expected to see that the foolhardy is a mere child."�\bBut, I must say... You are a remarkable specimen. Such pitifully useless emotions... Hear me! This world of ours is a crude one, it is incomplete!"�\bThe world must change. Then, who will change it? Me, Cyrus. And Team Galactic. I will make you regret paying heed to your heart!"n\bCyrus: I see... You are indeed strong. And the basis of your power is your compassion towards Pokémon."�\b...How wasteful... Such emotions are but mere illusions. ...But that doesn't matter. I doubt you will ever understand my position."�\rJuniper: Hi there! My name is Professor Juniper, and I am researching when and how the creatures called Pokémon came into existence."y\rThey come in many shapes and live in many different places. Living and working together, we complement each other."t\rHaving Pokémon battles between one another deepens the bonds between people and Pokémon. So, are you ready?"~\rJuniper: I am astonished. Nice work! I bet I will hear the words from people about your blazing paths around the world!"�\rI really hope you learn what is important to you as a result, because Pokémon create chances to meet more wonderful people and Pokémon!"~\bGhetsis: My name is Ghetsis. I am here representing Team Plasma. I would like to talk to you about Pokémon liberation."�\bPokémon are subject to the selfish commands of Trainers. They are different from humans, since they contain unknown potential."t\bThat's right! We must liberate the Pokémon! Then, and only then, will humans and Pokémon truly be equals!!!"{\bGhetsis: My calculations... No! My careful schemes! This doesn't change my goal. My secret plans have not been disturbed!"a\bI'm absolutely perfect! I AM PERFECTION! I'm the absolute ruler who will change the world!"b\bN: Your Pokemon... Just now, it was saying... Oh, you can't hear it. How sad. My name is N."�\bSo, you've confined most of your Pokémon in Poké Balls. I'm a Trainer, too, but I can't help wondering, are Pokémon really happy that way?"V\bWell, let me hear your Pokémon's voice again! I wanna understand you. Show me!"�\bN: I never expected to hear Pokémon say such things... As long as Pokémon are confined in Poké Balls... Pokémon will never become perfect beings."�\bI have to change the world for Pokémon, because they're my friends. So, I need power... Power enough to make anyone agree with me."\bNow, let's all have a Pokémon battle! Your opponent shall be me and my Pokémon, lending strength to one another to victory!"b\bSycamore: Well now, you DO have a certain je ne sais quoi! I have a good feeling about you!"�\bThe strength you've found is simply marvelous! You truly love and trust your Pokémon! Treasure these moments with your partner Pokémon."�\bLysandre: You have a Pokédex; you are one of the chosen ones. I am Lysandre. I've tried to learn as much about Pokémon as I can to help build a brighter future."n\bAnd to conclude, unproductive fools are consuming our future. Team Flare needs to wipe the slate clean."�\bKnowledge is power, after all. Put it to good use. It is vital that this world becomes a better place. My desire... It is for a more beautiful world!"x\bLysandre: Excellent! But what are you really protecting? A tomorrow that will only end up being worse than today?"V\bIt's over... Fools with no vision will continue to befoul this beautiful world."�\bI love to understand Pokemon's potential and capabilities, so I let myself get hit with all kinds of moves so I can test their power!"^\bKukui: I couldn't win even though I went all out... But what a refreshing feeling! Woo!"�\bWell, I always knew it would be a crushing defeat. I'm still glad I got to battle you. And I'm as thankful as I could be that I met you and your Pokémon!"�\bAfter all, everyone already knows who the strongest Trainer is here. Wanna see what destruction looks like? Here it is in human form - it's your boy Guzma!"C\bGuzma: I see. Great work... I guess. You had some real guts."]\bIt was \PN, right? I'll remember you... as someone I'll be happy to beat down anytime!"V\rLusamine: What a disappointment... To think that you are all so small-minded..."�\rAll that I want is my precious beasts! I don't care about any of the rest of you! Just leave. I don't need you here... I don't need you any longer!"g\bThey might be nasty and mean, but they're beautiful too. Would you like to take on my challenge?"P\bBut having so many strong Trainers to face, it's also exciting, isn't it?"F\rNurse Joy: Good day, \PN. Your Pokemon looks really roughed up."/\rWould you like me to heal your Pokémon?"\rLet me help you.""\rAll's great now! Take care!"\rNo worries then."@\rNurse Joy: Sorry \PN, that's all the items I had on hand."5\rYou won't be able to tire them out one by one!"G\rCheryl: Thank you! My adorable Pokémon became a little tougher."|\rBeing a Trainer isn't easy. The more you battle, the more you discover. But, you know? I love Pokémon for that, too!"F\rMira: Mira wonders if she can get very far in the Battle Tower."{\rBut It seems you are always with your Pokémon. That's how you got to be so strong. Mira is beginning to understand!"^\bRiley: Know your enemy. If you know your opponent's Pokémon and what moves they use..."U\bIf you have intelligence like that, your chances of winning are much improved."V\bBuck: Fweh! Too much! I guess I'll humble down and better my team on the field."G\bI'd better shape up on the field for a rematch against you here!"m\rMarley: ...You're so strong. It makes me feel happy. ...I don't know why. This is a strange feeling..."L\r...I might like battling with you. ...Just a little. Only a tiny bit."I\bEusine: Puff, puff... I am... no match for you. ...As I predicted."�\bI have never seen a battle this intense! I have no regrets... Farewell for now. But I will come back to get what I'm looking from you!"�\bEmmet: I lost against you. Because you are the strongest Trainer I've fought lately. You're a verrrrry strong Trainer! Yup! It was fun!"m\bYou want to win, and I don't want to lose. That's real. When we clash in battles, I feel very excited!"e\bIngo: Bravo! Excellent!! I am glad that I fought so hard against a wonderful Trainer like you."m\bYour talent has brought you to the destination called Victory! However, your journey has just started."V\bWhen snow melts, spring arrives. Cherish your time together with your Pokémon."[\bWill: Welcome, you and Fate have chosen me. Allow me to introduce myself. I am Will."m\bKoga: I have subjected you to everything I could muster. But my efforts failed. I must hone my skills."e\bI see no fear in you. You're determined. So are you one of the strongest trainers around here?"c\bBut, I ain't any ordinary chum then! If I see a strong opponent, it makes me want to battle."T\bWanna give a try? I'll know if you are good or not by battling you right now." \rThink about it, OK? Hehe."p\rWell, uh…nice to meet you. I'm Green! Are you here because you're also looking for…something special?"D\rI noticed you got some good Pokemon there too, can i have it?"\bRed: Hmm... ... ..."1\b... ... ... ... ... Words are unnecessary!"v\bYour Pokemon have responded to your strong and upstanding nature. You will continue to grow stronger, aint you?"f\bDragons are mythical, sacred creatures. Hard to catch and raise, but their powers are superior!"Z\bSilver: I still can't win after all that training. I need to believe in my Pokemon.":\bI said stop nosey around. What's your purpose here?"H\bThat's it. I will use my full power against you. Then scram away!";\rLyra: Awww. Guess I got the L this time. Tough luck."M\rAnd you are really strong. You must have travelled long and far since."I\rLyra: Wooo, keen eyes you have. You look sharp compared to others."H\rAnd that's good. Let's settle with a battle! I am gonna be first!"?\bEthan: A'ite. You got me. That was an impressive battle!"S\bHope we get to meet up again, best after we finish our individual adventure!"H\bEthan: Oh, hey? I'm Ethan. What 'chu doing here? On an adventure?"`\bI'm also on a fun adventure. I can handle any obstacles, as long I've my Pokemon with me."o\bSteven: Congratulations! The feelings you have... and the Pokemon that responded with all their might..."p\bThey came together as one, and created an even greater power. And thus, you were able to grasp victories!"z\bSteven: You... What did you see on your journey with Pokemon? What did you feel, meeting so many Trainers like you?"@\bWhat has awoken in you? I want you to hit me with it all!"\bBring it your best shot!"[\bWallace: Bravo! I realize now your authencity and magnificence as a Pokemon Trainer."B\bI find much joy in having met you and your Pokemon. Encore!"�\bWallace: At times your Pokemon should dance like a spring breeze, at times strike like lightning. I want to feel bedazzled by your performance!"�\bWho can most elegantly dance with their Pokemon? Who should exhibit the most graceful art in battle, you or me and my grand illusion of water?"w\bWally: N-nice to meet you! I'm Wally. My Pokemon and I are always moving together, little by little, day by day!"N\bI'm sure that you and your Pokemon must have had to overcome a lot too."j\bMy Pokemon have given me courage and strength to fight. I have to win for their sake! So get ready!"W\rMay: Ohoho, wow, you did it! I am defeated, but i have learned so much from you!"Q\rYou make me feel passionate about getting strong, maybe next time's on me!"|\rMy dream is to become friends with Pokemon all over the world! I want to understand everything about you and your Pokemon!"U\rWould you bring and show me all your Pokemon, in a battle with me? So excited!"s\bMy dream is to become a better Pokemon Trainer! I want to learn even more and become stronger than i am now!"m\bYou being here, you may have faced and defeated my dad. But facing me is a different story! Here goes!"~\rCynthia: That was excellent, Truly, an outstanding battle. You gave the support your Pokemon needed to maximize their power."e\rI sincerely applaud your victory in the challenge. But the road before you is still very long."b\rWhat Pokemon they have, what moves they've taught. What items they make their Pokemon hold."E\bThe more you do, the tougher my Pokemon and I get too, y'know."k\bBarry: Hey, you there! Yeah, you better watch me! Because I'm going to be the toughest Trainer ever!"U\bAnd you will be challenging me! So you will be impressed, that's why I'm here!"H\bSend out your Pokemon now! Or I am gonna fine you for 10 million!"o\rDawn: Looks a little under the weather for me and my Pokemon. But it's ok, we will get better very soon!"N\rIf you ever need a helping hand on training, I'm your gal! Look for me!"�\rDawn: Hey there. You and your Pokemon looks close-bonded. I've always thought that people and Pokemon aren't meant to go alone."K\rThat's why i make it a point to help others when they're in trouble!"G\rLet me give you a hand, to see if you could beat me and move on!"D\bLucas: Turns out you are the stronger one! That's surprising!"V\bHaving this battle put my senses to maximium. I need to take a nap from this..."O\bLucas: Heyo! How's your time here? At first it was a bit discouraging..."=\bNow with that said. Ready or not, let's have a go too!"s\bOne of my goals is to tell people about how wonderful it is to walk toward the future together with Pokemon."~\bI feel fired up when i see another trainer, and i imagine which one of us is stronger. The excitement builds to fever pitch!"�\rKnow what? I really look forward to having serious battles with strong trainers! They desire victory with every fiber of their being!"a\bYou're amazing. Get the proof that you're a trainer your Pokemon can be proud of! See you!"n\bHugh: Hugh's here, to gauge your capabilities as a Pokemon trainer. I ain't no simpleton for your info."N\bBring up your A-game now. Else it is back to the drawing board for you.":\rHilda: Awwww, i gave it my all, and i still lost..."L\rBut that was really fun! Is it that late already? Time sure does fly!"P\rHilda: Hilda's me! When it comes to Pokemon battles, you can count on me!"b\rTrust me, I'm really good at this stuff. If you do not believe me, let's get it going then!"=\rThis battle will be mine to win! I won't go down easy!"E\bHilbert: Looks like you got your victory in your grasp, buddy!"R\bI am sure we've come a such a long way to get to who we are today. Mmm-hmm."^\bI'm will be looking forward to battle against you, but let's be friends after this, ok?"I\rYou gonna do your best, so I won't be wiping you out in one sweep!"\\bNate: This means no breaks for me! I will be training every day to be my better self!"T\bIt's been a blast battling against you. You better be on your toes next time!"`\bMy opponents are getting more and more challenging. Tons of amazing people to look up to."z\rDiantha: I-I'm so choked up that it's hard to know what I should say, but I...I... I'm just so glad at this moment."|\bCalem: You're one of my best opponents! You might come up with new strategies, and that'll help battles go a lot smoother."p\bHala: ...Hmmph! The results come as no surprise to me. What a fine Trainer...and what fine Pokémon, too!"W\rSelene: Aww, that's a shame. But lucky to be able to experience this excitement!"t\bThe strength of friendship, being kind, having fun... Maybe I should say...we all got stronger together, huh?"z\bI hope you do not neglect your Pokédex too! When it completes, your views about Pokémon will likely have changed!"l\bOak: Hello there! My name is Oak! People call me the Pokémon Prof! I study Pokémon as a profession."�\bFor some people, Pokémon are pets. Other use them for fights. Especially here, You need your own Pokémon for your protection."U\bI will tell you this now... No matter how strong you are, someday you'll lose."w\bElm: I knew you were a little different, you never cease to amaze me! Thanks to you, my research is going great!"�\bBirch: My name is Birch. We humans live alongside Pokémon, at times as friendly playmates, and at times as cooperative workmates."v\bIn fact, there are still many, many mysteries surrounding Pokémon. What's your secret in raising Pokemon then?"v\bThat face tells me you're not just another mindless brat. The name is Archie, leading the Team Aqua on the top!"�\bPokémon suffer as a result of our action. That's why I came to a decision, we, Team Aqua, will return everything to its unspoiled beginnings!"k\rHaving Pokémon battle one another deepens the bonds between people and Pokémon. So, are you ready?"@\bPokémon are subject to the selfish commands of Trainers."w\bPokémon are different from humans, which contain unknown potential That's right! We must liberate the Pokémon!"G\bThen, and only then, will humans and Pokémon truly be equals!!!"?\bLysandre: Excellent! But what are you really protecting?"�\bA tomorrow that will only end up being worse than today? It's over... Fools with no vision will continue to befoul this beautiful world."^\bKukui: I couldn't win even though I went all out... But what a refreshing feeling. Woo!"\\bIt was \PN, right? I'll remember you...as someone I'll be happy to beat down anytime!"K\rCheryl: Thanks to you, my adorable Pokémon became a little tougher."g\bNoland: Pfft, man! That's absolutely the last time I lose to you! We have to do this again, hey!"=\bI'll come after you hard. No holds barred, understand?"E\rGreta: Ow, wait a second! You are tough after all! I like you!"K\rIf we ever battle again, I won't lose! Don't you forget it! Bye-bye!"E\bTucker: You're strong, but above all, you have a unique charm!"w\bIn you, I see a definite potential for a superstar like me. I will very much look forward to our next encounter!"g\bSpenser: Well, that was some display! Even fully unleashed, my brethren could not overpower you."^\bYou team spirit is truly admirable! Your Pokémon's eyes are truly clear and unclouded.";\rLucy: ...That's all there is... Disappear already..."/\r...But you, I won't forget... ...Ever..."f\rAnabel: Fufufu, nicely done... You have confidence in your Pokémon battling talent, don't you?"q\rI urge you to keep battling and keep on winning. I will be waiting for you. Until the next time we meet..."E\bBrandon: Hahahah! Grand it was! Grand, yes, indeed! Well done!"�\bYoung explorer! You've bested me through and through! It just goes to show that I have much to learn still! May our paths cross again!"�\bPalmer: Bravo! I imagine many great Trainers will come to challenge me as you have just done. That's something I look forward to a great deal."{\bYou will become even more skilled. Keep battling Trainers from around the world and keep growing greater in stature!"t\rDahlia: How fabulous of you! Your love of Pokémon shone through, and in turn, your Pokémon believed in you."f\rThat is why you handled everything thrown your way splendidly. A most wonderful victory it was!"[\bThorton: Hmm... I got handed the loss here. It's not making me happy at all, losing."e\bBut that's all right. Some things you learn from winning. But some things you learn by losing."z\bDarach: I drew on every reserve of experience and etiquette handed down through our heritage of glorious servitude."a\bBut even then, I failed to fend off your stunning and inspiring challenge. I am humbled..."y\rArgenta: You must never forget there is a place where everyone can shine. That goes for any kind of Pokémon, too."�\rSpread that message in your own words. It's one everyone should hear. And now, having lost, this lady has nothing left to say at all, but... Bye-bye!"e\bHitsu: Hey, you escaped the Mayhem Penitentiary! You must be an impressive trainer to do that!"�\bBeyond this room, is the end of your Mayhem. You may get the reward you deserve there. BUT! Just one more. Bonus round. Pleaseeeee! Defeat me, and you will get extra rewards! I know your team should be fatigued now..."W\bThere, now I can't take no for an answer. Let's not delay any further, shall we?"p\bHitsu: You did it! I am overwhelmed! You are the symbol of a true Pokemon master. Here, you deserve this.",25 GC Credits have been awarded to you."@\bGo on. I have nothing much to say now, besides well done!"t\bHitsu: Hey, it was a good fight there! Don't be down about it, as I am not playing by the rules anyway. HAHA."M\bCome back here again. You will be prepared. We will be waiting. Go on!"Z\bLuc: Ara ara, well done on making it this far. Want a bo'ohw'o'wo'er? Just kidding."]\bTough challenge, wasn't it? You're almost there mate, your rewards lie just behind me."/\bI'll heal your team so you can ready up."9\bHeh. That's right, your final opponent here is me!"A\bLuc: Damn, nice one mate! I can't even be mad that I lost."8\bI have nothing more to say now, except well done!"�\bHaha, no hard feelings mate. It's not like Hitsu or Foul would be easier to beat anyway, since we're all breaking the rules-that-were-meant-to-be-broken here."=\bWell, whenever you're ready again, I'll still be here."g\bFoul: Oh! You're approaching me? Even after all of that fighting you still chose to approach me."U\bBut I don't want to fight with such a weak opponent. Let me heal you up first."D\bNow let's see what kind of power you can muster to defeat me.";\bFoul: Tsk... Doesn't matter if you can beat me here."{\bI can always come back to defeat you. And even if I can't, there are those who possess much greater power than I do."U\bFoul: Of course you aren't able to defeat me. I am the master of foul plays!!!"2\bFeeling angry? Come back for more beatings!"H\bEthan: Oh, hey? I'm Ethan. What 'cha doing here? On an adventure?"!The door locks behind you..." \bBrock: Show me your best!"%\rMisty: Are you ready, sweetie?"W\bLt. Surge: Pokémon battles are war! I'll show you and shock you into surrender!";\rErika: Let my ladies demonstrate the art of Ikebana."6\rSabrina: Let's find out who the victor will be."2\rJanine: Hi! I'm Janine! Remember this name!"H\bBill: Did you come to see my Pokémon collection? Check this out!">\bRyuki: Let our fiery spirits clash in a blaze of glory!"<\rAgatha: Why are you here noseying about, pesky child."U\bTrace: I should check if your Pokémon really are doing well... with a battle!"J\rLeaf: I noticed you got some good Pokemon there too, can I have it?"C\bGiovanni: For your insolence, you will feel a world of pain!"C\bBugsy: Let me demonstrate what I've learned from my studies."]\rWhitney: You want a battle with me, the talented super-cute me? That's a warning hint!"V\bMorty: Show me the power you possess. You're going to help me reach that level!"c\bChuck: Let me tell you, I'm tough enough to crush stones and shatter bones! Urggh! Oooarrgh!"C\rClaire: I will use my full power against you. Let's do this!"f\bWill: I have trained all around the world, to reach to where people have acknowledged my might."O\bKoga: Prepare to be the victim of my techniques... You shall see soon..."-\rKaren: Try me. Entertain me. Let's go."F\rLyra: You are here looking for a challenge, am I right? Me too!"O\bEthan: I'm feeling good today, how 'bout a match? Right here, right now!"W\bElm: Tell me, how do you raise your Pokemon? I will be expecting a great battle!"{\rRoxanne: Would you kindly demonstrate how you battle so i could learn? I would also see how much better i've become."E\bBrawly: You wanna challenge me? Let's see what you're made of."K\bWattson: I'll make sparks fly from you! Don't say I didn't warn you!"3\rFlannery: Brace yourself! Haiyaaaaaaaaaaaaa!"_\bNorman: So you'd better give it your best shot. I will do everything in my power to win!"Y\rWinona: Witness the elegant choreography by us. Don't blink or you will regret it!"@\bTate: This combinations of ours! \rLiza: Can you beat it?"{\bJuan: I guess a Coordinator could show you a trick or two today. Witness the grand illusion of water sculpted by us!"l\bSidney: I like that look you're giving me. I guess you'll give me a good match. Let's get down to it!"@\rGlacia: I wonder what are you going to show me. Bring it."o\bDrake: For us to battle with Pokemon as partners, do you know what it takes? Do you know what is needed?"&\bSteven: Give me your best shot!"�\bWallace: Who can most elegantly dance with their Pokemon? Who should exhibit the most graceful art in battle, you or me and my grand illusion of water?"q\bWally: My Pokemon have given me courage and strength to fight. I have to win for their sake! So get ready!"^\rMay: Would you bring and show me all your Pokemon, in a battle with me? I'm so excited!"{\bBrendan: You being here means that you may have faced and defeated my dad. But facing me is a different story! Here goes!"t\bBirch: There are still many, many mysteries surrounding Pokémon. What's your secret in raising Pokemon then?"�\bMaxie: That is why we, Team Magma, must increase the landmass of the world! Believe that this will lead to a future of eternal happiness for humanity!"�\bArchie: Pokémon suffer as a result of our actions. That's why I came to a decision, we, Team Aqua, will return everything to its unspoiled beginnings!" \bRoark:This'll be rocking!"@\rGardenia: Let's get down to battle! A real quick one, OK?"K\rMaylene: I also take battling very seriously. Whenever you're ready!"F\bCrasher Wake: Victory will be ours! Come on, let's get it done!"[\rFantina: Win I shall, non? Because moi, how you say, is of course très fantastique!"Z\bByron: I'll take your challenge. I have the confidence to batter down your defense!"J\rCandice: I should tell you, I'm tough, because i know how to focus."V\bVolkner: I hope you're the one who'll make me remember how fun it is to battle."U\bAaron: I want to become perfect, just like my bug Pokemon. Let me take you on!"J\rBertha: Well, would you show this old lady how much you've learned?"8\bFlint: All right, hotshot! Let's spice things up!"M\rCynthia: There's no need for words. I, Cynthia, accept your challenge!"O\bBarry: Send out your Pokemon now! Or I am gonna fine you for 10 million!"M\rDawn: Let me give you a hand, to see if you could beat me and move on!"0\bLucas: Ready or not, let's have a go too!"u\bRowan: Even now, I get a thrill when I'm with Pokémon, so let's begin our test on the bonds with our Pokemon."�\bCyrus: The world must change. Then, who will change it? Me, Cyrus. And Team Galactic. I will make you regret paying heed to your heart!"g\bCilan: Would you like to take part in this match against me? There's still much to learn for me."J\bChili: I'm going to show you what me and my blazing Pokemon can do!"q\bCress: It shall be I and my esteemed Pokemon that you must face in battle. Would you be so kind to oblige?"\rLenora: I'm going to research how you battle with the Pokemon you've so lovingly raised. Curiosity is the spice of life!"4\rSkyla: So, how about you and I have some fun?"q\bBrycen: Receiving their support makes you stronger. I'll show you this power I learned etched in my heart."[\rRoxie: I'm Roxie~! Listen up~! I'm gonna rock the audience right outta their seats~!"b\bCheren: I battle with everything to find the ideal realtionship between Pokemon and people!"|\bDrayden: Let's battle with everything we have: your skill, my experience, and the love we've raised our Pokemon with."O\bMarlon: How 'bout you and I make some waves and sweep the audience away?"\bGrimsley: What will be determined here is which of us can absorb the light and shine of this match. Let our fates begin."B\rShauntal: Would you like to be the subject of my new novel?"b\bMarshal: It is my intention to test you. To take you to your limits of your strength. Kiai!"X\rCaitlin: Make your best effort not to bore me with a yawn-inducing battle. Clear?"�\bAlder: I feel fired up when I see another trainer, and I imagine which one of us is stronger. The excitement builds to fever pitch!"f\bBenga: Hey, hey! Look at me! I want to battle with you! My Pokemon haven't been through enough!"|\rIris: Hi! I'm Iris! People call me the girl who knows the hearts of dragons! Brace yourself! I'm going to defeat you!"0\bHugh: Come at me with everything you got!"D\rHilda: This battle will be mine to win! I won't go down easy!"g\bHilbert: I'm will be looking forward to battle against you, but let's be friends after this, ok?">\rRosa: Would you please battle with me already? Yay hay!"m\rRoxanne: Hi, Roxanne here. I like to strategize before a battle, applying what I've studied until now."]\rI'm sure we have both experienced many battles, gaining immense knowledge on battling."n\bYour talent brought forth a wave of astonishment, overwhelming me. I look forward to it again. Ride on!"@\bWattson: Aha! What a fine young soul brimming with vigor."r\rUh... dare not underestimate me, I shall, uh... demonstrate the hot moves I have honed with my grandfather!"B\rNo wonder the Pokémon that battle at my side got confused."O\rWitness the elegant choreography by us. Don't blink or you'll regret it!"T\rWinona: I see you're one with your Pokémon as well. I recognize your talent."@\bWe don't need to talk... \r...because we can each tell...">\b...what the other is thinking... \r...all in our minds!"j\bTate: The bond between you and your Pokémon... \rLiza: ...was far stronger than ours. We can tell."d\bSidney: They said I was a punk, but I showed them what the dark side's beauties were made of!"w\bSidney: Listen to what this loser has to say. You've got a long road ahead of you, but you've got what it takes."�\rPhoebe: Uh-huh... Uh-huh... Hahaha! You're right. Oh? Gimme a minute... Hi! My friend's telling me that you're looking for me."b\rDon't be afraid. Anyway, if you're looking for a challenge, see if you can hurt my friends!"W\rI'd like to see how far your bond can carry you. Don't bring us shame by losing!"7\rI wonder what you're going to show me. Bring it."o\rGlacia: What a relief, how fiery that was! Spirits burning so high that my icy moves pale in comparison."�\bSteven: You... What did you see on your journey with your Pokémon? What did you feel, meeting so many Trainers like yourself?"S\rMay: Ohoho, wow, you did it! I'm defeated, but I've learnt so much from you!"~\bHey! Hey!! You'd better keep aiming higher and promise to come back and challenge me! Else I will get to the top in no time!"n\bHugh: Hugh's here to gauge your capabilities as a Pokémon trainer. I ain't no simpleton for your info."i\bYou're amazing. You've got the proof that you're a trainer your Pokémon can be proud of! See you!"P\rYou've gotta do your best so that I won't be wiping you out in one sweep!"[\bTrace: Maybe I should check if your Pokémon really are doing well... with a battle!""The cold iron door is locked."�\rMarley: I... am Marley. I... I don't like to talk... I choose my words carefully, but they may still hurt someone accidentally..."\ts[5]Ding dong!"�I recognise how difficult the Sync Challenge is, so I'm going to help you out a little. Pay attention to what's to my left next time in the Sync Challenge."|\bAnyway, can we have a Pokémon battle? Oh, uh... sorry to just throw that at you. But that's our purpose here, right?"2\bThat doesn't mean I can't battle. Let's go!"	Left"	Down"
