ens auszuruhen?"!\bWohin möchtest du reisen?"'\rBist du schon müde? Ich bin es."N\rIch bin müde vom Laufen. Ich sollte mich ein wenig in die Sonne legen."\rBist du im Urlaub hier?"D\rIch arbeite zu viel. Ich sollte mich wirklich mal entspannen."\rPass auf."9\rHast du irgendwelche besonderen Pokémon gefunden?"Orania City"Abbrechen;[" \bStrong people flock here."l\bIsn't it odd strong people come here but this is a resort to take a break from the struggles of life?""\bWhere would you like to go?"\rAre you tired yet? I am."6\rI'm tired of walking. I should go get some sun."\rHere for a vacation?"1\rI keep overworking. I should really relax."\rWatch out."+\rHave you found any special Pokémon?"Vermilion"CancelIu;␀/[["6\bPryce: Hello there young one. My name is Pryce."\bJust recently I found my long lost Piloswine. It helped me realize the importance of bonds and trust with your Pokémon.""\bLet's see if you have that.".\bPryce: You've earned the Glacier Badge."\bHere, have this TM too."S\bTM07 contains Hail. It whips up a hailstorm that damages every type but Ice."^\bPryce: The bond you have with your Pokémon is incredible. Don't ever lose sight of it." \rIt's fun to slide around."!\rPryce will Freeze Dry you."'\bWhere do you think you're going?"1\bI haven't had a battle like that in years.")\bWho would have known I would lose?"\rLet's fight to warm up."\rI'm cold. Are you?"\bI'm ready. Are you?"=\bPryce is going to bring your plans to a freezing halt."e\bPryce uses Ice type Pokémon. They are weak against the Fire, Fighting, Rock, and Steel types."a\bThey are strong against Dragon, Flying, Grass, and Ground. They are resistant to only Ice.["A\bNorbert: Hallo, mein junger Freund. Mein Name ist Norbert."�\bErst vor Kurzem habe ich mein lange verlorenes Keifel wiedergefunden. Es hat mir geholfen, die Wichtigkeit der Bindung und des Vertrauens zu seinen Pokémon zu erkennen.")\bMal sehen, ob du das auch besitzt."8\bNorbert: Du hast dir den Gletscherord