It's glaring at you. You decided to leave it alone.""\bWhere would you like to go?"�\bHello. I used to be a Stats Judge, but my job became obsolete when Trainers became able to see a Pokémon's potential on their own. Now I'm retired..."M\bHold on a minute... your future. It's brilliant! Yes, I can just tell!"6\bTrainer... go out there and find some Pokémon!"0\bI see you achieved that brilliant future."\bCorviknight"\bI need time alone."\bCome to take a break?"Falinks"\bRapidash"/Game Corner\nThe playground for grown-ups!"uHammerlocke\nA city of great history, living and thriving within castle walls that date back to the middle ages."-Hammerlocke Pokémon Gym Leader:\nRaihan"The tamer of dragons!"\\bRaihan trains harder than anyone. He's learned to use all types of weather in battle."Hammerlocke Vault"I\bI wish I could go to Kalos. I hear Mega Evolution is a lot of fun."�\bSo you want to know about Pokémon that used to evolve by trade? Let me break it down for you. Which do you want to know about?"z\bKadabra, Machoke, Graveler, Haunter, Boldore, Gurdurr, Phantump, Pumpkaboo, and Alolan Graveler evolve at level 35."�\bPoliwhirl and Slowpoke evolve in the day when holding a King's Rock. Onix at day with a Metal Coat. Porygon at day with an Upgrade."O\bClamperl at day with a Deep Sea Scale. Feebas at day with a Prism Scale."f\bRhydon at day with a Protector. Magmar at day with a Magmarizer. Spritzee at day with a Sachet."�\bScyther evolves when holding a Metal Coat at night. Seadra at night with a Dragon Scale. Porygon2 at night with a Dubious Disk."/\bClamperl at night with a Deep Sea Tooth."}\bElectabuzz at night with an Electirizer. Dusclops at night with a Reaper Cloth. Swirlix at night with a Whipped Dream."�\bKarrablast evolves when Shelmet or Accelgor are in your party. Shelmet evolves when Karrablast or Escavalier are in your party."0\bCome back again if you want to know more."Wyndon"Wild Area"	Exit"Normal"Item-Day"Item-Night"
