: I lost!? How could that possibly happen?? I demand compensation. A million dollar fine will do."l\bWait! I forgot all about the Honey Tree I set up! I need to go check it. We'll finish this later \PN." Hearthome City\nWarm & Kind"\rKanga"F\bHey, have you seen the Battle Hall? You should go check it out."%\bWoah. You won the Battle Hall."S\bEvery now and then the Battle Hall opens up for Trainers to test themselves."\rPachi"..."\bWhat am I doing here?"*\rHello. The cave ahead is dangerous."x\rHello. The cave is dangerous so I'm using my Abra to teleport people past it. Want to be teleported to Route 207?".\rOkay, but I'm still not letting you in."s\rHello. The cave is dangerous so I'm using my Abra to teleport people past it. You seem really strong though."\bPaul: What do you want?"+\bContests are so much fun, you know!?"Battle Hall"\rOddish"\bAbra"+\bI can't believe the Gym is closed..."$Hearthome Pokémon Contest Hall"Yes"No"Route 207"Mt. Coronet Bottom"Cancel"Mt. Coronet TopIu;␀[["G\rWelcome. This is something special. No, no. No need to thank me.")\rThe look on your face says it all."\rYou use the PC?"\rWonderful. Take this."=\rI'm the one in charge of maintaining the PC in Sinnoh."T\bPoffins are tasty treats to give to Pokémon. They help them out in Contests."R\bSo you want a Poffin? Well you don't even have one Ribbon. Get out of here."H\bI hear some organization has been running around causing trouble."-\bWhat were they called? Team Galvantic?["c\rWillkommen. Das hier ist etwas ganz Besonderes. Nein, nein. Du brauchst mir nicht zu danken."7\rDer Ausdruck in deinem Gesicht sagt schon alles."\rDu benutzt den PC?" \rWunderbar. Nimm das hier."D\rIch bin für die Wartung des PC-Systems in Sinnoh zuständig."Y\bKnurspe sind leckere Belohnungen für Pokémon. Sie helfen ihnen bei Wettbewerben."[\bDu willst also einen Knursp? Du hast ja noch nicht mal ein einziges Band. Raus hier."R\bIch habe gehört, dass eine Organisation hier herumläuft und Ärger macht."3\bWie hießen sie noch gleich? Team Galvantic?;["G\rWelcome. This is something special. No, no. No need to thank me.")\rThe look on your face says it all."\rYou use the PC?"\rWonderful. Take this."=\rI'm the one in charge of maintaining the PC in Sinnoh."T\bPoffins are tasty treats to give to Pokémon. They help them out in Contests."R\bSo you want a Poffin? Well you don't even have one Ribbon. Get out of here."H\bI hear some organization has been running around causing trouble."-\bWhat were they called? Team Galvantic?Iu;␀�[["\bAipom"/\bThis is the best Fan Club in the nation.".\bWhy you ask? \n...Because I believe it."\bHello \PN!"4\bDid you come to hear about my Pokémon again?"\bNo?\nOh well."\rPiplup"+\rIsn't Piplup just the best starter!?"�\bHello. I used to be a Stats Judge, but my job became obsolete when Trainers became able to see a Pokémon's potential on their own. Now I'm retired..."M\bHold on a minute... your future. It's brilliant! Yes, I can just tell!"6\bTrainer... go out there and find some Pokémon!"0\bI see you achieved that brilliant future.["\bGriffel"-\bDies ist der beste Fanclub des Landes."9\bWarum, fragst du? \n...Weil ich fest daran glaube."\bHallo \PN!"H\bBist du gekommen, um wieder etwas über meine Pokémon zu hören?"\bNein?\nNa ja."\rPlinfa"<\rIst Plinfa nicht einfach das beste Starter-Pokémon?!"�\bHallo. Früher war ich ein Richter, aber mein Job wurde überflüssig, als Trainer das Potenzial ihrer Pokémon selbst erkennen konnten. Jetzt bin ich im Ruhestand..."c\bWarte mal einen Moment... deine Zukunft. Sie ist brillant! Ja, das kann ich einfach spüren!":\bTrainer... geh da raus und finde ein paar Pokémon!">\bIch sehe, du hast diese brillante Zukunft verwirklicht.;["\bAipom"/\bThis is the best Fan Club in the nation.".\bWhy you ask? \n...Because I believe it."\bHello \PN!"4\bDid you come to hear about my Pokémon again?"\bNo?\nOh well."\rPiplup"+\rIsn't Piplup just the best starter!?"�\bHello. I used to b