 nicht verlieren."2\rNächstes Mal werde ich besser abschneiden."X\rEs tut mir sehr leid, aber du hast die Anmeldefrist für den Wettbewerb verpasst.")\rMein Training wird sich auszahlen."-\rMinimalismus kann sehr nützlich sein."D\bHmmm... dieser Wettbewerb war speziell. Aber was hat gefehlt?"~\rLucia: Hey \PN. Ich habe den Wettbewerb hier verloren. Das ist mir so peinlich. Aber mach dir keine Sorgen, es geht mir gut."A\rWie lief es in der Arena? Die Arenaleiterin ist weg, oder?"~\rIch habe eine Idee! Warum nehmen wir nicht am Kampfsaal-Turnier teil? Mal sehen, wer von uns beiden besser abschneidet.;["`\bAfter spending years in this town I decided to help out and teach the move, Helping Hand.")\bI can teach it to you if you want?"1\bWhich Pokémon would you like me to teach?"\bCome back anytime!"\rI won't lose." \rI'll do better next time.">\rI'm very sorry, but you missed the deadline to compete." \rMy training will pay off."+\rMinimalism can be used to great use."@\bHmmm... this Contest was something. But what was missing?"h\rDawn: Hey \PN. I lost the Contest here. I'm so embarrassed. No need to worry though, I'm alright."8\rHow did your Gym go? The Gym Leader is gone, huh?"j\rI have an idea! Why don't we enter the Battle Hall tournament? Let's see which of us can do better.Iu;␀d[[$"\bPaul: What do you want?"A\bPaul: So you're my tag partner. You still want to do this?"&\bHmph. Just don't get in my way."3\PN teamed up with Paul!\me[Item get]\wtnp[40]"\bOK then.")\bPaul: Are you ready to keep going?"&\bHmph. Let's just hurry this up."4\PN teamed up with Paul!\se[itemlevel]\wtnp[20]"\bHurry up."I\bIt will be hard to calculate the battles with an unworthy partner."'\bI'm pumped. I can't wait to win."T\bI need to plan ahead. It's hard without knowing much about my partner though."7\rHello. Here you can register for the tournament."e\rIf you register you will be assigned to a Trainer for Tag Battles. Would you like to regester?",\rGreat! Let's set you up for