OtherIu;␀�[["Z\bMy Pokémon has a Bold Nature. It has a higher Defense stat than my other Pokémon."<\bMaybe Nature has something to do with how stats grow?"^\bWant some advice? Catch as many Pokémon as you can. Numbers will carry you to victory."6\bYou're a Trainer. This might help you out then."<\bYou can't just throw them. Weaken it in battle first."o\rI've told my husband so many times before. Numbers are good but trust and individual training is better.["p\bMein Pokémon hat ein kühnes Wesen. Es hat einen höheren Verteidigungs-Wert als meine anderen Pokémon."J\bVielleicht hat das Wesen etwas damit zu tun, wie die Werte wachsen?"n\bWillst du einen Rat? Fang so viele Pokémon wie möglich. Die schiere Menge wird dich zum Sieg führen."A\bDu bist ein Trainer. Dann wird dir das hier sicher helfen."H\bDu kannst sie nicht einfach werfen. Schwäche es zuerst im Kampf."y\rIch habe es meinem Mann schon so oft gesagt. Menge ist gut, aber Vertrauen und individuelles Training sind besser.;["Z\bMy Pokémon has a Bold Nature. It has a higher Defense stat than my other Pokémon."<\bMaybe Nature has something to do with how stats grow?"^\bWant some advice? Catch as many Pokémon as you can. Numbers will carry you to victory."6\bYou're a Trainer. This might help you out then."<\bYou can't just throw them. Weaken it in battle first."o\rI've told my husband so many times before. Numbers are good but trust and individual training is better.Iu;␀�[[$"U\rIn Unova we have our Mart inside the Centers. It saves on space for our towns."\rGreat, let's begin!"F\rMy Elgyem can Teleport you. However, he is too tired right now."<\rMy Elgyem can Teleport you.\ch[1,-1,Striaton, Cancel]"D\rMy Elgyem can Teleport you.\ch[1,-1,Striaton, Nacrene,Cancel]"M\rMy Elgyem can Teleport you.\ch[1,-1,Striaton, Nacrene,Castelia,Cancel]"U\rMy Elgyem can Teleport you.\ch[1,-1,Striaton, Nacrene,Castelia,Nimbasa,Cancel]"_\rMy Elgyem can Teleport you.\ch[1,-1,Striaton, Nacrene,Castelia,Nimbasa,Driftveil,Can