ert."�\rÜber den Pokérus ist nur wenig bekannt, außer dass es sich um mikroskopisch kleine Lebensformen handelt, die sich an Pokémon festsetzen."I\rEs heißt, dass infizierte Pokémon außergewöhnlich gut wachsen."%\rVielen Dank für deine Geduld."<\rWir haben deine Pokémon wieder vollständig geheilt."+\rWir hoffen, dich bald wiederzusehen!"=\rZuerst solltest du deine Pokémon vollständig heilen."2\rDeine Pokémon wurden vollständig geheilt."\rViel Erfolg!"\rOhrdoch"Ja"	Nein;[";\rI'm ready to go battle Lenora. Is she far from here?"\rGreat, let's begin!"�\rMy Jigglypuff can Teleport you.\ch[1,-1,Accumula, Striaton,Nacrene,Castelia,Nimbasa,Driftveil,Mistralton, Icirrus,Virbank,Undella,Opelucid,Cancel]"\rJigglypuff"1\rHello, and welcome to the Pokémon Center."5\rWe restore your tired Pokémon to full health.",\rWould you like to rest your Pokémon?"5\rOK, I'll take your Pokémon for a few seconds."0\rYour Pokémon may be infected by PokeRus."m\rLittle is known about the PokeRus except that they are microscopic life-forms that attach to Pokémon."D\rWhile infected, Pokémon are said to grow exceptionally well."\rThank you for waiting."3\rWe've restored your Pokémon to full health." \rWe hope to see you again!">\rFirst, you should restore your Pokémon to full health."8\rYour Pokémon have been healed to perfect health."\rWe hope you excel!"\rAudino"Yes"NoIu;␀O[[ "m\bCheren: Hello there. I'm sorry, but the gym is still under construction. Come back when it's finished."z\bOh, \PN. Professor Juniper told me about you. I'm sure you will be an interesting challenge. Don't prove her wrong."O\bCheren: Unfortunately I can't give you a badge, but I can give you this."r\bTM79 contains Thrash. The attacks lasts for two or three turns, with the user becoming confused afterwards."W\bCheren: Feel free to enter the White Ruins. You seem strong enough to handle it."Choose a status option."-A Pokémon can't attack if it is asleep."2Pokémon will stay asleep even after battles."+Us