[1,-1,Lumiose, Santalune,Camphrier,Cyllage,Geosenge,Shalour, Laverre,Dendemille,Anistar,Couriway,Snowbelle,Exit]"\bExeggcute"1\rHello, and welcome to the Pokémon Center."5\rWe restore your tired Pokémon to full health.",\rWould you like to rest your Pokémon?"5\rOK, I'll take your Pokémon for a few seconds."0\rYour Pokémon may be infected by PokeRus."m\rLittle is known about the PokeRus except that they are microscopic life-forms that attach to Pokémon."D\rWhile infected, Pokémon are said to grow exceptionally well."\rThank you for waiting."3\rWe've restored your Pokémon to full health." \rWe hope to see you again!">\rFirst, you should restore your Pokémon to full health."8\rYour Pokémon have been healed to perfect health."\rWe hope you excel!"\rWigglytuff"Yes"NoIu;␀[[["\bIt's my turn." \bRamos is waiting for you."\rI've got you now."8\rI can never stop a trainer from getting to Ramos."�\bRamos: Welcome to my gym. I hope you enjoyed the nature as you came here. There won't be any time to look now that you've come to me.",\bRamos: You've earned the Plant Badge."\bHere, have this TM too."Y\bTM116 contains Petal Dance. It attacks for multiple turns and leaves you confused."w\bRamos: You have the quickness of youth but the skill of a master. Be sure to remember to take it slow sometimes."+\rAnd out of nowhere comes a champion."V\rI was supposed to be the champion. I was going to challenge Ramos after this..."j\bRamos uses Grass type Pokémon. They are weak against the Bug, Fire, Poison, Flying, and Ice types."{\bThey are strong against Water, Ground, and Rock. Electirc, Grass, Ground, and Water moves also don't do much damage."+\bDidn't think you would challenge me.":\bDon't rush. You may miss the path you want to take.["\bIch bin an der Reihe."#\bAmaro wartet schon auf dich."\rJetzt hab ich dich."J\rIch kann niemals einen Trainer daran hindern, zu Amaro zu gelangen."�\bAmaro: Willkommen in meiner Arena. Ich hoffe, du hast die Natur auf dem Weg hierher genossen. Jetzt, wo du vor mir stehst, bleibt dafür keine Zeit mehr."5\bAmaro: Du hast dir den Pflanzenorden verdient." \bHier, nimm auch diese TM."i\bTM116 enthält Blättertanz. Die Attacke hält mehrere Runden an und verwirrt den Anwender danach."�\bAmaro: Du besitzt die Schnelligkeit der Jugend, aber das Geschick eines Meisters. Vergiss aber nicht, es manchmal auch langsam angehen zu lassen."3\rUnd wie aus dem Nichts taucht ein Champ auf."\\rEigentlich sollte ich der Champ sein. Ich wollte Amaro gleich danach herausfordern..."m\bAmaro setzt Pflanzen-Pokémon ein. Sie sind schwach gegen die Typen Käfer, Feuer, Gift, Flug und Eis."�\bSie sind stark gegen Wasser, Boden und Gestein. Elektro-, Pflanzen-, Boden- und Wasser-Attacken richten zudem kaum Schaden an."9\bHätte nicht gedacht, dass du mich herausforderst."a\bÜberstürze nichts. Sonst verpasst du womöglich den Weg, den du eigentlich gehen willst.;["\bIt's my turn." \bRamos is waiting for you."\rI've got you now."8\rI can never stop a trainer from getting to Ramos."�\bRamos: Welcome to my gym. I hope you enjoyed the nature as you came here. There won't be any time to look now that you've come to me.",\bRamos: You've earned the Plant Badge."\bHere, have this TM too."Y\bTM116 contains Petal Dance. It attacks for multiple turns and leaves you confused."w\bRamos: You have the quickness of youth but the skill of a master. Be sure to remember to take it slow sometimes."+\rAnd out of nowhere comes a champion."V\rI was supposed to be the champion. I was going to challenge Ramos after this..."j\bRamos uses Grass type Pokémon. They are weak against the Bug, Fire, Poison, Flying, and Ice types."{\bThey are strong against Water, Ground, and Rock. Electirc, Grass, Ground, and Water moves also don't do much damage."+\bDidn't think you would challenge me.":\bDon't rush. You may miss the path you want to take.Iu;␀R[["'\bTime to dance my way to victory."'\bI just earned the Voltage badge.")\rI will stop anyone who does wrong."+\rShould I keep my feelings to myself?"\bYou should take a break.")\bLove is nice to have in your life."$\bThe Lumiose Gym will be mine.""\bWhy does this happen to me?"\rTime to smile!"D\rYou seem promising. Not as much as Serena, but you have some.["1\bZeit, mir meinen Weg zum Sieg zu ertanzen."1\bIch habe gerade den Ampere-Orden gewonnen."2\rIch werde jeden aufhalten, der Unrecht tut.";\rSollte ich meine Gefühle lieber für mich behalten?"%\bDu solltest eine Pause machen."5\bEs ist schön, Liebe in seinem Leben zu haben.":\bDie Arena von Illumina City wird bald mir gehören."+\bWarum passiert mir das nur ständig?"\rZeit für ein Lächeln!"Q\rDu wirkst vielversprechend. Nicht so sehr wie Serena, aber du hast Talent.;["'\bTime to dance my way to victory."'\bI just earned the Voltage badge.")\rI will stop anyone who does wrong."+\rShould I keep my feelings to myself?"\bYou should take a break.")\bLove is nice to have in your life."$\bThe Lumiose Gym will be mine.""\bWhy does this happen to me?"\rTime to smile!"D\rYou seem promising. Not as much as Serena, but you have some.Iu;␀J[[("\\bEach elevator leads to a different floor. Pick the right one to fight the gym leader."\bHeliolosk")\bI guess it's my job to defeat you."@\bYou might fight Clemont yet. If you pick the right floor.",\bThis leads to the top of Prism Tower."0\rBonnie: Hi \PN! Did you come to visit us?"\bLuxray"\bTime to finish this."=\bThe right floor will take you to the top of the tower."\bDedenne!"W\bClemont uses Electric type Pokémon. They are weak against only the Ground type."m\bThey are strong against Flying and Water. Flying, Electric, and Steel moves also don't do much damage."#\bLooks like you picked wrong."%\bLooks like you won. This time."�\bClemont: It's finally time \PN. I've been waiting for this battle for a long time. I'm determined to give you a worthy fight. Let's begin."0\bClemont: You've earned the Voltage Badge."\bHere, have this TM too."G\bTM115 contains Shock Wave. An electric attack that never misses."�\bClemont: That was an outstanding battle \PN. Bonnie and I are going to keep traveling for a while. I want to be able to stand on the same level as you."l\bClemont: It's good to see you again. I've been practicing everyday to grow as a Trainer and inventor."�\bClemont: \PN. I'm glad you had time to stop by before your match. I've been working on some battling techniques that should help you."7\bAfter all, the future is now, thanks to science!"d\bClemont: Well, the results weren't what I expected. But I should expect that coming from you."K\rBonnie: You both did great! You're going to win your match for sure."0\bYou should hurry over. We'll be watching."9\bClemont: You should hurry over. We'll be watching."Q\bClemont: Wonderful timing, \PN. I was in need of someone to help me train."H\bClemont: That was a great battle. I look forward to our next one."\bBunnelby"\bDiggersby"Magnemite"\bNot going to happen."=\bClemont uses Electric types. Use a ground type to win."\bChespin"Magneton[("p\bJeder Aufzug führt in ein anderes Stockwerk. Wähle den richtigen, um gegen den Arenaleiter zu kämpfen."\bElezard"8\bSchätze, es ist meine Aufgabe, dich zu besiegen."^\bVielleicht darfst du noch gegen Citro kämpfen. Wenn du das richtige Stockwerk wählst."/\bHier geht es zur Spitze des Prismaturms."@\rHeureka: Hallo \PN! Bist du gekommen, um uns zu besuchen?"\bLuxtra"\bBringen wir es zu Ende."A\bDas richtige Stockwerk bringt dich ganz nach oben im Turm."\bDedenne!"T\bCitro setzt Elektro-Pokémon ein. Sie sind nur gegen den Typ Boden anfällig."n\bSie sind stark gegen Flug und Wasser. Flug-, Elektro- und Stahl-Attacken richten zudem kaum Schaden an."5\bSieht so aus, als hättest du falsch gewählt."A\bSieht so aus, als hättest du gewonnen. Diesmal zumindest."�\bCitro: Endlich ist es soweit, \PN. Ich habe lange auf diesen Kampf gewartet. Ich bin fest entschlossen, dir einen würdigen Kampf zu liefern. Fangen wir an!"4\bCitro: Du hast