."=\rJasmine: That battle was fun. I'm so glad we did this."#\rOlivia: Back for more I see."1\rOlivia: I look forward to the next battle."<\rSkyla: My Air Battle has already told me the outcome."F\rSkyla: I guess I need to battle to figure out the real outcome.":\bCress: I'm about to serve up a mouth savoring meal."+\bCress: You served up a real beating."&\bBrawly: Time to ride the waves."I\bBrawly: Come visit the island sometime. The waves are great there."6\bSiebold: Let me cook you up something tasteful."c\bSiebold: If I wasn't up to your tastes try one of the other members of the Kalos Elite Four."0\bGiovanni: This time victory will be mine."%\bGiovanni: Leave while you can.")\bBrandon: You don't stand a chance."7\bBrandon: Continue to love and support your team."\rDrasna: Back for more?"+\rDrasna: I suppose you won this time."$\bMarlon: Let's ride the waves."&\bMarlon: That was a sick battle."7\rCissy: I've trained hard. I think I can do this."'\rCissy: I'm going to get tougher." \bNanu:... So, you're back?"'\bNanu: Give me some time to rest."%\bBrock: Time for a battle, \PN.")\bBrock: Good to see you again, \PN."(\bWulfric: Think you can handle it?"1\bWulfric: Your power is always at its peak.">\bLance: We meet again. It's time I tested you in battle."D\bLance: I'm impressed. You're deserving of the Champion title."Y\bWikstrom: It is a pleasure to see you again. Let us fight with chivalry and honor."A\bWikstrom: I enjoyed our fight. Continue to train yourself."*\bClay: You think you stand a chance?"-\bClay: It was all luck and you know it.".\rAnabel: Does your connection beat mine?"4\rAnabel: Even my psychic powers were no match."\bLeon: Champion time!"F\bLeon: As strong as ever. The rush you give me is like no other."&\bLt. Surge: So the punk is back.">\bLt. Surge: So you beat me again. It won't happen again."\rMaylene: Full power!"+\rMaylene: I just need to work harder.")\rRoxie: Let's turn it up to eleven."+\rRoxie: That battle spoke to my soul."$\bDanny: Good to see you again."4\bDanny: Don't worry about it. I'll get better."9\rHapu: Maybe this time I can give you a good fight."\rHapu: Come back soon."$\bRoark: Let's bring the power."@\bRoark: That battle was intense. Can't wait for next time."#\bBrycen: Let's set the stage."5\bBrycen: This is very different from the stage.")\bAlder:... Oh, is it time to fight?"\bAlder:..."%\bBlaine: Back for more are you?"C\bBlaine: Not even the best tricks can get me out of that one."\bSpenser: Let us begin."B\bSpenser: Don't get frustrated. Let your partners guide you."0\bWattson: Wahahaha. About time we do this.")\bWattson: Wahaha. I just can't win."*\rWhitney: Don't make me get serious.".\rWhitney: Don't think that this is over."3\bSteven: Well \PN, let's test each other out.""\bSteven: Please return soon."*It's your spot. Don't you feel proud?"1\rRoxanne: See if you can teach me anything."=\rRoxanne: Stop by and visit the school anytime you can.";\rCandice: What are we waiting for? Let's get started!"9\rCandice: I guess I battled a little too seriously."f\bDrake: I'm ready whenever you are. I'll represent the entire Hoenn Elite Four in their absence."4\bDrake: Don't think my age has slowed me down."\bKoga: Strike swiftly."'\bKoga: Victory goes to the swift."2\bDrake: Let's see what two champions can do."9\bDanny: It's always good to find a good challenger."2\bChili: I'm gonna serve up a scorching meal."+\bChili: You served up a real beating."*\rNurse Joy: You should take a break."H\rOh, good! You and your Pokémon are looking great. Take care now!"@\bVolkner: Good to see you again. Let's make this exciting."4\bVolkner: That was a rush. Come back any time.",\bNorman: Welcome. I hope you're ready."#\bNorman: You did a great job."R\bWallace: I may love contests, but I can battle just as well as anyone else."4\bWallace: We should do a performance together."'\bGrant: Time to climb to the top."3\bGrant: You've climbed high up in this world.""\bPryce: Don't hold back now."9\bPryce: It's rare to find a Trainer as good as you."+\rBertha: I figured I'd see you again."6\rBertha: You won't catch me off guard next time."O\bDrayden: You hold a lot of potential. Let me see if I can help you grow."%\bDrayden: You've gotten better."*\bRudy: Don't think I'm holding back."/\bRudy: Come back when you're even better."/\rIris: Hi \PN! Back to battle a Champion?"T\rIris: I think we're both improving. Try to bring more Dragon types next time."(\rElesa: Let's make this beautiful.">\rElesa: Come back any time to show me a stunning battle."+\rLenora: I guess I can give it a try."Q\rLenora: Impressive. Keep training like that and become a champion one day."K\rCynthia: At long last I get to try you on myself. Are you ready \PN?"`\rCynthia: Keep traveling and discovering new things. It will help you out in the long run."P\rFlannery: I'm ready... I mean I'm going to... Whatever. Let's just fight."0\rFlannery: I just need some more practice." \rLuana: Have you improved?"7\rLuana: There are still some surprises after all."A\bBugsy: I've done some research. I think I've got this one."0\bBugsy: It's okay. I'll just study harder."(\bFlint: I'm ready for a good time."U\bFlint: I wish we could battle with more options. You give me a real challenge."D\rClair: Welcome. Think you are still strong enough to beat me?"F\rClair: It's amazing how you keep getting stronger and stronger."C\rBea: Trainer of Pikachu. I've trained hard for this rematch."%\rBea: I will continue to train."@\bCheren: Now that I'm ready let me show you my true power."/\bCheren: There's nothing I can teach you."\bClemont: I'm ready, \PN."B\bClemont: You did great, \PN. I'll do even better next time."4\bAaron: The power of my team will destroy you."\bAaron: Rematch anytime."8\bNoland: You'll never know what to expect with me."1\bNoland: It's okay. I'll just study harder."&\rSabrina: I knew you would come.".\rSabrina: I wonder what I should do now?"'\rValerie: Victory to the elegant."A\rValerie: That battle was very elegant. I congratulate you.".\rViola: I'll take a picture after I win.">\rViola: Let me take a picture to celebrate your victory."\bAllister: R-Ready."#\bAllister: U-Until next time.",\bMorty: Show me the power you possess."*\bMorty: What do I need to do to win?"R\rLorelei: I think you deserve a second chance. Prepare to be frozen in fear."6\rLorelei: I look forward to your next challenge."&\rErika: Time for another battle."#\rErika: That was pretty good."@\bLucian: It's very nice to meet you. Shall we get started?"w\bLucian: Not every Elite Four member shows up for this. At the very least we have all of the Sinnoh members here."5\bTate: Do you think... \rLiza: You can beat us?"4\bTate: I can't believe... \rLiza: You beat us.".\rGreta: Let's give it a fighting chance!"&\rGreta: We went out with a bang."(\rMisty: I'm not going easy on you."/\rMisty: How do I keep losing to you, \PN?"*\bBurgh: Time for a magnificent show."F\bBurgh: That battle was amazing. I look forward to the next one."\bRaihan: I'll crush you.",\bRaihan: Not good enough for Leon yet."C\rAgatha: Good to see you again child. I won't go easy on you."Y\rAgatha: You did well. Challenge someone else, all of the Kanto Elite Four is here."\bFalkner: Time to soar."+\bFalkner: You continue to impress me."(\rGardenia: I hope you're prepared."U\rGardenia: What did you think of the Cacnea I use? I'm training it for someone."&\rFantina: Bonjour. Let us begin."&\rFantina: Amazing! Just amazing!"q\rCaitlin: I don't believe we have met. My name is Caitlin, a member of the Unova Elite Four. Are you ready?"+\rCaitlin: That looked well rehearsed."G\bTucker: We may not have a crowd but we will still put on a show."\bTucker: Until next time."0\bJuan: Prepare, for it is time to face me!""\bJuan: A spectacular battle!"2\rKorrina: I'm gonna wipe the floor with you."1\rKorrina: Lucario and I will win next time.""\bPiers: A battle? I suppose."\bPiers: You did well."1\bBruno: I've been waiting for your arrival."0\bBruno: Come back after I've trained more."\rWinona: Are you ready?":\rWinona: Excellent job. You show mastery of the air."P\bCilan: \PN, allow me to serve you a variety of spices for today's course."0\bCilan: You served up a real beating, \PN.",\bByron: Think you can beat my defense?"6\bByron: You might be good enough to beat my son."#\bHala: Time for another test."\bHala: Come back anytime.[�"#\bMarinus: Hahaha! Los geht's!"K\bMarinus: Komm zurück und versuch es noch mal, wann immer du willst."/\bHartwig: Glaubst du, du bist hart genug?"\\bHartwig: Gegen ein Kind zu verlieren... Die nächste Generation macht sich prächtig."�\rMalva: Ich habe gehört, du warst in Illumina City, als Team Flare angriff. Ich selbst war mal ein Mitglied, aber das ist vorbei. Stark bin ich trotzdem noch."7\rMalva: Kein Wunder, dass Flordelis verloren hat."1\rAstrid: Hast du mir etwas Neues zu zeigen?"?\rAstrid: Es gibt also doch noch ein paar Überraschungen.".\rLotte: Ist das Glück auf deiner Seite?",\rLotte: Vielleicht beim nächsten Mal."/\rOpal: Oh? Bereit für ein weiteres Quiz?")\rOpal: Ich bin müde geworden. Geh."g\rDiantha: Warum überrascht es mich nicht, dich hier zu sehen, \PN? Ich schätze, ich bin bereit."^\rDiantha: Wenn ich mein volles Team gegen dich einsetzen würde, wäre ich unaufhaltsam."4\bAmaro: Du willst wohl noch mal, wie ich sehe."1\bAmaro: Das hast du gut gemacht, mein Kind."8\rJasmin: Gehen wir es ganz ruhig und entspannt an."X\rJasmin: Dieser Kampf hat Spaß gemacht. Ich bin froh, dass wir das gemacht haben."0\rMayla: Wieder da für mehr, wie ich sehe.";\rMayla: Ich freue mich schon auf den nächsten Kampf."G\rGéraldine: Mein Luftkampf hat mir den Ausgang bereits verraten."_\rGéraldine: Schätze, ich muss doch richtig kämpfen, um den wahren Ausgang zu erfahren."A\bColin: Ich serviere dir gleich eine schmackhafte Mahlzeit.">\bColin: Du hast mir eine ordentliche Abreibung serviert."+\bKamillo: Zeit, die Wellen zu reiten."O\bKamillo: Besuch uns mal auf der Insel. 