 Welcome. I hope you're ready."#\bNorman: You did a great job."R\bWallace: I may love contests, but I can battle just as well as anyone else."4\bWallace: We should do a performance together."'\bGrant: Time to climb to the top."3\bGrant: You've climbed high up in this world.""\bPryce: Don't hold back now."9\bPryce: It's rare to find a Trainer as good as you."+\rBertha: I figured I'd see you again."6\rBertha: You won't catch me off guard next time."O\bDrayden: You hold a lot of potential. Let me see if I can help you grow."%\bDrayden: You've gotten better."*\bRudy: Don't think I'm holding back."/\bRudy: Come back when you're even better."/\rIris: Hi \PN! Back to battle a Champion?"T\rIris: I think we're both improving. Try to bring more Dragon types next time."(\rElesa: Let's make this beautiful.">\rElesa: Come back any time to show me a stunning battle."+\rLenora: I guess I can give it a try."Q\rLenora: Impressive. Keep training like that and become a champion one day."K\rCynthia: At long last I get to try you on myself. Are you ready \PN?"`\rCynthia: Keep traveling and discovering new things. It will help you out in the long run."P\rFlannery: I'm ready... I mean I'm going to... Whatever. Let's just fight."0\rFlannery: I just need some more practice." \rLuana: Have you improved?"7\rLuana: There are still some surprises after all."A\bBugsy: I've done some research. I think I've got this one."0\bBugsy: It's okay. I'll just study harder."(\bFlint: I'm ready for a good time."U\bFlint: I wish we could battle with more options. You give me a real challenge."D\rClair: Welcome. Think you are still strong enough to beat me?"F\rClair: It's amazing how you keep getting stronger and stronger."C\rBea: Trainer of Pikachu. I've trained hard for this rematch."%\rBea: I will continue to train."@\bCheren: Now that I'm ready let me show you my true power."/\bCheren: There's nothing I can teach you."\bClemont: I'm ready, \PN."B\bClemont: You did great, \PN. I'll do even better next time."4\bAaron: The power of my team will destroy you."\bAaron: Rematch anytime."8\bNoland: You'll never know what to expect with me."1\bNoland: It's okay. I'll just study harder."&\rSabrina: I knew you would come.".\rSabrina: I wonder what I should do now?"'\rValerie: Victory to the elegant."A\rValerie: That battle was very elegant. I congratulate you.".\rViola: I'll take a picture after I win.">\rViola: Let me take a picture to celebrate your victory."\bAllister: R-Ready."#\bAllister: U-Until next time.",\bMorty: Show me the power you possess."*\bMorty: What do I need to do to win?"R\rLorelei: I think you deserve a second chance. Prepare to be frozen in fear."6\rLorelei: I look forward to your next challenge."&\rErika: Time for another battle."#\rErika: That was pretty good."@\bLucian: It's very nice to meet you. Shall we get started?"w\bLucian: Not every Elite Four member shows up for this. At the very least we have all of the Sinnoh members here."5\bTate: Do you think... \rLiza: You can beat us?"4\bTate: I can't believe... \rLiza: You beat us.".\rGreta: Let's give it a fighting chance!"&\rGreta: We went out with a bang."(\rMisty: I'm not going easy on you."/\rMisty: How do I keep losing to you, \PN?"*\bBurgh: Time for a magnificent show."F\bBurgh: That battle was amazing. I look forward to the next one."\bRaihan: I'll crush you.",\bRaihan: Not good enough for Leon yet."C\rAgatha: Good to see you again child. I won't go easy on you."Y\rAgatha: You did well. Challenge someone else, all of the Kanto Elite Four is here."\bFalkner: Time to soar."+\bFalkner: You continue to impress me."(\rGardenia: I hope you're prepared."U\rGardenia: What did you think of the Cacnea I use? I'm training it for someone."&\rFantina: Bonjour. Let us begin."&\rFantina: Amazing! Just amazing!"q\rCaitlin: I don't believe we have met. My name is Caitlin, a member of the Unova Elite Four. Are you ready?"+\rCaitlin: That looked well rehearsed."G\bTucker: We may not have a crowd but we will st