e is going to be a joke. I'll just crush you there."J\rLana: I'm going to fish up the biggest Pokémon. Just wait and see."W\rLana: Hi \PN. You just missed my new friend, Dewpider. I didn't catch it though."ARotom Dex: Mallow will be in her dad's shop in Hau'oli City."9\rLana: Let's battle again soon. I know you like it."P\bSophocles: Don't bother me right now. I'm working on something important."9\rYou're the new student? The school isn't this way."�\bKukui: You didn't have to step in there; I could have handled him. Keep your eyes open. I doubt that's the last we'll see of Guzma."(\bFor now, why don't you head home?"\rPopplio"\rPikipek"\rTrumbeak"\rToucannon">Zeraora seems to want to come with you. Will you take it?"\bMr. Mime"\rTogedemaru"\bTurtonator" Rotom Dex: Let's head home."nRotom Dex: ...I just received a message from the professor. He said to head to the school for a surprise."KRotom Dex: ...Wait, did you here that in the school? Head back inside."aRotom Dex: I just received word of another Ultra Beast being spotted. Let's head to Route 3."I\bI love living so close to the beach. Nice to come home and unwind."g\bTupp: Yo, what's this? You think you're better than us? I say instead you give us your Pokémon."\rYo yo."\rThat isn't fair."U\rI wish they would get rid of that grass already. Makes it so hard to get home.".\bKiawe: Let's try that again Turtonator."G\bKiawe: Lillie wanted to talk with you. I'll be ready afterwards."r\bKiawe: I'm going to take you to my home on Akala Island. I know you've wanted to explore the other islands."1\bTalk to Charizard when you're ready to go."Akala Island"	Exit"Paniola Ranch"Paniola"Wela Volcano"Ten Carat"Yes"No"Hau'oli City[X"2\bEs ist schade, dass die Brücke kaputt ist.";\bSieht so aus, als hätten sie die Brücke repariert."3\rKannst mich jetzt nicht mehr aufhalten, was?"-\rDas wird nicht noch mal passieren, Yo."k\bDies ist der beste Ort zum Abhängen. Auf dem Rest der Insel ist zu viel los, um sich zu en