oing for you?"F\bSamson: My egg hatched into a Kantoian Vulpix. What a surprise."\bSamson: zzz..."T\bSamson: I feel so much more alert. Ready to run this school with a new vigor."I\bSamson: The Pokémon League has begun. Perhaps I'll see you there."5\bSamson: The league sure was full of surprises."V\bSamson: Enjoy your holiday, \PN. I hope you'll come back one day to see us all."\rTogedemaru"%Your Pokémon were fully healed."\rVulpix"C\bMohn: Being here really brings me back. So much has changed."P\rMallow: I hear you're from Kanto! I bet you have a bunch of cool stories."=\rMallow: So it's me then. Don't be sorry when you lose."K\rMallow: Maybe you can come over some time and experience my cooking."T\rMallow: Looking at the eggs just makes me want to go home and cook some food.":\rMallow: I wonder if there is good food to be found?".\rMallow: I hope to see some Grass types!"/\rMallow: I wonder what we will see there."5\rMallow: Poor Steenee isn't going to like this."6\rMallow: I'm prepared to hunt some Ultra Beasts."3\rMallow: We have to do something to fix this."S\rMallow: Lana's sneaky. She organized the whole thing without anyone knowing."-\rMallow: Maybe I should cook something."k\rMallow: I think I'll leave Tsareena here. It should be fine if I travel without any Pokémon, right?"2\rMallow: A league, huh? I guess I'll try it."\rMallow: Morning.":\rMallow: Come see the restaurant when you have time."H\rMallow: Alola, \PN. I worked hours on making a good meal for you."5\rMallow: Don't think I'll lose without a fight.")\rMallow: We'll see you soon, right?"E\rMallow: I'm so happy Lillie and her family are together again."\bMarowak"Yes"NoIu;␀c9[[m"#\bKukui: Welcome back, cousin."R\bKukui: Welcome home, \PN. I'm guessing a battle is what you're looking for."#\bKukui: Looking good, cousin."1Rotom: Good morning. Time to head to school."\bRockruff"\bLycan!"@\bKukui: I've got nothing for you today. Enjoy the day off."&Rotom Dex: Let's go visit Lillie."8\bKukui: I've got nothing for today. Get some rest."*\bKukui: Good job beating your trial."3\bKukui: Head over to Sophocles's house today."\bKukui: Time for bed."G\bKukui: Hope you had fun in your hometown. Better get some sleep.">\bKukui: You have a free day today. Do whatever you want."9Rotom Dex: Let's explore the forest near the school!"p\bKukui: What you find there, cousin? I wish I could tell you, but I've never seen anything like it before."4\bWe'll take it to some professionals tomorrow.";\bKukui: We'll take it to some professionals tomorrow."4\bKukui: What a fun day. Get some sleep cousin."a\bKukui: It's good to see you're okay. I was worried. We can just do today's plans tomorrow."i\bKukui: It's good to see you're okay. I was worried. I guess we can just do today's plans tomorrow."b\bKukui: Today I want you to head back the the Aether Paradise. They have some news on Nebby."�\bKukui: Lillie has already stopped by and told us her plan. We are all going to Poni Island to catch up with her. Head to the boat when you're ready."8\bKukui: Good job \PN. I hear everyone is safe now."F\bKukui: Bit cold today, wasn't it? Well tomorrow is another day."0\bKukui: Getting the Ultra Beast went well."~\bKukui: I want you to go to the Royal Avenue today and experience their kind of battle firsthand. It's east of Paniola Ranch."O\bKukui: What's did you think of that Masked Royal? What a strong Trainer."n\bKukui: I heard there was an Ultra Beast wandering the island. See if you can't find it, Ultra Guardian."ORotom Dex: Using my scanner I found an unknown Pokémon inside the school!")\bKukui: So you found it? Great job."}\bKukui: You're awake. I have some exciting news for you. Ula'ula Island's Island Kahuna has some free time for a challenger."U\bHead over to the ship in Hau'oli. I'll inform the class on where you're going."\bLitten"\bTorracat"\bIncineroar")Rotom Dex: Let's head to the school."Poipole!">\bKukui: Alola! So you're \PN. Glad to have you on board."8\bThis is my home. Let me show you around a little."T\bThat there is Rockruff. It's a friendly guy who I'm sure you'll grow to love."\bRockruff!"9\bOh right, your bed is the one closest to the door."o\bThis is a Rotom Dex. I figured it would be a nice companion for you to have while you're here. Enjoy it."_\bKukui: Two Ultra Beasts have been seen in the area. I suggest you hurry up and get them."4Rotom Dex: My scanners say they are on Route 2."\bRow... let"It's a Pokédex."YRotom: Hello there \PN. Nice to meet you. I look forward to our adventures together."6You got the Rotom Pokédex.\me[Item get]\wtnp[40]"D\bKukui: Let's go meet your classmates now that you have Rotom."8\bKukui: It's been a fun day. Better get some rest."�\bKukui: For today I have a different assignment for you. I want you to go meet up with Lana in Hau'oli City. She's going to take you fishing."f\bKukui: Seems like you had a fun day. I've got something fun for you tomorrow so get some sleep."\\bKukui: For today I want you to meet up with Sophocles. He'll be in the shopping mall."!\bKukui: Get some sleep \PN."M\bKukui: I'm guessing you won. Great job cousin! I knew you could do it."�\bRockruff has been excited ever since you left. I think it wants to join your team. I'd be fine letting the litte guy go with you."?\bTomorrow's another day though. Be sure to get some rest."F\bKukui: Tomorrow's another day though. Be sure to get some rest."b\bKukui: Head over to Lillie's today. After that I want you to meet with Kiawe at the school."P\bKukui: Have fun today? I've got another fun day planned for you tomorrow.">\bKukui: Today I want you to meet with Mallow on Route 3."t\bKukui: Have a fun day? I hope so. I was wondering if you noticed the Litten that's been wandering the island?"E\bMight be a good idea to talk to it. Maybe you can cheer it up."t\bKukui: Have a fun day? I hope so. I was wondering if you noticed the Litten that's been wondering the island?"ERotom Dex: You're awake. Let's go to the market in Hau'o