Landing on this tile will teleport you to another Warp Tile on the map that is linked to this one."}This is a Locked Door Tile.
A locked door prevents movement on this path unless you have acquired a Lair Key to open it."vOpening the door will clear the tile, and allow you to proceed. However, this will consume one of your Lair Keys."kThis is a Roadblock Tile.
An obstacle prevents movement on this path unless you meet certain criteria."�Once the obstacle's criteria has been met, this tile will become cleared and you will not be required to clear the obstacle again."�This is a Switch Tile.
Landing on this tile will flip all switches to the ON position, revealing hidden tiles that are normally inactive."�Landing on a Switch Tile that is already in the ON position will revert all switches to the OFF position, and any revealed tiles will return to their inactive state."qThis is a Random Turn Tile.
Passing over this tile may force you into changing course in a random direction."zThis is a Flip Turn Tile.
Landing on this tile will force you to reverse course and travel in the opposite direction."nThis is a Directional Tile.
Passing over this tile will force you to move in the direction it's pointing."�There's a Scientist on this tile.
Scientists have additional rental Pokémon you may add to your party by swapping out an existing party member."[After encountering a Scientist, they will leave the map and this tile will be cleared."�There's a Backpacker on this tile.
Backpackers carry a random assortment of items that may be given to your party Pokémon to hold."�There's a Blackbelt on this tile.
Blackbelts have secret training techniques that can power up particular stats of your party Pokémon."�There's an Ace Trainer on this tile.
Ace Trainers can tutor your party Pokémon to teach one of them a new move for a strategical advantage."oThere's a Channeler on this tile.
Channelers will raise your spirit, increasing your heart counter by one."[After encountering a Channeler, they will leave the map and this tile will be cleared."\There's a Nurse on this tile.
Nurses will heal your party Pokémon back to full health."WAfter encountering a Nurse, they will leave the map and this tile will be cleared."NIt's a mystery who's on this tile.
You'll never know who you'll run into!"cAfter encountering this mystery person, they will leave the map and this tile will be cleared."�There's a pile of Berries on this tile.
If you land on this tile, you'll feed your party Pokémon the Berries to recover some HP."?This tile will become cleared after consuming the Berries."�There's a Lair Key on this tile.
If you land on this tile, you'll collect the key and increase your total number of Lair Keys by one."AThis tile will become cleared after collecting the Lair Key."}There's a Treasure Chest on this tile.
If you land on this tile, you'll open the chest and discover the treasure within."LThis tile will become cleared after the Treasure Chest has been opened."'Which path would you like to take?"-Are you sure you want to take this path?"ZEnd your Dynamax Adventure?
